#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Precedence"
msgstr "Prioritas"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The following general precedence rules are applied when multiple of the above options provide metadata:"
msgstr "Aturan prioritas umum berikut diterapkan ketika ada beberapa opsi di atas yang menyediakan metadata:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The metadata file (i. e. `<fdroiddata>/metadata/<packageId>.yml`) overwrites *fdroiddata* files, even localized ones."
msgstr "Berkas metadata (misalnya `<fdroiddata>/metadata/<packageId>.yml`) menimpa berkas *fdroiddata*, termasuk yang telah dilokalkan."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
msgid "The *fdroiddata* files overwrite metadata from the app source."
msgstr "Berkas *fdroiddata* menimpa metadata dari sumber aplikasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots.md
