#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to Help"
msgstr "Bagaimana hulurkan bantuan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "The project is entirely developed and maintained by volunteers. You can help in the following ways:"
msgstr "Proyek ini sepenuhnya dikembangkan dan dikelola oleh para sukarelawan. Anda dapat membantu dengan cara-cara berikut:"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow our work"
msgstr "Ikuti perkembangan kami"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "The [Feeds](../Feeds) page lists the various sites that we work on."
msgstr "Halaman [Feeds](../Feeds) menampilkan berbagai situs tempat kami bekerja."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report problems"
msgstr "Laporkan masalah"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "If you experience problems with the site or client software, you can report them in the [issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/u/fdroid), discuss them in the [forum or chat rooms](https://f-droid.org/about/#contact)."
msgstr "Jika Anda mengalami masalah dengan situs atau perangkat lunak klien, laporkan melalui [pelacak isu](https://gitlab.com/u/fdroid), atau diskusikan di [forum atau ruang obrolan](https://f-droid.org/about/#contact)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "Take a look at the [Repository Maintenance](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds)  page to see how you can help keeping apps and their metadata up to date."
msgstr "Lihat halaman [Pemeliharaan Repositori](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds) untuk mengetahui bagaimana Anda dapat membantu menjaga aplikasi dan metadata-nya tetap mutakhir."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "If you are reporting an issue with the client, [check out these pointers](../Client_Bug_Reports) to make sure we have the best chance of reproducing and fixing your issue."
msgstr "Jika Anda melaporkan masalah pada klien, bacalah [panduan ini](../Client_Bug_Reports) agar laporan Anda memiliki peluang terbaik untuk direproduksi dan diperbaiki."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit applications"
msgstr "Kirim aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "If you see an application missing from the repository that fits with the [Inclusion Policy](../Inclusion_Policy)), then [you can add that application](../Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide)  via a merge request.  Otherwise, to make a simple request, go to the dedicated [Requests for Packaging](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues)  tracker."
msgstr "Jika Anda melihat aplikasi yang belum ada di repository tetapi sesuai dengan [Inclusion Policy](../Inclusion_Policy), maka [Anda dapat menambahkan aplikasi tersebut](../Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide) melalui merge request. Jika tidak, untuk membuat permintaan sederhana, buka tracker khusus [Requests for Packaging](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "Metadata may already be found there but it can always be improved. Often developers don't mark their releases well: you can ask them to use tags via an issue on their tracker, which will allow us to use an automatic check for new versions (and you can suggest a donation method while you're about it!). Another common task is the comparison of included libraries with official versions."
msgstr "Metadata mungkin sudah ada di sana, tetapi selalu bisa ditingkatkan. Sering kali pengembang tidak menandai rilis mereka dengan baik: Anda dapat meminta mereka menggunakan tag melalui issue di tracker mereka, yang akan memungkinkan kami menggunakan pemeriksaan otomatis untuk versi baru (dan Anda juga bisa sekalian menyarankan metode donasi!). Tugas umum lainnya adalah membandingkan library yang disertakan dengan versi resminya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "If you have the technical skills required, you can also put together the relevant metadata and submit a merge request to the git repository, which should speed up the inclusion of the application. See the [sticky thread](https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/adding-apps-with-git/)  at the top of that forum for more information."
msgstr "Jika Anda memiliki keterampilan teknis yang diperlukan, Anda juga dapat menyusun metadata yang relevan dan mengirimkan merge request ke repository git, yang akan mempercepat proses pemasukan aplikasi. Lihat [sticky thread](https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/adding-apps-with-git/) di bagian atas forum tersebut untuk informasi lebih lanjut."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update apps"
msgstr "Perbarui aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "Most apps are updated automatically. But if you find an outdated app, which doesn't have auto update enabled, or auto update doesn't work, you can update it manually and fix the auto update. The procedure for updating apps is similar to adding new apps: changes are applied to the metadata in the _fdroiddata_ git repository. You need to copy the last build block (or blocks if there are more than one apks for the same version), append it to `Builds` and update the `versionName`, `versionCode` and `commit`. Other fields may also need to be update as needed. `CurrentVersion` and `CurrentVersionCode` should also be updated."
msgstr "Sebagian besar aplikasi diperbarui secara otomatis. Namun jika Anda menemukan aplikasi yang kedaluwarsa, yang tidak mengaktifkan auto update, atau auto update tidak berfungsi, Anda dapat memperbaruinya secara manual sekaligus memperbaiki auto update-nya. Prosedur untuk memperbarui aplikasi mirip dengan menambahkan aplikasi baru: perubahan diterapkan pada metadata di repository git _fdroiddata_. Anda perlu menyalin blok build terakhir (atau beberapa blok jika ada lebih dari satu apk untuk versi yang sama), menambahkannya ke `Builds`, lalu memperbarui `versionName`, `versionCode`, dan `commit`. Field lain juga mungkin perlu diperbarui sesuai kebutuhan. `CurrentVersion` dan `CurrentVersionCode` juga harus diperbarui."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add information about no longer maintained apps"
msgstr "Tambahkan informasi mengenai aplikasi yang tidak lagi dipelihara"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "At the beginning of the app's description in metadata (provided Description is held on our end), insert a paragraph saying"
msgstr "Di awal bagian deskripsi aplikasi pada metadata (jika deskripsi tersebut dikelola di pihak kami), tambahkan paragraf yang menyatakan informasi tersebut."

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTE: This app is no longer maintained.\n"
msgstr "CATATAN: Aplikasi ini sudah tidak lagi dipelihara.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "Optionally link \"no longer maintained\" to where that statement is found (if not directly on the app's Readme/Website). Or add \"(its repo has been archived)\" – whichever fits. If the repo is gone altogether, instead remove the entries for `RepoType` and `RepoURL`, and at the very end of the metadata YAML add a line saying `NoSourceSince: 0.1.2` (where 0.1.2 should be the versionName of the last build available) – this will automatically translate into an Anti-Feature and thus be displayed prominently.  In the end make that an MR."
msgstr "Opsional, tautkan \"no longer maintained\" ke tempat pernyataan itu ditemukan (jika tidak langsung ada di Readme/Situs web aplikasi). Atau tambahkan \"(its repo has been archived)\" — mana yang cocok. Jika repo-nya sama sekali sudah tidak ada, hapus entri `RepoType` dan `RepoURL`, lalu di bagian paling akhir metadata YAML tambahkan baris `NoSourceSince: 0.1.2` (dengan 0.1.2 sebagai versionName dari build terakhir yang tersedia) — ini akan otomatis diterjemahkan menjadi sebuah Anti-Feature dan karenanya ditampilkan secara menonjol. Pada akhirnya, buatlah itu menjadi sebuah MR."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Review apps waiting for test"
msgstr "Meninjau aplikasi yang menunggu pengujian"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "In _fdroiddata_ when a merge request for a new app is mostly ready, it will be marked as [review request](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests/?label_name%5B%5D=review-requested). The metadata has been good but the app itself needs to be tested and reviewed. If you'd like to help you can [test them](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/wiki/-/wikis/Internal/Reviewing-new-apps) and posting the result."
msgstr "Di _fdroiddata_, ketika merge request untuk aplikasi baru hampir siap, permintaan itu akan ditandai sebagai [review request](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests/?label_name%5B%5D=review-requested). Metadata-nya sudah baik, tetapi aplikasinya sendiri perlu diuji dan ditinjau. Jika Anda ingin membantu, Anda dapat [menguji aplikasi tersebut](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/wiki/-/wikis/Internal/Reviewing-new-apps) dan memposting hasilnya."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Terjemahkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "The client application is available in many languages, but if yours is not included, or if it needs updating or improving, follow [these instructions](https://hosted.weblate.org/engage/f-droid/)."
msgstr "Aplikasi klien tersedia dalam banyak bahasa. Jika bahasa Anda belum didukung atau ingin memperbaiki terjemahan, ikuti [instruksi ini](https://hosted.weblate.org/engage/f-droid/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "The web site and some app descriptions (if the original developer does not supply their own description) can also be translated through Weblate."
msgstr "Situs web serta beberapa deskripsi aplikasi (jika pengembang aslinya tidak menyediakannya) juga dapat diterjemahkan melalui Weblate."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "There's a [dedicated forum section](https://forum.f-droid.org/c/translation)  for discussions about translation."
msgstr "Ada [bagian khusus di forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/c/translation) untuk diskusi tentang terjemahan."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Help with development"
msgstr "Bantu pengembangan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "There are three git repositories hosted at GitLab, as follows:"
msgstr "Ada tiga repository git yang di-host di GitLab, sebagai berikut:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "Android client application - <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient> Issues suitable for new contributors are tagged [help-wanted](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues?label_name=help-wanted)"
msgstr "Aplikasi klien Android – <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient>. Isu yang cocok untuk kontributor baru diberi tag [help-wanted](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues?label_name=help-wanted)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "Server tools, for the tools for running a repository and building/installing applications locally - <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver>"
msgstr "Alat server – perangkat yang digunakan untuk menjalankan repositori serta membangun dan menginstal aplikasi secara lokal – <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver>."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "Metadata files for applications in the main F-Droid repository - <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata>"
msgstr "Metadata untuk aplikasi dalam repositori utama F-Droid – <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata>."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "The easiest way to contribute to development is to make clones of these projects and submit merge requests. If you are making large changes, it would be good to discuss them on IRC or in the forum first, to ensure they fit with the direction of the project, and do not clash with or duplicate work already in development."
msgstr "Cara yang paling mudah untuk berkontribusi ke pengembangan adalah untuk membuat salinan dari proyek ini dan mengirim permintaan penggabungan. Jika Anda membuat perubahan besar, sebaiknya Anda diskusi terlebih dahulu di IRC atau dalam forum untuk memastikan bahwa perubahannya cocok dengan arah proyek, dan tidak bentrok dengan pekerjaan yang sudah dalam pengembangan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "For working with the server project, it's a good idea to read [the docs](http://f-droid.org/docs/) and learn our [git workflow](https://f-droid.org/wiki/page/git_workflow)."
msgstr "Untuk berkontribusi pada proyek server, disarankan membaca [dokumentasi](http://f-droid.org/docs/) dan mempelajari [alur kerja git kami](https://f-droid.org/wiki/page/git_workflow)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Help with Infrastructure"
msgstr "Bantu Infrastruktur"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "F-Droid provides multiple servers (builders, web portal, download areas...) which need regular maintenance, Ansible-based deployment, and hardware management.  Further information can be found by asking on [Matrix](https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid-dev:f-droid.org), [IRC](https://webchat.oftc.net/?randomnick=1&channels=fdroid&prompt=1) (#fdroid-dev on OFTC) or <team@f-droid.org>."
msgstr "F-Droid menyediakan beberapa server (builder, web portal, area unduhan...) yang memerlukan pemeliharaan rutin, deployment berbasis Ansible, dan pengelolaan hardware. Informasi lebih lanjut dapat diperoleh dengan bertanya di [Matrix](https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid-dev:f-droid.org), [IRC](https://webchat.oftc.net/?randomnick=1&channels=fdroid&prompt=1) (#fdroid-dev di OFTC), atau <team@f-droid.org>."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design"
msgstr "Desain"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/How_to_Help.md
msgid "We'd love any contributions to make the project prettier and easier to use. If you are good at writing we are working on improving the [Home page](https://f-droid.org/wiki/page/Home_page). If you can design mockups the client developers could use your help. Post them to the issue tracker for [client](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues) or the [website](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."
msgstr "Kami akan senang dengan segala kontribusi untuk membuat proyek ini lebih menarik dan lebih mudah digunakan. Jika Anda pandai menulis, kami sedang berupaya meningkatkan [Home page](https://f-droid.org/wiki/page/Home_page). Jika Anda bisa membuat mockup, para developer client mungkin dapat menggunakan bantuan Anda. Postinglah ke issue tracker untuk [client](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues) atau [website](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Importing Applications"
msgstr "Mengimpor Aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "To help with starting work on including a new application, use `fdroid import` to set up a new template project. It has two modes of operation, starting with a cloned git repo:"
msgstr "Untuk membantu memulai pekerjaan dalam memasukkan aplikasi baru, gunakan `fdroid import` untuk menyiapkan project template baru. Ia memiliki dua mode operasi, dimulai dari git repo yang telah dikloning:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient\n"
"cd fdroidclient\n"
"fdroid import\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient\n"
"cd fdroidclient\n"
"fdroid import\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "Or starting with a URL to a project page:"
msgstr "Atau dimulai dari URL halaman proyek:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "fdroid import --url=http://address.of.project\n"
msgstr "fdroid import --url=http://address.of.project\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "When a URL is specified using the `--url=` flag, `fdroid import` will use that URL to find out information about the project, and if it finds a git repo, it will also clone that. For this to work, the URL must point to a project format that the script understands. Currently this is limited to one of the following:"
msgstr "Jika URL diberikan menggunakan flag `--url=`, perintah `fdroid import` akan menggunakan URL tersebut untuk mengumpulkan informasi tentang proyek. Jika ditemukan repositori git, sistem juga akan mengkloningnya. Agar berfungsi, URL harus mengarah ke format proyek yang dikenali skrip. Saat ini, opsi ini masih terbatas pada format tertentu saja."

#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "GitLab - `https://gitlab.com/<PROJECTNAME>/<REPONAME>`"
msgstr "GitLab - `https://gitlab.com/<PROJECTNAME>/<REPONAME>`"

#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "GitHub - `https://github.com/<USER>/<PROJECT>`"
msgstr "GitHub - `https://github.com/<USER>/<PROJECT>`"

#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "Bitbucket - `https://bitbucket.org/<USER>/<PROJECT>/`"
msgstr "Bitbucket - `https://bitbucket.org/<USER>/<PROJECT>/`"

#. type: Bullet: '5.  '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "NotABug - `https://notabug.org/<USER>/<PROJECT>`"
msgstr "NotABug - `https://notabug.org/<USER>/<PROJECT>`"

#. type: Bullet: '6.  '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "Git - `git://<REPO>` or `https://<REPO>`"
msgstr "Git - `git://<REPO>` atau `https://<REPO>`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "Depending on the project type, more or less information may be gathered.  A bare repo URL, such as the git:// one, is the least preferable option of all, since you will have to enter much more information manually. While _gradle_ based builds should be auto-detected for all types, links to issue trackers can not be set for plain git projects. You can also use one of the following arguments to pre-fill your metadata:"
msgstr "Bergantung pada tipe project, lebih banyak atau lebih sedikit informasi dapat dikumpulkan. URL repo mentah, seperti yang bertipe git://, adalah opsi yang paling tidak disarankan, karena Anda harus memasukkan lebih banyak informasi secara manual. Walaupun build berbasis _gradle_ seharusnya dapat dideteksi otomatis untuk semua tipe, tautan ke issue tracker tidak dapat disetel untuk project git biasa. Anda juga dapat menggunakan salah satu argumen berikut untuk mengisi metadata Anda terlebih dahulu:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "`-u <URL>`, `--url=<URL>`: Project URL to import from."
msgstr "`-u <URL>`, `--url=<URL>`: URL proyek yang akan diimpor."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "`-s <DIR>`, `--subdir=<DIR>`: Path to main android project subdirectory, if not in root."
msgstr "`-s <DIR>`, `--subdir=<DIR>`: Path ke subdirektori project Android utama, jika bukan di root."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "`-c <CATEGORIES>`, `--categories=<CATEGORIES>`: Comma separated list of categories."
msgstr "`-c <CATEGORIES>`, `--categories=<CATEGORIES>`: Daftar kategori, dipisahkan koma."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "`-l <LICENSE>`, `--license=<LICENSE>`: Overall license of the project."
msgstr "`-l <LICENSE>`, `--license=<LICENSE>`: Lisensi keseluruhan proyek."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "`--revision <REV>`: Allows a different revision (or git branch) to be specified for the initial import"
msgstr "`--revision <REV>`: Mengizinkan revision lain (atau git branch) ditentukan untuk impor awal"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "If the import is successful, a metadata file will be created. You will need to edit this further to check the information, and fill in the blanks."
msgstr "Jika proses impor berhasil, sistem akan membuat berkas metadata. Anda perlu memeriksa dan melengkapi informasi di dalamnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "If it fails, you'll be told why. If it got as far as retrieving the source code, you can inspect it further by looking in `tmp/importer` where a full checkout will exist."
msgstr "Jika gagal, Anda akan diberi tahu alasannya. Jika proses sudah sampai pada pengambilan source code, Anda dapat memeriksanya lebih lanjut dengan melihat di `tmp/importer` tempat full checkout tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Importing_Applications.md
msgid "A frequent cause of initial failure is that the project directory is actually a subdirectory in the repository. In this case, run the importer again using the `--subdir` option to tell it where. It will not attempt to determine this automatically, since there may be several options."
msgstr "Penyebab umum kegagalan awal adalah direktori project sebenarnya merupakan subdirektori di dalam repository. Dalam kasus ini, jalankan importer lagi menggunakan opsi `--subdir` untuk memberitahukan lokasinya. Importer tidak akan mencoba menentukannya secara otomatis, karena mungkin ada beberapa opsi."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inclusion Policy"
msgstr "Kebijakan Inklusi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The purpose of this inclusion policy is to ensure that all applications included in the main F-Droid repository support F-Droid’s core mission: providing a trusted way to find and share privacy-respecting, free and open source software apps for Android. If an app does not meet these criteria, you can still make the app available to F-Droid users via a separate repository."
msgstr "Tujuan dari kebijakan penyertaan ini adalah untuk memastikan bahwa semua aplikasi yang disertakan dalam repositori utama F-Droid mendukung misi inti F-Droid: menyediakan cara tepercaya untuk menemukan dan berbagi aplikasi perangkat lunak bebas dan sumber terbuka yang menghormati privasi untuk Android. Jika sebuah aplikasi tidak memenuhi kriteria ini, Anda tetap dapat membuat aplikasi tersebut tersedia bagi pengguna F-Droid melalui repositori terpisah."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Free Software Requirement"
msgstr "Persyaratan Perangkat Lunak Bebas"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "All applications in the repository must be Free, Libre and Open Source Software (FLOSS) – for example, released under a [GPL](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/licenses.html) or [Apache](https://www.apache.org/licenses/) license. Every effort is made to verify that this is the case, both by visual inspection of the source and by building the application from the published source. To determine which licenses are FLOSS, we defer to widely trusted organizations that have a proven track record. Specifically, we acknowledge the following standards: Debian Free Software Guidelines ([DFSG](https://wiki.debian.org/DFSGLicenses)), Free Software Foundation ([FSF](https://www.fsf.org/licensing)), [GNU](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-list.html), and Open Source Initiative ([OSI](https://opensource.org/licenses)) (_read a brief overview of them all on System Package Data Exchange ([SPDX](https://spdx.org/licenses/))_)."
msgstr "Semua aplikasi dalam repositori harus berupa Perangkat Lunak Bebas, Libre, dan Sumber Terbuka (FLOSS) – misalnya, dirilis di bawah lisensi [GPL](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/licenses.html) atau [Apache](https://www.apache.org/licenses/). Setiap upaya dilakukan untuk memverifikasi bahwa hal ini terpenuhi, baik melalui inspeksi visual terhadap sumber kode maupun dengan membangun aplikasi dari sumber yang dipublikasikan. Untuk menentukan lisensi mana yang termasuk FLOSS, kami mengacu pada organisasi-organisasi terpercaya yang memiliki rekam jejak yang terbukti. Secara khusus, kami mengakui standar-standar berikut: Debian Free Software Guidelines ([DFSG](https://wiki.debian.org/DFSGLicenses)), Free Software Foundation ([FSF](https://www.fsf.org/licensing)), [GNU](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-list.html), dan Open Source Initiative ([OSI](https://opensource.org/licenses)) (_baca gambaran singkat tentang semuanya di System Package Data Exchange ([SPDX](https://spdx.org/licenses/))_)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "All binary dependencies including JAR files must originate either from source compilation or Debian repository downloads. Prebuilt binaries should only come from authorized trusted sources."
msgstr "Semua dependensi biner termasuk file JAR harus berasal dari kompilasi sumber atau unduhan repositori Debian. Biner bawaan hanya boleh berasal dari sumber tepercaya yang diotorisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Non-functional assets including artwork and fonts can utilize less restrictive licenses which include game art specific to the project but must allow redistribution when using non-commercial licenses. All assets need to have valid legal licenses or be in the public domain while being free of copyright infringement."
msgstr "Aset non-fungsional termasuk karya seni dan font dapat menggunakan lisensi yang kurang ketat yang mencakup seni game khusus proyek, tetapi harus mengizinkan redistribusi saat menggunakan lisensi non-komersial. Semua aset harus memiliki lisensi hukum yang sah atau berada dalam domain publik serta bebas dari pelanggaran hak cipta."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The implementation of proprietary tracking or advertising libraries and analytics tools such as Google Play Services and Firebase and Crashlytics and proprietary ad/tracking SDKs are strictly forbidden in all applications. Upstream developers must implement either a FLOSS alternative or a build flavour that does not require these dependencies when such features become necessary."
msgstr "Penerapan pustaka pelacakan atau periklanan proprietari dan alat analitik seperti Google Play Services, Firebase, Crashlytics, serta SDK iklan/pelacakan proprietari dilarang keras dalam semua aplikasi. Pengembang hulu harus mengimplementasikan alternatif FLOSS atau varian build yang tidak memerlukan dependensi tersebut apabila fitur semacam itu diperlukan."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build Transparency and Reproducibility"
msgstr "Transparansi dan Reprodusibilitas Build"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The F-Droid infrastructure compiles applications from publicly accessible source code to verify that distributed binaries match their source code. The complete application building process requires a 100% FLOSS toolchain including Debian-packaged tools. The use of proprietary build tools are strictly forbidden, including Oracle's JDK and some pre-release toolchains. Though we try to build everything from source, sometimes prebuilt FLOSS binaries are the only feasible approach. The following sources can be allowed to provide prebuilt binaries:"
msgstr "Infrastruktur F-Droid mengompilasi aplikasi dari kode sumber yang dapat diakses publik untuk memverifikasi bahwa biner yang didistribusikan sesuai dengan kode sumbernya. Proses pembangunan aplikasi secara lengkap memerlukan toolchain 100% FLOSS termasuk alat yang dikemas oleh Debian. Penggunaan alat build proprietari dilarang keras, termasuk JDK Oracle dan beberapa toolchain pra-rilis. Meskipun kami berusaha membangun semuanya dari sumber, terkadang biner FLOSS bawaan adalah satu-satunya pendekatan yang layak. Sumber-sumber berikut dapat diizinkan untuk menyediakan biner bawaan:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Debian \"[_main_](https://www.debian.org/doc/debian-policy/ch-archive.html)\" package archive."
msgstr "Arsip paket \"[_main_](https://www.debian.org/doc/debian-policy/ch-archive.html)\" Debian."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Applications can download prebuilt FLOSS binaries with specific conditions from trusted Maven repositories. Those include Maven Central, Google Maven, OSS Sonatype, OSS JFrog, JitPack.io and Clojars. Those binaries must still be freely licensed, simply being included in one of those repositories is not enough."
msgstr "Aplikasi dapat mengunduh biner FLOSS bawaan dengan kondisi tertentu dari repositori Maven tepercaya. Repositori tersebut meliputi Maven Central, Google Maven, OSS Sonatype, OSS JFrog, JitPack.io, dan Clojars. Biner tersebut tetap harus berlisensi bebas; sekadar disertakan dalam salah satu repositori tersebut tidaklah cukup."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The Android SDK, Flutter SDK and Hermes have permission to use official prebuilt binaries until Debian provides alternative solutions."
msgstr "Android SDK, Flutter SDK, dan Hermes diizinkan menggunakan biner bawaan resmi hingga Debian menyediakan solusi alternatif."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The use of prebuilt FLOSS binaries from [PyPI](https://pypi.org/) Wheels, Nix cache, Rust/Rustup, Golang and Node.js (current versions) and compilers or build tools which are not included in Debian can be acceptable. Whenever possible, Debian-packaged dependencies should be chosen above other options."
msgstr "Penggunaan biner FLOSS bawaan dari [PyPI](https://pypi.org/) Wheels, cache Nix, Rust/Rustup, Golang, dan Node.js (versi terkini) serta kompiler atau alat build yang tidak disertakan dalam Debian dapat diterima. Jika memungkinkan, dependensi yang dikemas oleh Debian harus diprioritaskan di atas pilihan lainnya."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security & Legal Compliance"
msgstr "Keamanan & Kepatuhan Hukum"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "F-Droid does not sign up for any API keys. Even if provided by a third party, we include them in both binary and source code releases."
msgstr "F-Droid tidak mendaftarkan kunci API apa pun. Meskipun disediakan oleh pihak ketiga, kami menyertakannya dalam rilis biner maupun kode sumber."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "All donation links need verification by upstream developers to stop unauthorized alterations. F-Droid contributors can consider [_funding.json_](https://fundingjson.org/), [_FUNDING.yml_](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/displaying-a-sponsor-button-in-your-repository#about-funding-files) or _README_ files. Also, verification can happen via messages that come from the same account as the app's source code, e.g. `@foobar` for `https://gitlab.com/foobar/myapp`, if that account is on the same GitLab instance as F-Droid itself, e.g. `gitlab.com`. The application's main website can also host donation links."
msgstr "Semua tautan donasi perlu diverifikasi oleh pengembang hulu untuk mencegah perubahan yang tidak sah. Kontributor F-Droid dapat mempertimbangkan file [_funding.json_](https://fundingjson.org/), [_FUNDING.yml_](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/displaying-a-sponsor-button-in-your-repository#about-funding-files), atau _README_. Selain itu, verifikasi dapat dilakukan melalui pesan yang berasal dari akun yang sama dengan kode sumber aplikasi, misalnya `@foobar` untuk `https://gitlab.com/foobar/myapp`, jika akun tersebut berada di instans GitLab yang sama dengan F-Droid sendiri, misalnya `gitlab.com`. Situs web utama aplikasi juga dapat memuat tautan donasi."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Applications must not infringe third party rights, including third party intellectual property rights such as copyright and trade marks. Applications need to obtain necessary trademark and copyright permissions. Any application with a duplicate android application ID matching another domain name will receive automatic rejection."
msgstr "Aplikasi tidak boleh melanggar hak pihak ketiga, termasuk hak kekayaan intelektual pihak ketiga seperti hak cipta dan merek dagang. Aplikasi perlu mendapatkan izin merek dagang dan hak cipta yang diperlukan. Setiap aplikasi dengan ID aplikasi Android yang duplikat dan cocok dengan nama domain lain akan ditolak secara otomatis."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "F-Droid uses pre-defined labels known as [Anti-Features](../Anti-Features) which serve as warning indicators about user freedom, privacy or etc. without necessarily disqualifying applications from inclusion."
msgstr "F-Droid menggunakan label yang telah ditentukan sebelumnya yang dikenal sebagai [Anti-Features](../Anti-Features), yang berfungsi sebagai indikator peringatan terkait kebebasan pengguna, privasi, dan lain-lain, tanpa harus mendiskualifikasi aplikasi dari penyertaan."

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Applications must not download additional executable binary files (e.g. add-ons, auto-updates, etc.) without explicit user consent. Consent means it needs to be opt-in _(it must not be harder to decline than to accept or presented in a way users are likely to press accept without reading)_ and structured in a way that clearly explains to users that they're choosing to bypass F-Droid's checks if they activate it."
msgstr "Aplikasi tidak boleh mengunduh file biner yang dapat dieksekusi tambahan (misalnya pengaya, pembaruan otomatis, dll.) tanpa persetujuan eksplisit pengguna. Persetujuan berarti harus bersifat opt-in _(menolak tidak boleh lebih sulit dari menerima atau disajikan dengan cara yang membuat pengguna cenderung menekan terima tanpa membaca)_ dan disusun sedemikian rupa sehingga dengan jelas menjelaskan kepada pengguna bahwa mereka memilih untuk melewati pemeriksaan F-Droid jika mengaktifkannya."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quality Control"
msgstr "Kontrol Kualitas"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The applications should also meet some basic quality requirements when they are added to the repo."
msgstr "Aplikasi juga harus memenuhi beberapa persyaratan kualitas dasar saat ditambahkan ke repo."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The application should be actively maintained when it's included and the author should commit to provide ongoing maintenance. Applications that are deprecated or unmaintained shouldn't be included."
msgstr "Aplikasi harus aktif dipelihara saat disertakan dan penulisnya harus berkomitmen untuk memberikan pemeliharaan berkelanjutan. Aplikasi yang sudah usang atau tidak dipelihara tidak boleh disertakan."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The application should be functional and implement all the features described in the description."
msgstr "Aplikasi harus berfungsi dan mengimplementasikan semua fitur yang dijelaskan dalam deskripsi."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The application should provide native features and enhancements when it wraps a website."
msgstr "Aplikasi harus menyediakan fitur dan peningkatan asli saat membungkus sebuah situs web."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The application should be useful to end users. Demo applications shouldn't be included."
msgstr "Aplikasi harus bermanfaat bagi pengguna akhir. Aplikasi demo tidak boleh disertakan."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The application should provide some unique value. Applications that perform only minor rebranding and lack meaningful improvements over other actively maintained applications in the repo shouldn't be included."
msgstr "Aplikasi harus memberikan nilai unik. Aplikasi yang hanya melakukan penggantian merek kecil dan tidak memiliki peningkatan berarti dibandingkan aplikasi lain yang aktif dipelihara dalam repo tidak boleh disertakan."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build & Verification Workflow"
msgstr "Alur Kerja Build & Verifikasi"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "__Unique ID:__ All applications must have their own distinct Android \"Application ID\"."
msgstr "__Unique ID:__ Semua aplikasi harus memiliki \"ID Aplikasi\" Android yang berbeda dan unik."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "__Your domain:__ It is advised to use an Application ID that stems from a domain name owned by the developer."
msgstr "__Your domain:__ Disarankan untuk menggunakan ID Aplikasi yang berasal dari nama domain yang dimiliki oleh pengembang."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "__Forks:__ Forked applications need to obtain a fresh Android ID that differs from the original application even if the source app exists outside F-Droid and they must receive corresponding name, icon and string changes including translation adjustments."
msgstr "__Fork:__ Aplikasi yang di-fork perlu mendapatkan Android ID baru yang berbeda dari aplikasi aslinya meskipun aplikasi sumber ada di luar F-Droid, dan harus menerima perubahan nama, ikon, dan string yang sesuai termasuk penyesuaian terjemahan."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "__Dependency Handling:__ Library dependencies must be built from source or provided in a trusted Maven repo. Prebuilt SDKs (Android/Flutter) are permitted to use scanignore until Debian packaging finishes."
msgstr "__Dependency Handling:__ Dependensi pustaka harus dibangun dari sumber atau disediakan dalam repositori Maven tepercaya. SDK bawaan (Android/Flutter) diizinkan menggunakan scanignore hingga pengemasan Debian selesai."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "__Automated Checks:__ F-Droid maintainers review applications through a verification process which examines license compliance and source availability, buildability and inclusion policy adherence. Reviewers conduct inspections for non-free dependencies alongside proprietary code, tracking features and advertising elements and other Anti-Features."
msgstr "__Automated Checks:__ Pengelola F-Droid meninjau aplikasi melalui proses verifikasi yang memeriksa kepatuhan lisensi dan ketersediaan sumber, kemampuan build, serta kepatuhan terhadap kebijakan penyertaan. Peninjau melakukan inspeksi terhadap dependensi non-bebas, kode proprietari, fitur pelacakan, elemen periklanan, dan Anti-Features lainnya."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "__Manual Review:__ Our contributors will manually review apps and use their discretion to flag issues."
msgstr "__Manual Review:__ Kontributor kami akan meninjau aplikasi secara manual dan menggunakan pertimbangan mereka untuk menandai masalah."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our mission and our inclusion policy"
msgstr "Misi kami dan kebijakan penyertaan kami"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Our mission is to safely and transparently distribute free and open source applications, providing users of all ages around the world with useful and privacy-respecting apps."
msgstr "Misi kami adalah mendistribusikan aplikasi bebas dan sumber terbuka secara aman dan transparan, menyediakan aplikasi yang berguna dan menghormati privasi bagi pengguna dari segala usia di seluruh dunia."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "When making inclusion decisions, we look to our core mission for guidance to determine what type of content is included in the main repo.  We also look at historical precedent when making inclusion decisions. If the proposed app is similar to an app we previously excluded, this will be taken into consideration. In addition to determining whether our app supports our mission, we take into consideration if an app is suitable for all F-Droid users, including children, when making inclusion decisions."
msgstr "Saat membuat keputusan inclusion, kami melihat misi inti kami sebagai panduan untuk menentukan jenis konten yang dimasukkan ke repo utama. Kami juga mempertimbangkan preseden historis saat membuat keputusan inclusion. Jika aplikasi yang diusulkan mirip dengan aplikasi yang sebelumnya kami kecualikan, hal ini akan dipertimbangkan. Selain menentukan apakah aplikasi mendukung misi kami, kami juga mempertimbangkan apakah sebuah aplikasi cocok untuk semua pengguna F-Droid, termasuk anak-anak, saat membuat keputusan inclusion."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "We acknowledge that this is not a precise science and try to make reasonable and rational decisions regarding our inclusion policy. If you believe that an app was wrongly excluded, you can email an appeal to <team@f-droid.org> and the appeal will be considered by a team member who was not involved in the original decision to exclude the app."
msgstr "Kami mengakui bahwa ini bukan ilmu yang presisi dan berupaya membuat keputusan yang wajar dan rasional terkait inclusion policy kami. Jika Anda yakin bahwa sebuah aplikasi seharusnya tidak dikecualikan, Anda dapat mengirim email banding ke <team@f-droid.org> dan banding tersebut akan dipertimbangkan oleh anggota tim yang tidak terlibat dalam keputusan awal untuk mengecualikan aplikasi tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Please keep in mind that even if an app is excluded, you may choose to make the app available to F-Droid users, via your own, or a third party, app repository."
msgstr "Harap diingat bahwa meskipun sebuah aplikasi ditolak, Anda dapat memilih untuk membuat aplikasi tersebut tersedia bagi pengguna F-Droid melalui repositori aplikasi milik Anda sendiri atau pihak ketiga."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Policy Enforcement"
msgstr "Penegakan Kebijakan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "The repository will remove or reject non-compliant applications until developers fix their issues. The F-Droid community encourages developers to work together to achieve compliance."
msgstr "Repositori akan menghapus atau menolak aplikasi yang tidak patuh hingga pengembang memperbaiki masalah mereka. Komunitas F-Droid mendorong pengembang untuk bekerja sama demi mencapai kepatuhan."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Apps which fail to rebuild (such as requiring Play Services) or contain undisclosed anti-features will receive a rejection."
msgstr "Aplikasi yang gagal dibangun ulang (seperti yang memerlukan Play Services) atau mengandung anti-features yang tidak diungkapkan akan ditolak."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "Upstream developers can ask for re-review after they make necessary fixes to their applications."
msgstr "Pengembang hulu dapat meminta tinjauan ulang setelah mereka melakukan perbaikan yang diperlukan pada aplikasi mereka."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Inclusion_Policy.md
msgid "F-Droid maintains the authority to implement various actions against persistent offenders which may include warnings and temporary suspensions or permanent content removal while providing proper notification and appeal options. The documentation will record all removal actions."
msgstr "F-Droid memiliki wewenang untuk menerapkan berbagai tindakan terhadap pelanggar berulang, yang dapat mencakup peringatan, penangguhan sementara, atau penghapusan konten secara permanen, sambil memberikan opsi notifikasi dan banding yang memadai. Dokumentasi akan mencatat semua tindakan penghapusan."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing the Server and Repo Tools"
msgstr "Menginstal Alat Server dan Repositori"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "The [fdroidserver](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver) tools provide everything you need to set up and maintain your own repos, run an fdroid build server, and even host your own website like f-droid.org. The F-Droid developers mostly work on Debian, Arch, and Ubuntu, so those are currently the best supported platforms."
msgstr ""
"Perangkat [fdroidserver](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver) menyediakan semua yang dibutuhkan untuk menyiapkan dan mengelola repositori Anda sendiri, menjalankan server build F-Droid, bahkan meng-host situs web seperti f-droid.org.  \n"
"Para pengembang F-Droid umumnya menggunakan Debian, Arch, dan Ubuntu, sehingga sistem operasi tersebut saat ini memiliki dukungan terbaik."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "To setup and maintain your own collection of apps and media from the command line, setup an F-Droid repository using the tools from _fdroidserver_.  To run the full F-Droid build server setup, see [Build Server Setup](../Build_Server_Setup)."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menyiapkan dan mengelola koleksi aplikasi dan media Anda dari baris perintah, buatlah repositori F-Droid menggunakan alat dari _fdroidserver_.  \n"
"Jika ingin menjalankan sistem server build F-Droid secara penuh, lihat panduan [Build Server Setup](../Build_Server_Setup)."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debian/Ubuntu/Mint/etc"
msgstr "Debian/Ubuntu/Mint/dll."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "The F-Droid tools, also known as _fdroidserver_, may be installed from the standard OS package repository.  On Debian-based OS's, this should be enough to install the basic F-Droid setup:"
msgstr "Alat-alat F-Droid, yang juga dikenal sebagai _fdroidserver_, dapat dipasang dari repositori paket OS standar. Pada OS berbasis Debian, ini seharusnya cukup untuk memasang setup dasar F-Droid:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"
msgstr "sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "However, it is common to find that the version of _fdroidserver_ available in the standard OS package repository is out of date."
msgstr "Namun, sering kali versi _fdroidserver_ yang tersedia di repositori paket OS standar sudah usang."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Getting a newer version"
msgstr "Mendapatkan versi yang lebih baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "A newer version of _fdroidserver_ may be found in the F-Droid PPA or your OS's _backports_ repository."
msgstr "Versi _fdroidserver_ yang lebih baru mungkin tersedia di PPA F-Droid atau repositori _backports_ OS Anda."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Ubuntu/Mint: use the [F-Droid PPA](https://launchpad.net/~fdroid/+archive/fdroidserver/+packages)  (fingerprint: `9AAC 2531 93B6 5D4D F1D0 A13E EC46 32C7 9C5E 0151`):"
msgstr "Ubuntu/Mint: gunakan [F-Droid PPA](https://launchpad.net/~fdroid/+archive/fdroidserver/+packages) (fingerprint: `9AAC 2531 93B6 5D4D F1D0 A13E EC46 32C7 9C5E 0151`):"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "sudo add-apt-repository ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver\n"
#| "sudo apt-get update\n"
#| "sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"
msgid ""
"  sudo add-apt-repository ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver\n"
"  sudo apt-get update\n"
"  sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo add-apt-repository ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver\n"
"sudo apt-get update\n"
"sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Debian: first [setup backports](http://backports.debian.org/Instructions/#index2h2), then, substituting your Debian release for 'bookworm':"
msgstr "Debian: pertama [setup backports](http://backports.debian.org/Instructions/#index2h2), lalu, ganti rilis Debian Anda untuk 'bookworm':"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"
msgid "  apt-get install -t bookworm-backports fdroidserver\n"
msgstr "sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fedora/Archlinux"
msgstr "Fedora/Archlinux"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Since packages in these distros could be newer than the official ones on pypi, installing the dependencies in a separate virtual environment workarounds dependency resolving failures:"
msgstr "Karena paket di distro ini bisa lebih baru daripada yang resmi di pypi, memasang dependensi dalam virtual environment terpisah dapat mengatasi kegagalan resolusi dependensi:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"python3 -m venv env\n"
"source env/bin/activate\n"
"pip install -e .\n"
msgstr ""
"python3 -m venv env\n"
"source env/bin/activate\n"
"pip install -e .\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Guix"
msgstr "Guix"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The tools are also available in the main Guix channel. To install:  \n"
msgstr "Alat-alat ini juga tersedia di main Guix channel. Untuk memasang:  \n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "guix install fdroidserver\n"
msgstr "guix install fdroidserver\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Homebrew"
msgstr "Homebrew"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Check [the Homebrew formula](https://formulae.brew.sh/formula/fdroidserver) for more details."
msgstr "Lihat [formula Homebrew](https://formulae.brew.sh/formula/fdroidserver) untuk detail lebih lanjut tentang cara pemasangannya."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "brew install fdroidserver\n"
msgstr "brew install fdroidserver\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Windows Subsystem for Linux"
msgstr "Windows Subsystem for Linux"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Starting with the Windows 10 \"Anniversary Update\", you can [enable an Ubuntu environment](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/commandline/wsl/install_guide)  that runs in Windows, known as \"Bash on Windows\", \"Ubuntu on Windows\", or \"Windows Subsystem for Linux\"."
msgstr "Mulai dari pembaruan “Anniversary Update” pada Windows 10, Anda dapat [mengaktifkan lingkungan Ubuntu](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/commandline/wsl/install_guide) di Windows, yang dikenal sebagai “Bash on Windows”, “Ubuntu on Windows”, atau “Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL)”."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "[setup Windows Subsystem for Linux](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/commandline/wsl/install_guide)"
msgstr "[setup Windows Subsystem for Linux](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/commandline/wsl/install_guide)"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "install *fdroidserver* from the [F-Droid PPA](https://launchpad.net/~fdroid/+archive/fdroidserver/+packages)  (fingerprint: `9AAC 2531 93B6 5D4D F1D0 A13E EC46 32C7 9C5E 0151`)  by running this in the Bash shell window:"
msgstr "Instal *fdroidserver* dari [F-Droid PPA](https://launchpad.net/~fdroid/+archive/fdroidserver/+packages) (sidik jari kunci: `9AAC 2531 93B6 5D4D F1D0 A13E EC46 32C7 9C5E 0151`) dengan menjalankan perintah berikut di jendela shell Bash:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo add-apt-repository ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver\n"
"sudo apt-get update\n"
"sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo add-apt-repository ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver\n"
"sudo apt-get update\n"
"sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cygwin"
msgstr "Cygwin"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "add Java to your PATH: <http://www.kingluddite.com/tools/how-do-i-add-java-to-my-windows-path>"
msgstr "Tambahkan Java ke PATH Anda: <http://www.kingluddite.com/tools/how-do-i-add-java-to-my-windows-path>"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Install Cygwin <https://www.sourceware.org/cygwin/>"
msgstr "Instal Cygwin: <https://www.sourceware.org/cygwin/>"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "in Cygwin, install these packages: *gcc-core git openssh python3 python3-imaging python3-paramiko python3-requests python3-setuptools rsync wget*"
msgstr "Di Cygwin, instal paket berikut: *gcc-core, git, openssh, python3, python3-imaging, python3-paramiko, python3-requests, python3-setuptools, rsync, wget.*"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "open a Cygwin bash shell and run: `pip install fdroidserver`"
msgstr "Buka shell bash Cygwin dan jalankan: `pip install fdroidserver`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Then here's the repo setup:"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya, siapkan repositori Anda:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export ANDROID_HOME=/cygdrive/c/path/to/android-sdk\n"
"fdroid init   # the keystore gen will fail\n"
msgstr ""
"export ANDROID_HOME=/cygdrive/c/path/to/android-sdk\n"
"fdroid init   # the keystore gen will fail\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "After running `fdroid init`, you need to set the Windows path to your keystore in _config.yml_.  It is also possible to install _fdroidserver_ in a virtual environment using _virtualenv_ and _pip_."
msgstr "Setelah menjalankan `fdroid init`, Anda perlu mengatur path Windows ke keystore Anda di _config.yml_.  Dimungkinkan juga untuk memasang _fdroidserver_ di virtual environment menggunakan _virtualenv_ dan _pip_."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker Executable Image (any platform)"
msgstr "Docker Executable Image (platform apa pun)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "If you are already running Docker \"Executable Images\", then the easiest way to run _fdroidserver_ is to use our [executable image](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/docker-executable-fdroidserver)"
msgstr "Jika Anda sudah menjalankan Docker \"Executable Images\", maka cara termudah untuk menjalankan _fdroidserver_ adalah dengan menggunakan [executable image](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/docker-executable-fdroidserver) kami"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing the latest code (any platform)"
msgstr "Menginstal Kode Terbaru (semua platform)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "The easiest way to install the fdroidserver tools from source is to use virtualenv and pip. First, make sure you have the Python3 version of _virtualenv_ or _venv_ installed, it should be included in your OS's Python distribution or via other mechanisms like dnf/yum/pacman/emerge/Fink/MacPorts/Brew. Then here's how to install _fdroidserver_ into a Python \"virtual env\":"
msgstr "Cara termudah untuk memasang tools fdroidserver dari source adalah menggunakan virtualenv dan pip. Pertama, pastikan Anda sudah memasang _virtualenv_ atau _venv_ versi Python3, yang seharusnya sudah termasuk dalam distribusi Python OS Anda atau tersedia melalui mekanisme lain seperti dnf/yum/pacman/emerge/Fink/MacPorts/Brew. Lalu berikut cara memasang _fdroidserver_ ke dalam Python \"virtual env\":"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "pyvenv fdroidserver-env\n"
#| ". fdroidserver-env/bin/activate\n"
#| "pip install git+https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver.git\n"
msgid ""
"python -m venv fdroidserver-env\n"
". fdroidserver-env/bin/activate\n"
"pip install git+https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver.git\n"
msgstr ""
"python -m venv fdroidserver-env\n"
". fdroidserver-env/bin/activate\n"
"pip install git+https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver.git\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "You can find variations on this used in the CI tests: https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/master/.gitlab-ci.yml"
msgstr "Anda dapat menemukan variasi penggunaan ini dalam pengujian CI: [https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/master/.gitlab-ci.yml](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/master/.gitlab-ci.yml)"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building apps"
msgstr "Membangun aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "To build apps using F-Droid, Java and the whole Android SDK must be installed.  This process is currently only developed on GNU/Linux, but we'd love patches getting it working on macOS and Windows. If you only want to make F-Droid repositories of APK files that you already have or don't know what this means, then you can skip this section."
msgstr "Untuk membangun aplikasi menggunakan F-Droid, Java dan seluruh Android SDK harus dipasang. Proses ini saat ini hanya dikembangkan di GNU/Linux, tetapi kami akan senang menerima patch yang membuatnya berfungsi di macOS dan Windows. Jika Anda hanya ingin membuat repository F-Droid berisi file APK yang sudah Anda miliki atau tidak tahu apa artinya ini, Anda dapat melewati bagian ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "In order to build Android apps with the _fdroidserver_ toolchain, Java, the Android SDK, and some other essential tools must be installed.  Only [parts of the Android SDK](https://qa.debian.org/developer.php?email=android-tools-devel%40lists.alioth.debian.org)  are available in Debian, so the Android SDK must be installed manually, as well as the packages that it requires (_the Android SDK tools include some 32-bit binaries, so even 64-bit systems need these i386 library packages_). The F-Droid tools use the Android SDK to build and inspect apps, so you must have the Android SDK installed and setup before using _fdroidserver_."
msgstr "Untuk membangun aplikasi Android dengan toolchain _fdroidserver_, Java, Android SDK, dan beberapa tools penting lainnya harus dipasang. Hanya [sebagian komponen Android SDK](https://qa.debian.org/developer.php?email=android-tools-devel%40lists.alioth.debian.org) yang tersedia di Debian, jadi Android SDK harus dipasang secara manual, beserta paket-paket yang dibutuhkannya (_tools Android SDK mencakup beberapa binary 32-bit, sehingga bahkan sistem 64-bit pun memerlukan paket library i386 ini_). Tools F-Droid menggunakan Android SDK untuk membangun dan memeriksa aplikasi, jadi Anda harus memasang dan menyiapkan Android SDK sebelum menggunakan _fdroidserver_."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "[Install the Android SDK](https://developer.android.com/sdk/index.html#downloads)  and make sure the `ANDROID_HOME` environment variable is properly set. Be sure to verify the file you downloaded, you can double-check the SHA-1 checksum on Google's download page."
msgstr "[Pasang Android SDK](https://developer.android.com/sdk/index.html#downloads) dan pastikan environment variable `ANDROID_HOME` diatur dengan benar. Pastikan file yang Anda unduh telah diverifikasi, Anda dapat memeriksa checksum SHA-1 di halaman unduhan Google."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"
"$ mkdir ~/android-sdk-linux\n"
"$ cd ~/android-sdk-linux\n"
"$ wget https://dl.google.com/android/repository/commandlinetools-linux-6858069_latest.zip\n"
"$ echo \"87f6dcf41d4e642e37ba03cb2e387a542aa0bd73cb689a9e7152aad40a6e7a08  commandlinetools-linux-6858069_latest.zip\" | sha256sum -c\n"
"commandlinetools-linux-6858069_latest.zip: OK\n"
"$ unzip commandlinetools-linux-6858069_latest.zip\n"
"$ export ANDROID_HOME=\"$HOME/android-sdk-linux\"\n"
"$ ./cmdline-tools/bin/sdkmanager --sdk_root=\"$ANDROID_HOME\" platform-tools \"build-tools;30.0.3\"\n"
msgstr ""
"$ sudo apt-get install fdroidserver\n"
"$ mkdir ~/android-sdk-linux\n"
"$ cd ~/android-sdk-linux\n"
"$ wget https://dl.google.com/android/repository/commandlinetools-linux-6858069_latest.zip\n"
"$ echo \"87f6dcf41d4e642e37ba03cb2e387a542aa0bd73cb689a9e7152aad40a6e7a08  commandlinetools-linux-6858069_latest.zip\" | sha256sum -c\n"
"commandlinetools-linux-6858069_latest.zip: OK\n"
"$ unzip commandlinetools-linux-6858069_latest.zip\n"
"$ export ANDROID_HOME=\"$HOME/android-sdk-linux\"\n"
"$ ./cmdline-tools/bin/sdkmanager --sdk_root=\"$ANDROID_HOME\" platform-tools \"build-tools;30.0.3\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Note: If you have Android Studio installed, you have the Android SDK installed.  It should be located at `~/Android/Sdk` instead of `~/android-sdk-linux`.  You can find the location in Android Studio when you open the Tools→SDK Manager menu."
msgstr "Catatan: Jika Anda telah memasang Android Studio, berarti Android SDK juga sudah terpasang. Lokasinya seharusnya di `~/Android/Sdk` alih-alih `~/android-sdk-linux`. Anda dapat menemukan lokasinya di Android Studio saat membuka menu Tools→SDK Manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "To add these settings permanently to your shell:"
msgstr "Untuk menambahkan pengaturan ini secara permanen di shell Anda:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ echo export ANDROID_HOME=$ANDROID_HOME >> .bashrc\n"
msgstr "$ echo export ANDROID_HOME=$ANDROID_HOME >> .bashrc\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building all apps from f-droid.org"
msgstr "Membangun semua aplikasi dari f-droid.org"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "In order to build all apps that are included in f-droid.org, then a lot more software packages are required:"
msgstr "Agar dapat membangun semua aplikasi yang ada di f-droid.org, diperlukan banyak paket perangkat lunak tambahan, antara lain:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "all SDK platforms requested by the apps you want to build"
msgstr "Semua platform SDK yang digunakan oleh aplikasi yang ingin Anda bangun."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "all Debian packages required by every app build process (maven, ant, etc)"
msgstr "Semua paket Debian yang dibutuhkan oleh tiap proses build (seperti maven, ant, dll)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "every source code management tool (git, subversion, mercurial, etc)"
msgstr "Semua alat kontrol versi sumber (git, subversion, mercurial, dan sebagainya)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "every version of the Android NDK that apps use"
msgstr "Setiap versi Android NDK yang digunakan oleh aplikasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "On top of that, to build apps like they are built on f-droid.org, then the whole [Build Server Setup](../Build_Server_Setup) is required.  That is a more secure, production-ready setup that requires quite a bit more setup and resources.  The [build server provisioning scripts](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/tree/master/buildserver/)  provide a useful reference for all the needed bits."
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, untuk membangun aplikasi sebagaimana dilakukan di server resmi f-droid.org, diperlukan keseluruhan sistem [Build Server Setup](../Build_Server_Setup).  \n"
"Ini merupakan sistem yang lebih aman, siap produksi, dan membutuhkan lebih banyak konfigurasi serta sumber daya.  \n"
"Skrip [build server provisioning](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/tree/master/buildserver/) dapat dijadikan panduan referensi lengkap mengenai komponen yang diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "If you want to make your own official releases with the F-Droid tools, then you'll also need to set up the [Signing Process](../Signing_Process)."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin membuat rilis resmi menggunakan alat F-Droid, Anda juga perlu menyiapkan proses penandatanganan aplikasi, lihat [Proses Penandatanganan (Signing Process)](../Signing_Process)."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proprietary, Non-Free libraries"
msgstr "Pustaka Proprietari/Non-Bebas"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "The Android SDK is made available by Google under a proprietary license. Within that, the essential build tools, SDK platforms, support library and some other components are under the Apache license and source code is provided."
msgstr "Android SDK disediakan oleh Google di bawah lisensi proprietari. Di dalamnya, essential build tools, SDK platforms, support library, dan beberapa komponen lainnya berada di bawah lisensi Apache serta source code-nya disediakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools.md
msgid "Google APIs, used for building apps using Google Maps, are free to the extent that the library comes pre-installed on the device.  Google Play Services, Google Admob, GCM, and many other third party libraries are proprietary and cannot be included in the main F-Droid repository.  The [microG project](https://microg.org) is developing free software replacements for some of the most used proprietary Google libraries"
msgstr "Google APIs, yang digunakan untuk membangun aplikasi menggunakan Google Maps, bebas sejauh library tersebut sudah terpasang sebelumnya di perangkat. Google Play Services, Google Admob, GCM, dan banyak library pihak ketiga lainnya bersifat proprietary dan tidak dapat disertakan dalam repositori utama F-Droid. Proyek [microG](https://microg.org) sedang mengembangkan pengganti free software untuk beberapa library Google proprietary yang paling banyak digunakan"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Licenses.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Lisensi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Licenses.md
msgid "F-Droid is built on free software and only produces free software.  We generally prefer the GNU licenses, but will consider other licenses in specific cases. This is a rough overview of the licenses used throughout the project."
msgstr "F-Droid dibangun di atas perangkat lunak bebas dan hanya menghasilkan perangkat lunak bebas. Kami umumnya lebih memilih lisensi GNU, tetapi akan mempertimbangkan lisensi lain dalam kasus tertentu. Ini adalah gambaran kasar tentang lisensi yang digunakan di seluruh proyek."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Licenses.md
msgid "The source code for this site and the content produced by the F-Droid community are available under the [GNU Affero General Public License version 3 or later (AGPLv3+)](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html)."
msgstr "Kode sumber untuk situs ini dan konten yang diproduksi oleh komunitas F-Droid tersedia di bawah [GNU Affero General Public License versi 3 atau yang lebih baru (AGPLv3+)](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Licenses.md
msgid "The content of the news section and the F-Droid logo are also available under [Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License (CC-BY-SA-3.0)](http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/) or [GNU General Public License version 3 or later (GPLv3+)](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html)."
msgstr "Konten bagian berita dan logo F-Droid juga tersedia di bawah [Lisensi Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC-BY-SA-3.0)](http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/) atau [GNU General Public License versi 3 atau yang lebih baru (GPLv3+)](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Licenses.md
msgid "The descriptive text and graphics for each app have a specific license from that project.  Free software should also have free descriptions and graphics."
msgstr "Teks deskriptif dan grafis untuk setiap aplikasi memiliki lisensi khusus dari proyek tersebut. Perangkat lunak bebas juga seharusnya memiliki deskripsi dan grafis yang bebas."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Licenses.md
msgid "The F-Droid logo was created by William Theaker. Updates to that, and additional artwork, are by Robert Martinez. You can see and improve the current artwork and badges in [the dedicated repository](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/artwork)."
msgstr "Logo F-Droid dibuat oleh William Theaker. Pembaruan atas itu, dan karya seni tambahan, dibuat oleh Robert Martinez. Anda dapat melihat dan menyempurnakan karya seni serta lencana saat ini di [repositori khusus](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/artwork)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Licenses.md
msgid "Each individual project on our GitLab contains a _LICENSE_ file if you want to find any specific licenses."
msgstr "Setiap project individual di GitLab kami berisi file _LICENSE_ jika Anda ingin menemukan lisensi tertentu."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "MIA Process"
msgstr "Proses MIA"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Maintainers come and go, interests and priorities change and time flies. This is true for every project and F-Droid as well. To keep the credentials and permissions in F-Droid reasonable, there is this missing in action (MIA) process."
msgstr "Para maintainer datang dan pergi, minat dan prioritas berubah, dan waktu berlalu begitu cepat. Ini berlaku untuk setiap proyek, termasuk F-Droid. Untuk menjaga kredensial dan permission di F-Droid tetap wajar, ada proses missing in action (MIA) ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "This means we regularly check if F-Droid team members are still active, i.e.  when they last contributed, and drop those that don't respond to messages after some time. The idea is to improve F-Droid's quality, not to hunt developers."
msgstr "Ini berarti kami secara rutin memeriksa apakah anggota tim F-Droid masih aktif — misalnya, kapan terakhir kali mereka berkontribusi — dan menghapus anggota yang tidak merespons pesan setelah jangka waktu tertentu. Tujuan proses ini adalah untuk menjaga kualitas F-Droid, bukan untuk mencari-cari kesalahan pengembang."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What are F-Droid team members"
msgstr "Siapa yang Disebut Anggota Tim F-Droid"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Member of @fdroid group on gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/group_members)"
msgstr "[Anggota grup @fdroid di gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/group_members)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Contributors on forum.f-droid.org](https://forum.f-droid.org/g/contributors)"
msgstr "[Kontributor di forum.f-droid.org](https://forum.f-droid.org/g/contributors)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Reviewers on Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/#information)"
msgstr "[Pemeriksa di Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/#information)"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What are contributions"
msgstr "Apa yang dimaksud kontribusi"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Commits to one of the repos hosted on [Gitlab](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/)."
msgstr "Commit ke salah satu repositori yang di-host di [Gitlab](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Contributions to issues on [Gitlab](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues)."
msgstr "Contributions to issues on [Gitlab](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Translations on [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)."
msgstr "Terjemahan di [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Activity on the forum."
msgstr "Aktivitas di forum."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Who is MIA"
msgstr "Siapa MIA"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "No contribution or pong to a MIA ping for at least six month."
msgstr "Tidak ada kontribusi atau tidak merespons pesan “MIA ping” selama minimal enam bulan."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How are MIAs tracked"
msgstr "Bagaimana MIA dilacak"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "For every member that is MIA, an internal issue in the [admin project](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin/issues/) is opened. Every ping and pong is documented there. If a number of pings don't receive a pong, the team is mentioned in the issue, to ask if someone has an other way to contact the person."
msgstr "Untuk setiap anggota yang MIA, sebuah issue internal di [admin project](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin/issues/) dibuka. Setiap ping dan pong didokumentasikan di sana. Jika sejumlah ping tidak mendapat pong, tim akan disebut di issue tersebut untuk menanyakan apakah ada cara lain untuk menghubungi orang itu."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The removal"
msgstr "Proses Penghapusan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Status: First warning -> wait 16 weeks."
msgstr "Status: Peringatan pertama → tunggu 16 minggu."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Status: Second warning -> wait 8 weeks."
msgstr "Status: Peringatan kedua → tunggu 8 minggu."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Status: Final warning -> wait 4 weeks."
msgstr "Status: Peringatan terakhir → tunggu 4 minggu."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Afterwards, MIA accounts are removed from all F-Droid directories, including:"
msgstr "Setelah itu, akun yang MIA akan dihapus dari seluruh direktori dan layanan F-Droid, termasuk:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Removed from [@fdroid group on gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/)"
msgstr "Dihapus dari grup [@fdroid di gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Downgraded to normal user account on <forum.f-droid.org>"
msgstr "Diturunkan menjadi akun pengguna biasa di <forum.f-droid.org>"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Removed as Reviewer/Maintainer from [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/#information)"
msgstr "Dihapus sebagai Reviewer/Maintainer dari [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/#information)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Removed from list of [Maintainers](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/wiki/-/wikis/Maintainers)"
msgstr "Dihapus dari daftar [Maintainers](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/wiki/-/wikis/Maintainers)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "Removed from email lists, including team@f-droid.org."
msgstr "Dihapus dari mailing list, termasuk team@f-droid.org."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "After that, the issue is closed and made public if it was set to confidential."
msgstr "Setelah itu, issue ditutup dan dijadikan publik jika sebelumnya bersifat confidential."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "References"
msgstr "Referensi"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Debian reference](https://www.debian.org/doc/manuals/developers-reference/beyond-pkging.html#dealing-with-inactive-and-or-unreachable-maintainers)"
msgstr "[Referensi dari Debian](https://www.debian.org/doc/manuals/developers-reference/beyond-pkging.html#dealing-with-inactive-and-or-unreachable-maintainers)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Debian team site](https://wiki.debian.org/Teams/MIA)"
msgstr "[Halaman tim Debian](https://wiki.debian.org/Teams/MIA)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/MIA_Process.md
msgid "[Debian tools](https://salsa.debian.org/qa/qa/tree/master/mia)"
msgstr "[Alat Debian](https://salsa.debian.org/qa/qa/tree/master/mia)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Publishing Nightly Builds"
msgstr "Mempublikasikan Nightly Build"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Having users run \"nightly\" builds is a great way to get rapid feedback on current development activities.  One key way to get this kind of feedback is to make it as easy as possible for people to install the nightly builds, and to keep updated.  The F-Droid tools now let you automate this whole process for apps that are setup on GitLab CI."
msgstr "Membiarkan pengguna menjalankan build \"nightly\" adalah cara yang bagus untuk mendapatkan umpan balik cepat tentang aktivitas pengembangan saat ini. Salah satu cara utama untuk mendapatkan umpan balik seperti ini adalah dengan membuatnya semudah mungkin bagi orang untuk memasang nightly build, dan terus memperbaruinya. Alat F-Droid sekarang memungkinkan Anda mengotomatiskan seluruh proses ini untuk aplikasi yang disiapkan di GitLab CI."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "The F-Droid nightly repos are built on top of the standard Android _~/.android/debug.keystore_ that the Android tools automatically generate.  That signing key is used to sign the nightly builds as well as the repo index.  This is meant to be easy to setup and manage, but it does __not__ provide the same level of security as a standard F-Droid repo!"
msgstr "Repo nightly F-Droid dibangun di atas _~/.android/debug.keystore_ Android standar yang secara otomatis dihasilkan oleh tool Android. Signing key tersebut digunakan untuk menandatangani build nightly sekaligus repo index. Ini dimaksudkan agar mudah disiapkan dan dikelola, tetapi itu __tidak__ memberikan tingkat keamanan yang sama seperti repo F-Droid standar!"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Since this is about smoothing the development process, it also makes sense to reuse a shared _debug.keystore_ among your team.  That way, all debug builds are interchangeable.  This makes debugging certain problems a lot easier since you can keep the app state when installing your own debug builds, for example, to add logging."
msgstr "Karena ini bertujuan memperlancar proses pengembangan, masuk akal juga untuk menggunakan _debug.keystore_ bersama di antara tim Anda. Dengan begitu, semua debug build dapat saling dipertukarkan. Hal ini memudahkan debug masalah tertentu karena Anda dapat mempertahankan status aplikasi saat memasang debug build Anda sendiri, misalnya untuk menambahkan logging."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic Version Codes"
msgstr "Kode Versi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "With nightly builds, the normal logic for setting `versionCode` in git for each release no longer makes sense.  In order for Android to treat each new build as a possible update, the `versionCode` must increase, but that does not make sense to commit to git each time.  So there needs to be some automatic logic for setting `versionCode`:"
msgstr "Dengan nightly build, logika normal untuk menetapkan `versionCode` di git untuk setiap rilis tidak lagi masuk akal. Agar Android memperlakukan setiap build baru sebagai kemungkinan pembaruan, `versionCode` harus meningkat, tetapi tidak masuk akal untuk melakukan commit ke git setiap kali. Karena itu, perlu ada logika otomatis untuk menetapkan `versionCode`:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "timestamp in seconds (`date +%s`) will always increase"
msgstr "timestamp dalam detik (`date +%s`) akan selalu bertambah"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "incrementing the last release's `versionCode` (e.g. 104030034, 104030035, 104030036)"
msgstr "menaikkan `versionCode` rilis terakhir (misalnya 104030034, 104030035, 104030036)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "git commit count (`git rev-list --first-parent --count HEAD`)  provides some hints of where in the code the build was made from"
msgstr "jumlah commit git (`git rev-list --first-parent --count HEAD`) memberikan beberapa petunjuk tentang dari mana dalam code build dibuat"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "For many apps, some combo will make the most sense. For F-Droid, we have a variable `DB_VERSION` for the internal database.  We only handle upgrading the database, never downgrading.  So that needs to be the most important part of the versionCode.  Any build with `DB_VERSION = 77` should not be upgraded by any build with `DB_VERSION = 75`.  Then the minor part is the commit count, so it looks like (7502543, 7502544, 7702601, etc). with `DB_VERSION` as the first two digits, then a 0-padded commit count as the last 5 digits."
msgstr "Bagi banyak aplikasi, beberapa kombinasi akan paling masuk akal. Untuk F-Droid, kami memiliki variabel `DB_VERSION` untuk database internal. Kami hanya menangani peningkatan database, tidak pernah penurunan versi. Jadi itu harus menjadi bagian paling penting dari `versionCode`. Build apa pun dengan `DB_VERSION = 77` tidak boleh ditingkatkan oleh build apa pun dengan `DB_VERSION = 75`. Lalu bagian minor-nya adalah jumlah commit, sehingga bentuknya seperti (7502543, 7502544, 7702601, dan seterusnya), dengan `DB_VERSION` sebagai dua digit pertama, lalu commit count yang dipadding nol sebagai 5 digit terakhir."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring GitLab CI"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi GitLab CI"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "This assumes that the app is already setup with _.gitlab-ci.yml_ and builds are running on GitLab CI.  This also works for forks of the main project that has the _.gitlab-ci-yml_."
msgstr "Ini mengasumsikan bahwa aplikasi sudah disiapkan dengan _.gitlab-ci.yml_ dan build berjalan di GitLab CI. Ini juga berlaku untuk fork dari project utama yang memiliki _.gitlab-ci-yml_."

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Run `fdroid nightly --show-secret-var` in the local git repo that is being setup, e.g. _fdroid/fdroidclient_.  It will print out the SSH Public Key.  Using `--show-secret-var` will make it print out base 64 text to be pasted into secret variable called `DEBUG_KEYSTORE`.  Careful! That text is the entire _debug.keystore_, so protect it accordingly!"
msgstr "Jalankan `fdroid nightly --show-secret-var` di repo git lokal yang sedang disiapkan, misalnya _fdroid/fdroidclient_. Perintah itu akan menampilkan SSH Public Key. Menggunakan `--show-secret-var` akan membuatnya menampilkan teks base64 untuk ditempelkan ke secret variable bernama `DEBUG_KEYSTORE`. Hati-hati! Teks itu adalah seluruh _debug.keystore_, jadi lindungi dengan semestinya!"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Create a new GitLab \"project\" by appending _-nightly_ to the name. For example, <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient> becomes <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient-nightly> and <https://gitlab.com/eighthave/fdroidclient> becomes <https://gitlab.com/eighthave/fdroidclient-nightly>"
msgstr "Buat project GitLab baru dengan menambahkan _-nightly_ ke namanya. Misalnya, <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient> menjadi <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient-nightly> dan <https://gitlab.com/eighthave/fdroidclient> menjadi <https://gitlab.com/eighthave/fdroidclient-nightly>"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "In that new project, add the SSH Public Key derived from your _debug.keystore_ as a Deploy Key in your Repository Settings, e.g.  `https://gitlab.com/eighthave/fdroidclient-nightly/settings/repository`"
msgstr "Pada project baru itu, tambahkan SSH Public Key yang diturunkan dari _debug.keystore_ Anda sebagai Deploy Key di Repository Settings, misalnya `https://gitlab.com/eighthave/fdroidclient-nightly/settings/repository`"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "In the CI/CD Settings of the project being built, paste that into GitLab CI Secret Variable called `DEBUG_KEYSTORE`, e.g.  `https://gitlab.com/eighthave/fdroidclient/settings/ci_cd`"
msgstr "Di CI/CD Settings dari project yang sedang dibangun, tempelkan itu ke GitLab CI Secret Variable bernama `DEBUG_KEYSTORE`, misalnya `https://gitlab.com/eighthave/fdroidclient/settings/ci_cd`"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Then in that same page, in the Protected section, set up your _master_ branch to limit the possibility of leaking the _debug.keystore_.  If _master_ cannot be force-pushed, then any attempts to get the stored secrets are permanently written to the git history.  Without that protection, someone with push access could push a commit in a branch to print out the secrets, then remove that commit to hide their actions."
msgstr "Kemudian pada halaman yang sama, di bagian Protected, atur branch _master_ Anda untuk membatasi kemungkinan bocornya _debug.keystore_. Jika _master_ tidak dapat di-force-push, maka setiap upaya untuk mendapatkan secret yang tersimpan akan tercatat permanen dalam riwayat git. Tanpa perlindungan itu, seseorang yang memiliki akses push dapat mendorong commit di sebuah branch untuk mencetak secret, lalu menghapus commit tersebut guna menyembunyikan tindakannya."

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Add a _deploy_ stage to your _.gitlab-ci.yml_ that produces only the build to publish to the nightly, then runs `fdroid nightly`. For example:"
msgstr "Tambahkan stage _deploy_ ke _.gitlab-ci.yml_ Anda yang hanya menghasilkan build untuk dipublikasikan ke nightly, lalu jalankan `fdroid nightly`. Sebagai contoh:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"deploy_nightly:\n"
"  stage: deploy\n"
"  only:\n"
"    - master\n"
"  script:\n"
"    - ./gradlew assembleDebug\n"
"    - pip3 install fdroidserver\n"
"    - export PATH=~/.local/bin:$PATH\n"
"    - fdroid nightly\n"
msgstr ""
"deploy_nightly:\n"
"  stage: deploy\n"
"  only:\n"
"    - master\n"
"  script:\n"
"    - ./gradlew assembleDebug\n"
"    - pip3 install fdroidserver\n"
"    - export PATH=~/.local/bin:$PATH\n"
"    - fdroid nightly\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "For a real world example using _gitlab-ci_, see _fdroidclient_:"
msgstr "Sebagai contoh nyata penerapan _gitlab-ci_, lihat konfigurasi proyek _fdroidclient_."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "<https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient-nightly>"
msgstr "<https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient-nightly>"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "<https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/master/.gitlab-ci.yml>"
msgstr "<https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/master/.gitlab-ci.yml>"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring for GitHub Actions"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi untuk GitHub Actions"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "GitHub and GitHub Actions are both proprietary platforms that are widely used to develop free software.  Since F-Droid does not promote proprietary software, there is no official support for GitHub Actions.  All of the F-Droid tooling is free software, so contributors have made a GitHub Action based on the F-Droid tools."
msgstr "GitHub dan GitHub Actions sama-sama platform proprietary yang banyak digunakan untuk mengembangkan free software. Karena F-Droid tidak mempromosikan proprietary software, tidak ada dukungan resmi untuk GitHub Actions. Semua tooling F-Droid adalah free software, sehingga kontributor telah membuat GitHub Action berdasarkan tooling F-Droid."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Create a new GitHub \"project\" by appending _-nightly_ to the name. For example, <https://github.com/f-droid/fdroidclient> becomes <https://github.com/f-droid/fdroidclient-nightly> and <https://github.com/eighthave/fdroidclient> becomes <https://github.com/eighthave/fdroidclient-nightly>"
msgstr "Buat project GitHub baru dengan menambahkan _-nightly_ ke nama. Misalnya, <https://github.com/f-droid/fdroidclient> menjadi <https://github.com/f-droid/fdroidclient-nightly> dan <https://github.com/eighthave/fdroidclient> menjadi <https://github.com/eighthave/fdroidclient-nightly>"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "In that new project, add the SSH Public Key derived from your _debug.keystore_ as a Deploy Key in your Security settings, e.g.  `https://github.com/eighthave/fdroidclient-nightly/settings/keys`"
msgstr "Pada project baru itu, tambahkan SSH Public Key yang diturunkan dari _debug.keystore_ Anda sebagai Deploy Key di pengaturan Security, misalnya `https://github.com/eighthave/fdroidclient-nightly/settings/keys`"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "In the Settings of the project being built, find \"Actions\" under \"Secrets\" in the \"Security\" section.  Paste the whole `DEBUG_KEYSTORE` output line into a new repository secret called `DEBUG_KEYSTORE`, e.g.  `https://github.com/eighthave/fdroidclient/settings/secrets/actions`."
msgstr "Di pengaturan project yang sedang dibangun, temukan \"Actions\" di bawah \"Secrets\" dalam bagian \"Security\". Tempelkan seluruh baris output `DEBUG_KEYSTORE` ke secret repository baru bernama `DEBUG_KEYSTORE`, misalnya `https://github.com/eighthave/fdroidclient/settings/secrets/actions`."

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Add a _nightly_ stage to your _.github/workflows/_ that produces only the build to publish to the nightly, then runs `fdroid nightly`. For example:"
msgstr "Tambahkan stage _nightly_ ke _.github/workflows/_ Anda yang hanya menghasilkan build untuk dipublikasikan ke nightly, lalu menjalankan `fdroid nightly`. Contohnya:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"name: Publish nightly build\n"
"on:\n"
"  push:\n"
"    branches:\n"
"      - main\n"
"jobs:\n"
"  nightly:\n"
"    name: Publish nightly build\n"
"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n"
"    environment: nightly\n"
"    steps:\n"
"      - name: Checkout\n"
"        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n"
"      - name: Gradle Wrapper Validation\n"
"        uses: gradle/wrapper-validation-action@v3\n"
"      - name: Set up JDK 17\n"
"        uses: actions/setup-java@v2\n"
"        with:\n"
"          distribution: 'adopt'\n"
"          java-version: 17\n"
"      - name: Build\n"
"        run: |\n"
"          # use timestamp as Version Code\n"
"          export versionCode=$(date '+%s')\n"
"          sed -i \"s,^|(|s*versionCode|)  *[0-9].*,|1 $versionCode,\" app/build.gradle*\n"
"          ./gradlew assembleDebug\n"
"      - name: fdroid nightly\n"
"        run: |\n"
"          sudo add-apt-repository ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver\n"
"          sudo apt-get update\n"
"          sudo apt-get install apksigner fdroidserver --no-install-recommends\n"
"          export DEBUG_KEYSTORE=${{ secrets.DEBUG_KEYSTORE }}\n"
"          fdroid nightly --archive-older 10\n"
msgstr ""
"name: Publish nightly build\n"
"on:\n"
"  push:\n"
"    branches:\n"
"      - main\n"
"jobs:\n"
"  nightly:\n"
"    name: Publish nightly build\n"
"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n"
"    environment: nightly\n"
"    steps:\n"
"      - name: Checkout\n"
"        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n"
"      - name: Gradle Wrapper Validation\n"
"        uses: gradle/wrapper-validation-action@v3\n"
"      - name: Set up JDK 17\n"
"        uses: actions/setup-java@v2\n"
"        with:\n"
"          distribution: 'adopt'\n"
"          java-version: 17\n"
"      - name: Build\n"
"        run: |\n"
"          # use timestamp as Version Code\n"
"          export versionCode=$(date '+%s')\n"
"          sed -i \"s,^|(|s*versionCode|)  *[0-9].*,|1 $versionCode,\" app/build.gradle*\n"
"          ./gradlew assembleDebug\n"
"      - name: fdroid nightly\n"
"        run: |\n"
"          sudo add-apt-repository ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver\n"
"          sudo apt-get update\n"
"          sudo apt-get install apksigner fdroidserver --no-install-recommends\n"
"          export DEBUG_KEYSTORE=${{ secrets.DEBUG_KEYSTORE }}\n"
"          fdroid nightly --archive-older 10\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "There is an alternate approach based on Docker maintained by @wardvl: [wardvl/f-droid-nightly-action](https://github.com/wardvl/f-droid-nightly-action/)"
msgstr "Terdapat pendekatan alternatif berbasis Docker yang dikelola oleh @wardvl: [wardvl/f-droid-nightly-action](https://github.com/wardvl/f-droid-nightly-action/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring for GitHub and Travis CI"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi untuk GitHub dan Travis CI"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "Generate a new _debug.keystore_ for each app, since GitHub only allows a deploy key to be used on a single repo.  Keep that file safe, since it is the signing key for your nightly build."
msgstr "Hasilkan _debug.keystore_ baru untuk setiap aplikasi, karena GitHub hanya mengizinkan sebuah deploy key digunakan pada satu repo. Simpan file itu dengan aman, karena itulah signing key untuk nightly build Anda."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"keytool -genkey -v -keystore im.zom.messenger-debug.keystore \\\n"
"  -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 \\\n"
"  -alias androiddebugkey -storepass android -keypass android \\\n"
"  -dname \"CN=Android Debug,O=Android,C=US\"\n"
msgstr ""
"keytool -genkey -v -keystore im.zom.messenger-debug.keystore \\\n"
"  -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 \\\n"
"  -alias androiddebugkey -storepass android -keypass android \\\n"
"  -dname \"CN=Android Debug,O=Android,C=US\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Set a GitHub Deploy Key for\n"
"  `https://github.com/zom/zom-android-nightly` by going to\n"
"  `https://github.com/zom/zom-android-nightly/settings/keys`.  The\n"
"  public SSH key is printed out by running:\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Set GitHub Deploy Key untuk\n"
"  `https://github.com/zom/zom-android-nightly` dengan membuka\n"
"  `https://github.com/zom/zom-android-nightly/settings/keys`. \n"
"  Public SSH key dicetak dengan menjalankan:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "fdroid nightly --keystore im.zom.messenger-debug.keystore\n"
msgstr "fdroid nightly --keystore im.zom.messenger-debug.keystore\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "check _Allow write access_ in the GitHub Deploy Key settings"
msgstr "centang _Allow write access_ pada pengaturan GitHub Deploy Key"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "To print out the secret variable contents, use `--show-secret-var`.  Careful! That text is the entire _debug.keystore_, so protect it accordingly! This prints out base64 text to be pasted into a Travis CI \"Environment Variable\" in `https://travis-ci.org/zom/Zom-Android/settings`. Call the variable `DEBUG_KEYSTORE` and make sure \"Display value in build log\" is __OFF__."
msgstr "Untuk mencetak isi variabel rahasia, gunakan `--show-secret-var`. Hati-hati! Teks itu adalah seluruh _debug.keystore_, jadi lindungi dengan semestinya! Ini mencetak teks base64 untuk ditempelkan ke variabel lingkungan Travis CI di `https://travis-ci.org/zom/Zom-Android/settings`. Beri nama variabel `DEBUG_KEYSTORE` dan pastikan \"Display value in build log\" __OFF__."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "fdroid nightly --keystore im.zom.messenger-debug.keystore --show-secret-var\n"
msgstr "fdroid nightly --keystore im.zom.messenger-debug.keystore --show-secret-var\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
msgid "And here's a simple example of how to add _fdroidserver_ to your Travis CI setup to make it deploy the APK after a successful test:"
msgstr "Berikut contoh sederhana bagaimana menambahkan _fdroidserver_ ke dalam konfigurasi Travis CI agar dapat menerbitkan berkas APK setelah pengujian berhasil:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: _docs/Publishing_Nightly_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo: required\n"
"language: android\n"
"\n"
"addons:\n"
"  apt:\n"
"    sources:\n"
"      - sourceline: 'ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver'\n"
"    packages:\n"
"      - fdroidserver\n"
"      - openssh-client\n"
"\n"
"android:\n"
"  components:\n"
"    - tools\n"
"    - platform-tools\n"
"    - build-tools-26.0.2\n"
"    - android-25\n"
"  licenses:\n"
"    - 'android-sdk-license-.+'\n"
"\n"
"script:\n"
"  - ./gradlew test\n"
"\n"
"after_success:\n"
"  - fdroid nightly -v\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo: required\n"
"language: android\n"
"\n"
"addons:\n"
"  apt:\n"
"    sources:\n"
"      - sourceline: 'ppa:fdroid/fdroidserver'\n"
"    packages:\n"
"      - fdroidserver\n"
"      - openssh-client\n"
"\n"
"android:\n"
"  components:\n"
"    - tools\n"
"    - platform-tools\n"
"    - build-tools-26.0.2\n"
"    - android-25\n"
"  licenses:\n"
"    - 'android-sdk-license-.+'\n"
"\n"
"script:\n"
"  - ./gradlew test\n"
"\n"
"after_success:\n"
"  - fdroid nightly -v\n"

