msgstr "Android 1.5 (API 3): [F-Droid 0.45](https://f-droid.org/archive/org.fdroid.fdroid_45.apk)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Running_on_old_Android_versions.md
msgid "Please note that many apps on F-Droid may no longer support such old Android versions. It is recommended to enable the \"F-Droid Archive\" repository in the F-Droid app. Enabling the Archive lets F-Droid show you older versions of apps, which may include versions that still work on your device."
msgstr "Harap dicatat bahwa banyak aplikasi di F-Droid mungkin აღარ mendukung versi Android yang sangat lama seperti ini. Disarankan untuk mengaktifkan repository \"F-Droid Archive\" di aplikasi F-Droid. Mengaktifkan Archive akan memungkinkan F-Droid menampilkan versi aplikasi yang lebih lama, yang mungkin masih berfungsi di perangkat Anda."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security Model"
msgstr "Model Keamanan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The security architecture is based on integrating models proven by\n"
"[Debian](https://wiki.debian.org/SecureApt) and [The Update\n"
"Framework](https://github.com/theupdateframework/specification/blob/master/tuf-spec.md)\n"
" into what the Android OS already provides.  The way F-Droid operates is greatly inspired by de facto security model of how reputable GNU/Linux distros like Debian, Fedora, Ubuntu, etc. operate.  There is a big emphasis on operating in the public and making everything publicly available. We include source tarballs and build logs when we publish binaries.  These are archived as long as possible, for retroactive review.  And all of this is mirrored in many places across the internet by many different parties.\n"
msgstr ""
"Arsitektur keamanannya didasarkan pada integrasi model yang telah terbukti oleh\n"
"[Debian](https://wiki.debian.org/SecureApt) dan [The Update\n"
"Framework](https://github.com/theupdateframework/specification/blob/master/tuf-spec.md)\n"
" ke dalam apa yang sudah disediakan oleh Android OS. Cara kerja F-Droid sangat terinspirasi oleh model keamanan de facto dari distro GNU/Linux bereputasi seperti Debian, Fedora, Ubuntu, dan sebagainya. Ada penekanan besar pada operasi yang terbuka dan membuat semuanya tersedia untuk publik. Kami menyertakan source tarball dan build log saat menerbitkan binary. Semua itu diarsipkan selama mungkin untuk peninjauan retroaktif. Dan semua ini dicerminkan di banyak tempat di internet oleh banyak pihak yang berbeda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "a repo is defined by having unique signing key, first and foremost"
msgstr "Sebuah repo didefinisikan terlebih dahulu dan terutama berdasarkan signing key yang unik."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[HTTPS connections by default](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/v0.100.1/app/src/main/res/values/default_repo.xml#L11)"
msgstr "[Koneksi HTTPS secara default](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/v0.100.1/app/src/main/res/values/default_repo.xml#L11)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "server only works over HTTPS, [HTTP](http://f-droid.org) is a redirect"
msgstr "server hanya bekerja melalui HTTPS, [HTTP](http://f-droid.org) adalah redirect"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[Android enforces](https://developer.android.com/studio/publish/app-signing.html#considerations) that all apps have a valid signature over the entire contents of the APK file"
msgstr "[Android mewajibkan](https://developer.android.com/studio/publish/app-signing.html#considerations) setiap aplikasi memiliki tanda tangan yang valid atas seluruh isi file APK."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[Android verifies updates](https://developer.android.com/studio/publish/app-signing.html#considerations) based on the signature of the installed app"
msgstr "[Android memverifikasi pembaruan aplikasi](https://developer.android.com/studio/publish/app-signing.html#considerations) berdasarkan tanda tangan versi aplikasi yang telah terpasang sebelumnya."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[file integrity](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/v0.101-alpha2/app/src/main/java/org/fdroid/fdroid/installer/ApkCache.java#L57) protected by [signed metadata](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/v0.101-alpha2/app/src/main/java/org/fdroid/fdroid/RepoUpdater.java#L212)"
msgstr "[integritas file](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/v0.101-alpha2/app/src/main/java/org/fdroid/fdroid/installer/ApkCache.java#L57) dilindungi oleh [signed metadata](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/v0.101-alpha2/app/src/main/java/org/fdroid/fdroid/RepoUpdater.java#L212)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "As of [_index-v2_](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/merge_requests/1092), files from the repo are verified based on SHA-256, including icons, screenshots, etc."
msgstr "Sejak [_index-v2_](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/merge_requests/1092), file dari repo diverifikasi berdasarkan SHA-256, termasuk ikon, screenshot, dan sebagainya."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "_index-v2_ uses any algorithm supported by [_apksigner_](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/merge_requests/1134) and [_android-23_](https://developer.android.com/reference/java/security/Signature) and newer, and relies on OpenJDK's and Google's maintenance of the currently valid signing algorithms.  When _index-v2_ was launched, the signature algorithm in use was `SHA256withRSA` and the digest algorithm was `SHA-256`.  _index-v1_ is signed by `SHA1withRSA`.  As of this writing, SHA1 are still considered strong against [second pre-image attacks](https://crypto.stackexchange.com/a/48291), which is what is relevant for index JARs."
msgstr "_index-v2_ menggunakan algoritme apa pun yang didukung oleh [_apksigner_](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/merge_requests/1134) dan [_android-23_](https://developer.android.com/reference/java/security/Signature) serta yang lebih baru, dan bergantung pada pemeliharaan OpenJDK dan Google terhadap algoritme penandatanganan yang saat ini valid. Saat _index-v2_ diluncurkan, algoritme tanda tangan yang digunakan adalah `SHA256withRSA` dan algoritme digest adalah `SHA-256`. _index-v1_ ditandatangani dengan `SHA1withRSA`. Hingga saat ini, SHA1 masih dianggap kuat terhadap [second pre-image attacks](https://crypto.stackexchange.com/a/48291), yang relevan untuk index JAR."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "Production signing is handled by [reproducible builds](https://tests.reproducible-builds.org/debian/rb-pkg/unstable/amd64/android-platform-tools-apksig.html) of _apksigner_ from Debian."
msgstr "Proses penandatanganan produksi dijalankan menggunakan versi _apksigner_ yang dibangun secara [reproducible](https://tests.reproducible-builds.org/debian/rb-pkg/unstable/amd64/android-platform-tools-apksig.html) di lingkungan Debian."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "signed metadata includes hashes of [the app](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/0.6.0/fdroidserver/update.py#L460) and its [signing key](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/0.6.0/fdroidserver/update.py#L558)"
msgstr "Metadata yang ditandatangani mencakup hash dari [aplikasi](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/0.6.0/fdroidserver/update.py#L460) dan juga [kunci penandatanganannya](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/0.6.0/fdroidserver/update.py#L558)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[signed metadata generated on a separate machine](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/0.6.0/fdroidserver/update.py#L989) (which is fully offline for f-droid.org and guardianproject.info)"
msgstr "[Metadata yang ditandatangani dihasilkan di mesin terpisah](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/0.6.0/fdroidserver/update.py#L989), yang sepenuhnya offline untuk repositori besar seperti f-droid.org dan guardianproject.info guna mencegah kompromi keamanan."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[public key for verifying metadata signatures built into F-Droid client app](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/v0.100.1/app/src/main/res/values/default_repo.xml#L13)"
msgstr "[kunci publik untuk memverifikasi signature metadata yang dibangun ke dalam aplikasi F-Droid client](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/v0.100.1/app/src/main/res/values/default_repo.xml#L13)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "signed metadata includes [timestamp](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/commit/02b2090e530ab5d22b522d978728f34bb332b390) and [expiry](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/0.6.0/fdroidserver/update.py#L775)"
msgstr "metadata yang ditandatangani mencakup [timestamp](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/commit/02b2090e530ab5d22b522d978728f34bb332b390) dan [expiry](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/0.6.0/fdroidserver/update.py#L775)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "easy Tor support via Settings"
msgstr "dukungan Tor yang mudah melalui Settings"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[client-side HTTP ETag cache check](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues/562) so the ETag cannot be abused to track users"
msgstr "[Fitur pemeriksaan cache HTTP ETag di sisi klien](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues/562) memastikan bahwa ETag tidak dapat disalahgunakan untuk melacak pengguna."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "list of official mirrors included in signed metadata, then the client [chooses mirrors](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues/35) based on availability and freshness based on local criteria like whether Tor is in use"
msgstr "daftar mirror resmi disertakan dalam metadata yang ditandatangani, lalu client [memilih mirror](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues/35) berdasarkan ketersediaan dan freshness menurut kriteria lokal seperti apakah Tor sedang digunakan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "Client [requires](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/-/merge_requests/1577) that [TLS certificate transparency](https://developer.android.com/privacy-and-security/security-config#CertificateTransparencySummary) is enabled for f-droid.org and other domains commonly used by repos and mirrors."
msgstr "Client [mensyaratkan](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/-/merge_requests/1577) agar [TLS certificate transparency](https://developer.android.com/privacy-and-security/security-config#CertificateTransparencySummary) diaktifkan untuk f-droid.org dan domain lain yang umum digunakan oleh repo dan mirror."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "While the current setup is already a solid platform, there are a number of improvements that make sense to implement:"
msgstr "Walaupun setup saat ini sudah merupakan platform yang solid, ada sejumlah perbaikan yang masuk akal untuk diimplementasikan:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "better handling of index expiry aka \"max age\""
msgstr "penanganan yang lebih baik untuk expiry index alias \"max age\""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[pinned TLS certificate built into the client app](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/commit/0429b3f7dd4a6037fa11df64bfdd176ea378e6bf)"
msgstr "[sertifikat TLS yang dipin dan ditanamkan ke dalam aplikasi client](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/commit/0429b3f7dd4a6037fa11df64bfdd176ea378e6bf)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "In order to defend against an attacker that holds the signing keys for the app repository, there must be a trustworthy source of information to compare against. Reproducible builds means that anyone with the same source code will produce the exact same binary. When paired with an auditing system, it is easy to catch malware inserted in the build process, rather than the source code, like XCodeGhost. Reproducible builds also makes it possible to have all builds of a release binary have the exact same hash. Then any app repository can build apps only from source code, and have a source of verification data from any other app repository building the same app. Building software from source has become cheap enough that many companies like gitlab.com and Travis CI are offering free, automated build services in the cloud. Since the whole F-Droid toolset is free software and designed to be easy to setup, the barriers to setting up automatic auditing are quite low. People in separate areas of the world with different risk profiles can run [verification servers](../Verification_Server) to provide more trustworthy information."
msgstr "Untuk mempertahankan diri terhadap penyerang yang memegang signing key untuk repository aplikasi, harus ada sumber informasi yang tepercaya untuk dibandingkan. Reproducible builds berarti siapa pun dengan source code yang sama akan menghasilkan binary yang persis sama. Jika dipadukan dengan sistem audit, akan mudah menangkap malware yang disisipkan dalam proses build, bukan dalam source code, seperti XCodeGhost. Reproducible builds juga memungkinkan semua build dari binary rilis memiliki hash yang persis sama. Dengan demikian, repository aplikasi apa pun dapat membangun aplikasi hanya dari source code, dan memiliki sumber data verifikasi dari repository aplikasi lain mana pun yang membangun aplikasi yang sama. Membangun software dari source kini cukup murah sehingga banyak perusahaan seperti gitlab.com dan Travis CI menawarkan layanan build otomatis gratis di cloud. Karena seluruh toolset F-Droid adalah free software dan dirancang agar mudah disiapkan, hambatan untuk menyiapkan auditing otomatis cukup rendah. Orang-orang di wilayah berbeda dengan profil risiko berbeda dapat menjalankan [verification servers](../Verification_Server) untuk menyediakan informasi yang lebih tepercaya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "The security model of the [Build Server Setup](../Build_Server_Setup)  and the [Signing Process](../Signing_Process) are documented separately."
msgstr "Model keamanan dari [Build Server Setup](../Build_Server_Setup) dan [Signing Process](../Signing_Process) didokumentasikan secara terpisah."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App signing"
msgstr "App signing"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "Apps can be distributed using the [developer's own](../Reproducible_Builds) signatures when the builds are fully reproducible."
msgstr "Aplikasi dapat didistribusikan menggunakan [tanda tangan pengembang sendiri](../Reproducible_Builds) jika hasil build-nya sepenuhnya dapat direproduksi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "By default, the \"publish\" server will generate and manage a signing key for each individual app.  These signing keys are only shared between apps when specifically configured to do so using the [_keyaliases_](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/886394c9a4909/examples/config.yml#L156) mechanism in _config.yml_."
msgstr ""
"Secara default, server “publish” akan menghasilkan dan mengelola kunci tanda tangan terpisah untuk setiap aplikasi.  \n"
"Kunci-kunci ini hanya dapat digunakan bersama antar aplikasi jika dikonfigurasikan melalui mekanisme [_keyaliases_](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/886394c9a4909/examples/config.yml#L156) di dalam file _config.yml_."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "All apps are signed by [the key devoted to that app](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/2.1.2/fdroidserver/publish.py#L420) unless the upstream [specifically](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests/10240) requests multiple apps be signed by the same key, and the _fdroiddata_ maintainers approve it."
msgstr "Semua aplikasi ditandatangani oleh [kunci yang khusus untuk aplikasi tersebut](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/2.1.2/fdroidserver/publish.py#L420) kecuali upstream [secara spesifik](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests/10240) meminta beberapa aplikasi ditandatangani dengan kunci yang sama, dan maintainer _fdroiddata_ menyetujuinya."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "For _f-droid.org_, all app signing is done on a dedicated, air-gapped, offline machine."
msgstr "Untuk _f-droid.org_, semua penandatanganan aplikasi dilakukan pada mesin khusus yang dedicated, air-gapped, dan offline."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "At any time, the developer's own signatures may be added their app(s) in _f-droid.org_ once reproducible builds have been achieved.  Additionally, releases signed by the _f-droid.org_ key will continue to be shipped."
msgstr "Setiap saat, tanda tangan milik developer dapat ditambahkan ke aplikasi mereka di _f-droid.org_ setelah reproducible builds tercapai. Selain itu, rilis yang ditandatangani dengan kunci _f-droid.org_ akan tetap terus didistribusikan."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "In the official F-Droid client app, the developer's own signature is the default for fresh installs."
msgstr "Di aplikasi F-Droid client resmi, signature milik developer sendiri menjadi default untuk instalasi baru."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "We encourage app developers and maintainers to think about whether they want to use a special Application ID for the app when published in _f-droid.org_ to avoid conflicts with other versions.  One common pattern is to add `.fdroid` to the end of the Application ID via a Gradle Build Flavor."
msgstr "Kami mendorong pengembang dan maintainer aplikasi untuk mempertimbangkan apakah mereka ingin menggunakan Application ID khusus untuk aplikasi saat dipublikasikan di _f-droid.org_ agar menghindari konflik dengan versi lain. Salah satu pola yang umum adalah menambahkan `.fdroid` di akhir Application ID melalui Gradle Build Flavor."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initial Installs"
msgstr "Initial Installs"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "Most users of F-Droid download the APK from _f-droid.org_ and install it.  This is a potential vector of attack that built-in app stores do not have.  Therefore, many additional security precautions are taken to make it as hard as possible to exploit this vector."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian besar pengguna F-Droid mengunduh file APK langsung dari _f-droid.org_ dan menginstalnya secara manual.  \n"
"Langkah ini membuka celah serangan yang tidak dimiliki oleh toko aplikasi bawaan sistem operasi.  \n"
"Karena itu, berbagai lapisan perlindungan keamanan tambahan diterapkan untuk meminimalkan risiko eksploitasi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "included on the [HSTS preload list](https://hstspreload.org/?domain=f-droid.org), so major browsers will only ever use HTTPS for all connections to _f-droid.org_"
msgstr "_f-droid.org_ termasuk dalam [daftar HSTS preload](https://hstspreload.org/?domain=f-droid.org), sehingga browser utama selalu memaksa penggunaan HTTPS untuk semua koneksi ke domain tersebut."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "a [strong](https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze/f-droid.org#third-party) TLS/HTTPS configuration"
msgstr "konfigurasi TLS/HTTPS yang [kuat](https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze/f-droid.org#third-party)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "DNSSEC signatures on our [domain name](https://dnssec-analyzer.verisignlabs.com/f-droid.org) records"
msgstr "Tanda tangan DNSSEC pada record [nama domain](https://dnssec-analyzer.verisignlabs.com/f-droid.org) kami"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "DNS Certification Authority Authorization (CAA) [policy](https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/analyze.html?d=f%2ddroid.org)"
msgstr "DNS Certification Authority Authorization (CAA) [policy](https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/analyze.html?d=f%2ddroid.org)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "a [strong](https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze/f-droid.org) HTTP Content Security Policy"
msgstr "Penerapan [HTTP Content Security Policy (CSP)](https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze/f-droid.org) yang kuat untuk mencegah penyisipan konten berbahaya."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "[PGP-signature]({{ site.fdroid_apk_download_url }}.asc) on the initial install [download link]({{ site.fdroid_apk_download_url }})"
msgstr "Tersedia [tanda tangan PGP]({{ site.fdroid_apk_download_url }}.asc) untuk [tautan unduhan instalasi awal]({{ site.fdroid_apk_download_url }}) F-Droid.apk."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "automated [regular](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/-/jobs/47503948) and [random](https://verification.f-droid.org/check-fdroid-apk) [auditing](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/dfbe114af3c4cef15ce3aa5e979d9f4684f2acbc/tests/check-fdroid-apk) that [F-Droid.apk]({{ site.fdroid_apk_download_url }}) has not been tampered with"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan otomatis [reguler](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/-/jobs/47503948) dan [audit](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/blob/dfbe114af3c4cef15ce3aa5e979d9f4684f2acbc/tests/check-fdroid-apk) [acak](https://verification.f-droid.org/check-fdroid-apk) yang memastikan bahwa [F-Droid.apk]({{ site.fdroid_apk_download_url }}) tidak dirusak"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "F-Droid Limited controls many potential phishing domains like [fdroid.org](https://whois.icann.org/lookup?name=fdroid.org), [f-droid.com](https://whois.icann.org/lookup?name=f-droid.com), and [f-dro1d.org](https://whois.icann.org/lookup?name=f-dro1d.org). (donations of more are welcome!)"
msgstr ""
"F-Droid Limited mengelola sejumlah domain yang berpotensi digunakan untuk phishing, seperti [fdroid.org](https://whois.icann.org/lookup?name=fdroid.org), [f-droid.com](https://whois.icann.org/lookup?name=f-droid.com), dan [f-dro1d.org](https://whois.icann.org/lookup?name=f-dro1d.org).  \n"
"(Donasi domain lain untuk perlindungan tambahan juga terbuka!)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "website is [statically generated](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website) to greatly reduce the attack surface"
msgstr "Situs web F-Droid [dibangun secara statis](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website), yang secara drastis mengurangi permukaan serangan keamanan."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "website is fully functional when JavaScript is disabled in the browser, eliminating all possibility of XSS attacks"
msgstr "situs web berfungsi sepenuhnya ketika JavaScript dinonaktifkan di browser, sehingga menghilangkan seluruh kemungkinan serangan XSS"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "F-Droid as built-in app store"
msgstr "F-Droid sebagai app store bawaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "When F-Droid is built into Android, either as part of the ROM or by flashing an [OTA update]({{ site.baseurl }}/packages/org.fdroid.fdroid.privileged.ota/), it no longer needs \"Unknown Sources\" enabled to function.  This is the preferred method of operation, so we aim to make it as easy as possible for users to run F-Droid this way.  Flashing the OTA package for F-Droid [Privileged Extension](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/privileged-extension/#how-do-i-install-it-on-my-device)  has the same or lower risk profile as installing the standard \"gapps\" package that many people flash onto custom ROMs. So this delivery method does not increase the risk profile of those users."
msgstr "Ketika F-Droid dibangun ke dalam Android, baik sebagai bagian dari ROM maupun dengan mem-flash [OTA update]({{ site.baseurl }}/packages/org.fdroid.fdroid.privileged.ota/), F-Droid tidak lagi memerlukan \"Unknown Sources\" yang diaktifkan agar dapat berfungsi. Ini adalah metode operasi yang lebih disukai, jadi kami berupaya membuatnya semudah mungkin bagi pengguna untuk menjalankan F-Droid dengan cara ini. Mem-flash paket OTA untuk [Privileged Extension](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/privileged-extension/#how-do-i-install-it-on-my-device) F-Droid memiliki profil risiko yang sama atau lebih rendah dibanding memasang paket \"gapps\" standar yang banyak orang flash ke custom ROM. Jadi metode pengiriman ini tidak meningkatkan profil risiko pengguna tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "On top of this, F-Droid makes it as easy as possible to [build it into](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/privileged-extension/#how-do-i-build-it-into-my-rom)  ROM projects.  It is already included in [CalyxOS](https://calyxos.org/), [Replicant](https://www.replicant.us/), [LineageOS for microG](https://lineage.microg.org/) and [Fairphone Open](https://code.fairphone.com/projects/fp-osos/)."
msgstr "Selain itu, F-Droid dibuat semudah mungkin untuk [dibangun ke dalam](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/privileged-extension/#how-do-i-build-it-into-my-rom) proyek ROM. F-Droid sudah disertakan di [CalyxOS](https://calyxos.org/), [Replicant](https://www.replicant.us/), [LineageOS for microG](https://lineage.microg.org/), dan [Fairphone Open](https://code.fairphone.com/projects/fp-osos/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Protecting against malicious contributor-generated data"
msgstr "Perlindungan terhadap data yang dihasilkan oleh contributor yang berbahaya"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "The app descriptions are submitted by all sorts of people, and they can also be taken from the app's source repository.  This data is ultimately delivered to the Android client or the user's browser via _f-droid.org_."
msgstr ""
"Deskripsi aplikasi di F-Droid dikirimkan oleh berbagai pihak dan terkadang diambil langsung dari repositori sumber kode aplikasi.  \n"
"Data tersebut pada akhirnya disalurkan ke aplikasi klien Android atau ditampilkan di situs web _f-droid.org_."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "the Android client never runs CSS, JavaScript, or dangerous HTML tags since it displays HTML via [`android.text.Html.fromHtml()`](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/1.3.1/app/src/main/java/org/fdroid/fdroid/views/AppDetailsRecyclerViewAdapter.java#L441) with image loading disabled"
msgstr "Aplikasi klien Android tidak pernah mengeksekusi CSS, JavaScript, atau tag HTML berbahaya, karena menampilkan konten HTML menggunakan metode [`android.text.Html.fromHtml()`](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/blob/1.3.1/app/src/main/java/org/fdroid/fdroid/views/AppDetailsRecyclerViewAdapter.java#L441) dengan pemuatan gambar dinonaktifkan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "the _f-droid.org_ website protects against malicious and CSS/HTML/JavaScript injection with a [strict HTTP Content Security Policy](https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze/f-droid.org)."
msgstr "Situs web _f-droid.org_ melindungi dari injeksi berbahaya serta CSS/HTML/JavaScript dengan [HTTP Content Security Policy yang ketat](https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze/f-droid.org)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "Repomaker filters the texts through Mozilla's [_bleach_](https://github.com/mozilla/bleach) and has a good [HTTP Content Security Policy](https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze.html?host=repomaker.grobox.de)."
msgstr "Repomaker menyaring teks melalui [_bleach_](https://github.com/mozilla/bleach) milik Mozilla dan memiliki [HTTP Content Security Policy](https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze.html?host=repomaker.grobox.de) yang baik."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTPS/TLS configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi HTTPS/TLS"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "F-Droid has a long history of supporting all Android devices that are still running, that means maintaining compatibility as long as possible.  Towards that end, as long as users running current Android versions are not put at risk, old TLS configurations are still supported.  This is why we leave TLSv1.0 and TLSv1.1 enabled on our websites.   We believe there is no added risk for people who keep their software updated. And a device running Android 1.6 should be able to install an old version of F-Droid, and have a working app store.\n"
msgstr "F-Droid memiliki sejarah panjang dalam mendukung semua perangkat Android yang masih digunakan, yang berarti menjaga kompatibilitas selama mungkin. Untuk itu, selama pengguna yang menjalankan versi Android saat ini tidak berada dalam risiko, konfigurasi TLS lama masih didukung. Inilah sebabnya kami tetap membiarkan TLSv1.0 dan TLSv1.1 aktif di situs web kami. Kami percaya tidak ada risiko tambahan bagi orang-orang yang menjaga software mereka tetap diperbarui. Dan perangkat yang menjalankan Android 1.6 seharusnya tetap bisa memasang versi lama F-Droid, serta memiliki app store yang berfungsi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "Some security scanners will flag this site because TLSv1.1 and TLSv1.0 are still supported.  More importantly, this site supports TLSv1.3 and TLSv1.2, both of which offer downgrade protections.  On top of that, the latest browsers and F-Droid clients [entirely](https://blog.mozilla.org/security/2018/10/15/removing-old-versions-of-tls/) [disable](https://webkit.org/blog/8462/deprecation-of-legacy-tls-1-0-and-1-1-versions/) [TLSv1.1](https://blogs.windows.com/msedgedev/2018/10/15/modernizing-tls-edge-ie11/) and [TLSv1.0](https://security.googleblog.com/2018/10/modernizing-transport-security.html), making it impossible to force those devices to use those vulnerable TLS versions.  So the only connections using old TLS versions actually needs those old versions to function.  If you are on a device that still needs to use TLS 1.0 or 1.1, then there are already so many well known security vulnerabilities that this one is not particularly interesting."
msgstr "Beberapa pemindai keamanan akan menandai situs ini karena TLSv1.1 dan TLSv1.0 masih didukung. Yang lebih penting, situs ini mendukung TLSv1.3 dan TLSv1.2, yang keduanya menawarkan proteksi downgrade. Selain itu, browser terbaru dan F-Droid client [sepenuhnya](https://blog.mozilla.org/security/2018/10/15/removing-old-versions-of-tls/) [menonaktifkan](https://webkit.org/blog/8462/deprecation-of-legacy-tls-1-0-and-1-1-versions/) [TLSv1.1](https://blogs.windows.com/msedgedev/2018/10/15/modernizing-tls-edge-ie11/) dan [TLSv1.0](https://security.googleblog.com/2018/10/modernizing-transport-security.html), sehingga tidak mungkin memaksa perangkat tersebut menggunakan versi TLS yang rentan itu. Jadi satu-satunya koneksi yang menggunakan versi TLS lama memang membutuhkan versi lama tersebut agar dapat berfungsi. Jika Anda menggunakan perangkat yang masih perlu memakai TLS 1.0 atau 1.1, maka sudah ada begitu banyak kerentanan keamanan yang terkenal sehingga yang satu ini tidak terlalu menarik."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "If you would like to test whether your browser still supports TLS 1.0 or 1.1, click on the links below and see if they give you an error message."
msgstr "Jika ingin menguji apakah peramban Anda masih mendukung TLS 1.0 atau 1.1, klik tautan di bawah dan lihat apakah muncul pesan kesalahan."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "<https://tls-v1-0.badssl.com:1010/>"
msgstr "<https://tls-v1-0.badssl.com:1010/>"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "<https://tls-v1-1.badssl.com:1011/>"
msgstr "<https://tls-v1-1.badssl.com:1011/>"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security Audits"
msgstr "Security Audits"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "There was a quick, informal [security audit](https://dev.guardianproject.info/projects/bazaar/wiki/Initial_FDroid_Audit_by_pd0x) ([_archived_](https://web.archive.org/web/20170317154208/https://dev.guardianproject.info/projects/bazaar/wiki/Initial_FDroid_Audit_by_pd0x)) done in 2013 by then graduate student Daniel McCarney aka _pd0x_."
msgstr ""
"Audit keamanan cepat dan informal dilakukan pada tahun 2013 oleh mahasiswa pascasarjana Daniel McCarney (alias _pd0x_).  \n"
"Hasil audit dapat dibaca di [tautan ini](https://dev.guardianproject.info/projects/bazaar/wiki/Initial_FDroid_Audit_by_pd0x) ([_arsip_](https://web.archive.org/web/20170317154208/https://dev.guardianproject.info/projects/bazaar/wiki/Initial_FDroid_Audit_by_pd0x))."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "The first \"Bazaar\" project funded by [Open Tech Fund](https://opentech.fund) included an [external public audit]({{ site.baseurl }}/2018/01/20/upcoming-security-audit.html) from [Cure53](https://cure53.de)"
msgstr "Proyek pertama “Bazaar” yang didanai oleh [Open Tech Fund](https://opentech.fund) mencakup [audit publik eksternal]({{ site.baseurl }}/2018/01/20/upcoming-security-audit.html) oleh [Cure53](https://cure53.de)."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "The second \"Bazaar 2\" project funded by Open Tech Fund included an [external public audit]({{ site.baseurl }}/2018/09/04/second-security-audit-results.html) from [Radically Open Security](https://radicallyopensecurity.com/)"
msgstr "Project kedua \"Bazaar 2\" yang didanai Open Tech Fund mencakup [audit publik eksternal]({{ site.baseurl }}/2018/09/04/second-security-audit-results.html) dari [Radically Open Security](https://radicallyopensecurity.com/)"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: _docs/Security_Model.md
msgid "The NLnet-funded projects \"Tracking the Trackers\" and \"The Search for Ethical Apps\" provided an [audit]({% post_url 2022-12-22-third-audit-results %}) performed by [Radically Open Security](https://radicallyopensecurity.com/)"
msgstr "Project yang didanai NLnet, yaitu \"Tracking the Trackers\" dan \"The Search for Ethical Apps\", menyediakan [audit]({% post_url 2022-12-22-third-audit-results %}) yang dilakukan oleh [Radically Open Security](https://radicallyopensecurity.com/)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup an F-Droid App Repo"
msgstr "Siapkan Repo Aplikasi F-Droid"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "F-Droid.org is the default package repository (repo) in the F-Droid client, but it is not the only possibility. Anyone can create their own repo, and users can control which repos their client is using, including even disabling the default f-droid.org repo. This model is modeled somewhat after the [Debian GNU/Linux](https://www.debian.org)  distro.  Like Debian and Ubuntu, you can also setup your own repos for anyone to use.  Custom repos do not even need to build the APKs, they can just be \"simple binary repos\" of any APKs."
msgstr "F-Droid.org adalah repository paket default (repo) di F-Droid client, tetapi itu bukan satu-satunya kemungkinan. Siapa pun dapat membuat repo mereka sendiri, dan pengguna dapat mengontrol repo mana yang digunakan client mereka, termasuk bahkan menonaktifkan repo default f-droid.org. Model ini agak menyerupai distro [Debian GNU/Linux](https://www.debian.org). Seperti Debian dan Ubuntu, Anda juga dapat menyiapkan repo sendiri untuk digunakan siapa pun. Custom repo bahkan tidak perlu membangun APK; repo tersebut bisa saja berupa \"simple binary repos\" dari APK apa pun."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "If you want to maintain a simple binary repository of APKs and packages obtained elsewhere, the process is quite simple:"
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin memelihara repositori biner sederhana berisi APK dan paket yang diperoleh dari sumber lain, prosesnya cukup mudah:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "[Set up the server tools](../Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools)"
msgstr "[Pasang alat server dan repo](../Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools)."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Create a directory called _fdroid_, then run `fdroid init` in that directory to generate the signing key that uniquely identifies your repo."
msgstr "Buat direktori bernama _fdroid_, lalu jalankan `fdroid init` di dalam direktori tersebut untuk menghasilkan kunci tanda tangan yang akan menjadi identitas unik repositori Anda."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Optionally edit the _config.yml_ file to your liking, detailed examples are in [examples/config.yml](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/master/examples/config.yml)"
msgstr ""
"Secara opsional, Anda dapat mengedit file _config.yml_ sesuai kebutuhan.  \n"
"Contoh lengkap tersedia di [examples/config.yml](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/master/examples/config.yml)."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Within _fdroid_, make a directory called _repo_ and put APK files in it."
msgstr "Di dalam direktori _fdroid_, buat subdirektori bernama _repo_ lalu masukkan file APK ke dalamnya."

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Run `fdroid update`."
msgstr "Jalankan perintah `fdroid update`."

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "If it reports that any metadata files are missing, you can create them in the `metadata` directory and run it again."
msgstr "Jika dilaporkan ada file metadata yang hilang, Anda dapat membuatnya di direktori `metadata` lalu menjalankannya lagi."

#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "To ease creation of metadata files, run `fdroid update` with the `-c` option. It will create 'skeleton' metadata files that are missing, and you can then just edit them and fill in the details."
msgstr "Untuk memudahkan pembuatan file metadata, jalankan `fdroid update` dengan opsi `-c`. Perintah ini akan membuat file metadata 'skeleton' yang belum ada, lalu Anda cukup mengeditnya dan mengisi detailnya."

#. type: Bullet: '8. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Then, if you've changed things, run `fdroid update` again."
msgstr "Jika Anda melakukan perubahan, jalankan kembali `fdroid update`."

#. type: Bullet: '9. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Running `fdroid update` adds an _icons_ directory into the repo directory, and also creates the repository index files (_index.xml_, _index.jar_, etc) __NOTE: To make this process secure, read [Real World Setup](#real-world-setup) below!__"
msgstr ""
"Menjalankan `fdroid update` akan menambahkan folder _icons_ ke dalam direktori _repo_ dan menghasilkan berkas indeks repositori seperti (_index.xml_, _index.jar_, dan lainnya).  \n"
"__Catatan: untuk memastikan keamanan proses ini, baca bagian [Real World Setup](#real-world-setup) di bawah!__"

#. type: Bullet: '10. '
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Publish the resulting contents of the _repo_ directory to your web server (or set `serverwebroot` in your _config.yml_ then use `fdroid deploy`)"
msgstr "Publikasikan seluruh isi direktori _repo_ ke server web Anda (atau tentukan `serverwebroot` di _config.yml_ kemudian jalankan `fdroid deploy`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Following the above process will result in a _repo_ directory, which you simply need to push to any HTTP (or preferably HTTPS) server to make it accessible."
msgstr "Mengikuti proses di atas akan menghasilkan direktori _repo_, yang cukup Anda unggah ke server HTTP mana pun (atau lebih disukai HTTPS) agar dapat diakses."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "While some information about the applications (and versions thereof)  is retrieved directly from the APK files, most comes from the corresponding file in the _metadata/_ directory. The [metadata file](../Build_Metadata_Reference) covering ALL versions of a particular application is named _package.id.yml_ where package.id is the unique identifier for that package.  All build metadata fields are relevant for binary APKs, except for `Builds:` entries, which should be omitted."
msgstr "Walaupun sebagian informasi tentang aplikasi (dan versinya) diambil langsung dari file APK, sebagian besar berasal dari file terkait di direktori _metadata/_. [File metadata](../Build_Metadata_Reference) yang mencakup SEMUA versi dari aplikasi tertentu diberi nama _package.id.yml_ di mana package.id adalah identifier unik untuk paket tersebut. Semua field build metadata relevan untuk APK binary, kecuali entri `Builds:`, yang harus dihilangkan."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local Demo Repo HOWTO"
msgstr "Local Demo Repo HOWTO"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "This is a full HOWTO to setup your own repository wherever you want to host it. It is somewhat technical, you will use the terminal, but you don't need to be a terminal expert to follow along. First, this HOWTO will walk through setting up a test repo that is not very secure. Then it will walk through setting up a repo for real world use, with the signing key on a separate machine from the public webserver. Before you start, you need to get [the `fdroidserver` tools](../Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools)  and a webserver. For the webserver, this HOWTO will use _nginx_ since its lightweight, but any will do if you already have one running."
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menjelaskan secara lengkap cara membuat repositori F-Droid Anda sendiri di mana pun ingin Anda host.  \n"
"Panduan ini bersifat teknis, menggunakan terminal, tetapi Anda tidak perlu menjadi ahli untuk mengikutinya.  \n"
"\n"
"Pertama, panduan ini menunjukkan cara membuat repositori uji sederhana yang belum aman.  \n"
"Kemudian dijelaskan cara membuat repositori yang benar-benar siap produksi, dengan memisahkan mesin yang menyimpan kunci tanda tangan dari server web publik.  \n"
"\n"
"Sebelum memulai, pastikan Anda sudah memasang [alat `fdroidserver`](../Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools) dan server web.  \n"
"Panduan ini menggunakan _nginx_ sebagai contoh karena ringan, tetapi Anda dapat menggunakan web server lainnya jika sudah tersedia."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo apt-get install nginx\n"
msgstr "sudo apt-get install nginx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "In the case of this HOWTO, we're going to setup a \"simple binary repository\" to host a collection of APKs. The repo will be set up in the recommended _fdroid/_ subdirectory. This gives the `fdroid` tool its own directory to work in, and makes the repo URL clearly marked as an F-Droid repo. Also, the F-Droid client will automatically search for a repository at the _/fdroid/repo_ path if the user only enters the server (e.g. \"https://f-droid.org\"). Let's give our normal user control over this subdirectory in the web root so that we don't need to run the F-Droid tools as root (with _nginx_, the webroot is _/usr/share/nginx/www_, it is different for other webservers):"
msgstr "Dalam HOWTO ini, kita akan menyiapkan sebuah \"simple binary repository\" untuk menampung kumpulan APK. Repo akan disiapkan di subdirektori _fdroid/_ yang direkomendasikan. Ini memberi tool `fdroid` direktori tersendiri untuk bekerja, dan membuat URL repo dengan jelas ditandai sebagai repo F-Droid. Selain itu, F-Droid client akan secara otomatis mencari repository pada path _/fdroid/repo_ jika pengguna hanya memasukkan server saja (misalnya \"https://f-droid.org\"). Mari kita beri pengguna normal kendali atas subdirektori ini di web root agar kita tidak perlu menjalankan tool F-Droid sebagai root (dengan _nginx_, webroot-nya adalah _/usr/share/nginx/www_, dan berbeda untuk web server lain):"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo mkdir /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid\n"
"sudo chown -R $USER /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid\n"
"cd /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid\n"
"fdroid init\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo mkdir /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid\n"
"sudo chown -R $USER /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid\n"
"cd /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid\n"
"fdroid init\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Now put your APK files into _/usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/repo_ and you are ready to run the commands to build the repo (if `fdroid init` cannot find your Android SDK in _/opt/android-sdk_ or `$ANDROID_HOME`, it will prompt you for the path):"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, masukkan file APK Anda ke direktori _/usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/repo_, lalu jalankan perintah untuk membangun repositori.  \n"
"Jika `fdroid init` tidak menemukan Android SDK di _/opt/android-sdk_ atau di variabel `$ANDROID_HOME`, program akan meminta Anda untuk menentukan jalurnya."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid\n"
"cp /path/to/\\*.apk /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/repo/\n"
"fdroid update --create-metadata\n"
msgstr ""
"cd /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid\n"
"cp /path/to/\\*.apk /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/repo/\n"
"fdroid update --create-metadata\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Voila! Now you have a working F-Droid Repo! Remember, this is __just a test__ setup, remember to move on to the [Real World Setup](#real-world-setup) after this! Add your new repo to an F-Droid client on your Android device to test it out. That is done in the __Manage Repos__ screen available from the menu. Your repo URL will be the hostname or IP address of your machine with `/fdroid/repo/` added to the end of it, i.e.  `https://mysecureserver.com/fdroid/repo/` or `http://192.168.2.53/fdroid/repo/`. You can temporarily uncheck the official repos to easily see what F-Droid found in your new repo."
msgstr "Selesai! Sekarang Anda punya Repo F-Droid yang berfungsi! Ingat, ini __hanya setup uji coba__, jadi pastikan untuk melanjutkan ke [Setup Dunia Nyata](#real-world-setup) setelah ini! Tambahkan repo baru Anda ke client F-Droid di perangkat Android Anda untuk mengujinya. Itu dilakukan di layar __Manage Repos__ yang tersedia dari menu. URL repo Anda adalah hostname atau alamat IP mesin Anda dengan `/fdroid/repo/` ditambahkan di bagian akhir, misalnya `https://mysecureserver.com/fdroid/repo/` atau `http://192.168.2.53/fdroid/repo/`. Anda dapat sementara menonaktifkan centang repo resmi agar lebih mudah melihat apa yang ditemukan F-Droid di repo baru Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "While you can serve the repository at an arbitrary URL, it is customary to make it available at an URL ending with `/fdroid/repo/`.  A good reason to actually do this is that the F-Droid client sets up an intent filter and registers itself for such URLs. As a result, a user that has the F-Droid app installed and opens such a well-formed URL will have their device open F-Droid and guide them directly to adding the repository to it."
msgstr "Walaupun Anda dapat menyajikan repository di URL mana pun, kebiasaan yang umum adalah membuatnya tersedia pada URL yang berakhir dengan `/fdroid/repo/`. Alasan yang baik untuk benar-benar melakukan ini adalah bahwa F-Droid client menetapkan intent filter dan mendaftarkan dirinya untuk URL seperti itu. Akibatnya, pengguna yang memiliki aplikasi F-Droid terpasang dan membuka URL yang diformat dengan baik tersebut akan membuat perangkat mereka membuka F-Droid dan memandu mereka langsung untuk menambahkan repository ke dalamnya."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customization"
msgstr "Kustomisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "You can also customize your repo by editing the config file. Be sure to use a programming text editor, like `editor /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/config.yml`. In the config file, you can set the name of the repo, the description, the icon, paths to specific versions of the build tools, links to a related wiki, and whether to keep stats. Here's the basic repo description block:"
msgstr "Anda juga dapat menyesuaikan repo Anda dengan mengedit file config. Pastikan menggunakan editor teks pemrograman, seperti `editor /usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/config.yml`. Di file config, Anda dapat mengatur nama repo, deskripsi, ikon, path ke versi tertentu dari build tools, tautan ke wiki terkait, dan apakah statistik akan disimpan. Berikut blok deskripsi repo dasarnya:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"repo_url = \"http://guardianproject.info/fdroid/repo\"\n"
"repo_name = \"My Local Repo\"\n"
"repo_icon = \"GP_Logo_hires.png\"\n"
"repo_description = \"\"\"\n"
"A local test repository of Hans-Christoph Steiner <hans@guardianproject.info>.\n"
"It is a repository of Guardian Project apps. \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"repo_url = \"http://guardianproject.info/fdroid/repo\"\n"
"repo_name = \"My Local Repo\"\n"
"repo_icon = \"GP_Logo_hires.png\"\n"
"repo_description = \"\"\"\n"
"A local test repository of Hans-Christoph Steiner <hans@guardianproject.info>.\n"
"It is a repository of Guardian Project apps. \"\"\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "To put your icon into your repo, choose a PNG image to put in your repo.  The PNG goes in `/usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/`, the file can be named whatever you want (by default its `fdroid-icon.png`). If you change the name from the default, be sure to update `repo_icon` and `archive_icon` in `/usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/config.yml`."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menambahkan ikon ke repositori, pilih gambar PNG dan letakkan di direktori `/usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/`.  \n"
"Nama file bisa bebas (secara default, `fdroid-icon.png`).  \n"
"Jika Anda mengganti nama ikon, pastikan memperbarui entri `repo_icon` dan `archive_icon` di `/usr/share/nginx/www/fdroid/config.yml`."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "A final note about security: this setup is not a good setup for a real public repo, instead it is a quick and easy way to test out F-Droid. At the very least, when generating the repo in place, make sure that _config.yml_ is not accessible via the web, since it contains passwords. If the file permissions are correct (e.g.  `chmod 0600 config.yml`), then _config.yml_ will not be readable by the webserver."
msgstr "Catatan terakhir tentang keamanan: setup ini bukan setup yang baik untuk repo publik yang sesungguhnya, melainkan cara cepat dan mudah untuk mencoba F-Droid. Paling tidak, saat menghasilkan repo langsung di tempat, pastikan _config.yml_ tidak dapat diakses melalui web, karena file itu berisi password. Jika file permission sudah benar (misalnya `chmod 0600 config.yml`), maka _config.yml_ tidak akan dapat dibaca oleh webserver."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App Metadata"
msgstr "Metadata Aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "You can control lots of aspects of how an app is represented in your repo by editing the app's metadata. Running `fdroid update --create-metadata` creates stub files for you, in order to have a working repo. Then you can edit those files to add a description, donation links, bug tracker, license, home page, etc. See the [Build Metadata Reference](../Build_Metadata_Reference) for more info on what all the options are."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengontrol banyak aspek tentang bagaimana sebuah aplikasi direpresentasikan di repo Anda dengan mengedit metadata aplikasi tersebut. Menjalankan `fdroid update --create-metadata` membuat file stub untuk Anda, agar repo dapat berfungsi. Setelah itu, Anda dapat mengedit file-file tersebut untuk menambahkan deskripsi, link donasi, bug tracker, lisensi, halaman beranda, dan sebagainya. Lihat [Build Metadata Reference](../Build_Metadata_Reference) untuk info lebih lanjut tentang semua opsi yang tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "_CurrentVersionCode_ provides a handy way to deploy beta releases in the same stream as your full releases. You can set _CurrentVersionCode_ to your current stable release, then add APKs to your repo. Users will only be updated automatically to the version code you specify. Any APKs for a given app in your repo that have a newer version code will not be automatically installed. Instead, the user can see them in the app detail view in the client, and can manually install them."
msgstr "_CurrentVersionCode_ menyediakan cara yang praktis untuk men-deploy rilis beta dalam alur yang sama dengan rilis penuh Anda. Anda dapat mengatur _CurrentVersionCode_ ke rilis stabil Anda saat ini, lalu menambahkan APK ke repo Anda. Pengguna hanya akan diperbarui secara otomatis ke version code yang Anda tentukan. APK apa pun untuk aplikasi tertentu di repo Anda yang memiliki version code lebih baru tidak akan diinstal secara otomatis. Sebagai gantinya, pengguna dapat melihatnya di tampilan detail aplikasi di client, dan dapat menginstalnya secara manual."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Real World Setup"
msgstr "Setup Dunia Nyata"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Now that you have a working repo, it is straightforward to create a real world setup. Generating a repo in place like we did above is very easy, that is why this HOWTO started there, but it is not as secure as it should be if your repo is going to be your main distribution point. For example, the repo signing keys should not ever be on a public server."
msgstr "Sekarang setelah Anda memiliki repo yang berfungsi, cukup mudah untuk membuat setup dunia nyata. Membuat repo di tempat seperti yang kita lakukan di atas memang sangat mudah; itulah mengapa HOWTO ini dimulai dari sana, tetapi setup itu tidak seaman yang seharusnya jika repo Anda akan menjadi titik distribusi utama. Misalnya, signing key repo seharusnya tidak pernah berada di server publik."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "To improve this situation, generate the repo on a non-public machine like your laptop, keeping _config.yml_ and the keystore only on that machine (remember to make backups!). Then use `fdroid deploy` to publish the changes to your repo on a separate server via ssh. So start a new repo from scratch on your non-public machine:"
msgstr "Untuk memperbaiki situasi ini, buat repo di mesin non-publik seperti laptop Anda, simpan _config.yml_ dan keystore hanya di mesin itu (ingat untuk membuat cadangan!). Lalu gunakan `fdroid deploy` untuk memublikasikan perubahan ke repo Anda di server terpisah melalui ssh. Jadi, mulailah repo baru dari awal di mesin non-publik Anda:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir ~/fdroid\n"
"cd ~/fdroid\n"
"fdroid init\n"
"cp /path/to/\\*.apk ~/fdroid/repo/\n"
"fdroid update --create-metadata\n"
"emacs config.yml # add the serverwebroot, etc.\n"
"fdroid deploy -v\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir ~/fdroid\n"
"cd ~/fdroid\n"
"fdroid init\n"
"cp /path/to/\\*.apk ~/fdroid/repo/\n"
"fdroid update --create-metadata\n"
"emacs config.yml # add the serverwebroot, etc.\n"
"fdroid deploy -v\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Now edit _config.yml_ to set `serverwebroot`, it is in the form of a standard SCP file destination. Then `fdroid deploy` will do the publishing via rsync over ssh. So both computers will have to have ssh and rsync installed and setup. You can also use your own existing signing key rather than the one generated by `fdroid init`, just edit `repo_keyalias`, `keystore`, `keystorepass`, `keypass`, and `keydname` in _~/fdroid/config.yml_."
msgstr "Sekarang edit _config.yml_ untuk mengatur `serverwebroot`, yang berbentuk seperti destination file SCP standar. Lalu `fdroid deploy` akan melakukan publishing melalui rsync via ssh. Jadi, kedua komputer harus memiliki ssh dan rsync yang terpasang serta disiapkan. Anda juga dapat menggunakan signing key Anda sendiri yang sudah ada alih-alih yang dibuat oleh `fdroid init`, cukup edit `repo_keyalias`, `keystore`, `keystorepass`, `keypass`, dan `keydname` di _~/fdroid/config.yml_."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Setup_an_F-Droid_App_Repo.md
msgid "Additionally, if your repo has an archive, you may want to set up a rewrite rule from `repo/` to `archive/` in your webserver.  This is to ensure that old links keep working when an APK is moved from the repo to the archive.  See [this example](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/-/commit/900ee2a8179f1f3fd33bb37cce21f58ce9dcfb38) with Apache."
msgstr "Selain itu, jika repo Anda memiliki archive, Anda mungkin ingin menyiapkan rewrite rule dari `repo/` ke `archive/` di webserver Anda. Ini untuk memastikan tautan lama tetap berfungsi saat sebuah APK dipindahkan dari repo ke archive. Lihat [contoh ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/-/commit/900ee2a8179f1f3fd33bb37cce21f58ce9dcfb38) dengan Apache."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Signing Process"
msgstr "Proses Penandatanganan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "Cryptographic signatures using public/private key parts are central to [how F-Droid](../Security_Model) provides secure app distribution. Signing keys are required to make your own releases with the F-Droid tools.  Consider the location, security and backup status of your key files carefully.  The keys need to remain secure for the entire lifetime of an F-Droid repo, or an Android app.  The signing key is central the identity of an Android app and an F-Droid repo, so those keys must be kept safe, secure and well backed up! Also, take note that Google's directions for [securing these private keys](https://developer.android.com/studio/publish/app-signing.html#secure-key)  provides only the minimal steps to take to safeguard the keys."
msgstr ""
"Tanda tangan kriptografi berbasis pasangan kunci publik/pribadi merupakan bagian penting dari mekanisme F-Droid dalam [menyediakan distribusi aplikasi yang aman](../Security_Model).  \n"
"Kunci penandatangan diperlukan untuk membuat rilis Anda sendiri menggunakan alat F-Droid.  \n"
"\n"
"Pertimbangkan dengan cermat lokasi penyimpanan, keamanan, dan strategi cadangan untuk berkas kunci tersebut.  \n"
"Kunci harus dijaga aman sepanjang umur repositori F-Droid maupun aplikasi Android yang ditandatanganinya.  \n"
"Kunci tanda tangan adalah identitas inti dari aplikasi Android dan repositori F-Droid, sehingga wajib disimpan secara aman dan memiliki cadangan yang baik.  \n"
"\n"
"Perlu dicatat juga bahwa panduan resmi Google untuk [mengamankan kunci privat](https://developer.android.com/studio/publish/app-signing.html#secure-key) hanya mencakup langkah-langkah minimal untuk perlindungan dasar."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "There are two kinds of signing involved in running a repository:"
msgstr "Ada dua jenis proses penandatangan dalam menjalankan repositori:"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "the signing of the repo index itself"
msgstr "1. Penandatanganan indeks repositori."

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "the standard Android APK signing process"
msgstr "proses penandatanganan APK Android standar"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repo Index Signing"
msgstr "Penandatanganan Indeks Repo"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "When setting up the repository, one of the first steps should be to generate a signing key for the repository index. This will also create a keystore, which is the file that holds the signing keys."
msgstr "Saat menyiapkan repository, salah satu langkah pertama seharusnya adalah menghasilkan signing key untuk repository index. Ini juga akan membuat keystore, yaitu file yang menyimpan signing key."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "`fdroid init` will automatically create a new signing key for an F-Droid repo.  It is possible to manually create keys just like creating [Android signing keys](https://developer.android.com/studio/publish/app-signing.html#signing-manually), with a command like:"
msgstr ""
"`fdroid init` akan secara otomatis membuat kunci tanda tangan baru untuk repositori F-Droid.  \n"
"Namun, kunci ini juga dapat dibuat secara manual seperti halnya [kunci tanda tangan Android](https://developer.android.com/studio/publish/app-signing.html#signing-manually), dengan perintah seperti berikut:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"keytool -genkey -v -keystore my.keystore -alias repokey \\\n"
"  -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000\n"
msgstr ""
"keytool -genkey -v -keystore my.keystore -alias repokey \\\n"
"  -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "In the above, replace _my.keystore_ with the name of the keystore file to be created, and 'repokey' with a name to identify the repo index key by.  You'll be asked for a password for the keystore, AND a password for the key. They shouldn't be the same. In between, you'll be asked for some identifying details which will go in the certificate."
msgstr "Pada contoh di atas, ganti _my.keystore_ dengan nama file keystore yang akan dibuat, dan 'repokey' dengan nama untuk mengidentifikasi key index repo. Anda akan diminta memasukkan kata sandi untuk keystore, DAN kata sandi untuk key. Keduanya sebaiknya tidak sama. Di antara itu, Anda akan diminta memasukkan beberapa detail identifikasi yang akan masuk ke sertifikat."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "The two passwords entered go into _config.yml_, as `keystorepass` and `keypass` respectively. The path to the keystore file is set in `keystore`, and the alias you chose for the key also go into that file is called `repo_keyalias`."
msgstr "Dua kata sandi yang dimasukkan masuk ke _config.yml_, masing-masing sebagai `keystorepass` dan `keypass`. Path ke file keystore diatur di `keystore`, dan alias yang Anda pilih untuk key juga masuk ke file tersebut yang disebut `repo_keyalias`."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "APK Signing"
msgstr "Penandatanganan APK"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "The F-Droid tools can automatic generate and manage APK signing keys for each app that it maintains.  With the repo index signing configured, all that remains to be done for package signing to work is to set the _keydname_ field in _config.yml_ to contain the same identifying details you entered before.  A new key will be generated using these details, for each application that is built. If a specific key is required for a particular application, this system can be overridden using the _keyaliases_ config settings."
msgstr "Alat F-Droid dapat secara otomatis menghasilkan dan mengelola APK signing key untuk setiap aplikasi yang dikelolanya. Dengan signing repo index yang sudah dikonfigurasi, satu-satunya yang masih perlu dilakukan agar package signing berfungsi adalah mengatur field _keydname_ di _config.yml_ agar berisi detail identifikasi yang sama seperti yang Anda masukkan sebelumnya. Kunci baru akan dihasilkan menggunakan detail ini, untuk setiap aplikasi yang dibangun. Jika diperlukan kunci khusus untuk aplikasi tertentu, sistem ini dapat dioverride menggunakan pengaturan config _keyaliases_."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "To set up `fdroid publish`, do these steps on the same machine where you copy APKs to and run `fdroid update`.  First, set _keydname_ in _config.yml_, it should be something like this:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menyiapkan perintah `fdroid publish`, lakukan langkah-langkah berikut di mesin yang sama tempat Anda menyalin file APK dan menjalankan `fdroid update`.  \n"
"Pertama, atur nilai `keydname` di file _config.yml_ dengan format seperti contoh berikut:"

#. type: Fenced code block (python)
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "keydname = \"CN=example.com, O=Example Ltd, C=UK\"\n"
msgstr "keydname = \"CN=example.com, O=Example Ltd, C=UK\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "Create a dir called _unsigned/_ next to the _metadata/_ and _repo/_ dirs, and run these commands to move the APK into place with a new name based on _Application ID_ and _Version Code_:"
msgstr "Buat direktori bernama _unsigned/_ di samping direktori _metadata/_ dan _repo/_, lalu jalankan perintah berikut untuk memindahkan file APK ke lokasi baru dengan nama berdasarkan _Application ID_ dan _Version Code_:"

#. type: Fenced code block (console)
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ cd /path/to/repobasedir\n"
"$ touch metadata/com.example.app.yml\n"
"$ mkdir unsigned\n"
"$ cp /path/to/app-release-unsigned.apk unsigned/com.example.app_1234.apk\n"
"$ fdroid publish --verbose\n"
"$ fdroid update --verbose\n"
"$ fdroid deploy --verbose\n"
msgstr ""
"$ cd /path/to/repobasedir\n"
"$ touch metadata/com.example.app.yml\n"
"$ mkdir unsigned\n"
"$ cp /path/to/app-release-unsigned.apk unsigned/com.example.app_1234.apk\n"
"$ fdroid publish --verbose\n"
"$ fdroid update --verbose\n"
"$ fdroid deploy --verbose\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package Signing"
msgstr "Package Signing"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "All packages built and/or distributed using F-Droid tools can also be signed by PGP using [GnuPG](https://gnupg.org), anything from APKs to media files will be signed.  This process is run with `fdroid gpgsign`.  Add `gpghome` and `gpgkey` to your _config.yml_ to configure it, there is more information in _examples/config.yml_."
msgstr "Semua paket yang dibangun dan/atau didistribusikan menggunakan alat F-Droid juga dapat ditandatangani dengan PGP menggunakan [GnuPG](https://gnupg.org); apa pun mulai dari APK hingga file media akan ditandatangani. Proses ini dijalankan dengan `fdroid gpgsign`. Tambahkan `gpghome` dan `gpgkey` ke _config.yml_ Anda untuk mengonfigurasinya, terdapat informasi lebih lanjut di _examples/config.yml_."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Security Modules"
msgstr "Hardware Security Modules"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "Hardware Security Modules (HSMs) are specially designed pieces of hardware for securely storing and using cryptographic keys.  They provide write-only storage, so that a private key can only be written to the HSM and never read off of it.  _fdroidserver_ has support for using HSMs for repo signing keys."
msgstr "Hardware Security Module (HSM) adalah perangkat keras yang dirancang khusus untuk menyimpan dan menggunakan cryptographic key secara aman. HSM menyediakan write-only storage, sehingga private key hanya dapat ditulis ke HSM dan tidak pernah dapat dibaca kembali darinya. _fdroidserver_ mendukung penggunaan HSM untuk repo signing key."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "For information on how to configure an F-Droid repo to use an HSM, see the \"smartcard\" sections of _examples/config.yml_, specifically `keystore` and `smartcardoptions`.  Most likely, [OpenSC](https://github.com/OpenSC/OpenSC) will need to be set up as a PKCS11 provider for Java.  [_hsmwiz_](https://github.com/johndoe31415/hsmwiz) is a simpler way to work with smart card HSMs like the Nitrokey HSM.  Both OpenSC and _hsmwiz_ are available in Debian."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang cara mengonfigurasi repo F-Droid agar menggunakan HSM, lihat bagian \"smartcard\" pada _examples/config.yml_, khususnya `keystore` dan `smartcardoptions`. Kemungkinan besar, [OpenSC](https://github.com/OpenSC/OpenSC) perlu disiapkan sebagai PKCS11 provider untuk Java. [_hsmwiz_](https://github.com/johndoe31415/hsmwiz) adalah cara yang lebih sederhana untuk bekerja dengan smart card HSM seperti Nitrokey HSM. Baik OpenSC maupun _hsmwiz_ tersedia di Debian."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "For more in-depth information, see:"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "_fdroidserver_ example config file: [examples/config.yml](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/2.1a0/examples/config.yml#L125)"
msgstr "Contoh konfigurasi di _fdroidserver_: [examples/config.yml](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/2.1a0/examples/config.yml#L125)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "[Publishing an F-Droid Repo using a Hardware Security Module]({% post_url 2020-10-05-ntrokey-signing %})"
msgstr "Artikel: [Mempublikasikan Repositori F-Droid menggunakan Hardware Security Module]({% post_url 2020-10-05-ntrokey-signing %})"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Signing_Process.md
msgid "[Security in a thumb drive: the promise and pain of hardware security modules, take one!](https://guardianproject.info/2014/03/28/security-in-a-thumb-drive-the-promise-and-pain-of-hardware-security-modules-take-one/)"
msgstr "[Security in a thumb drive: the promise and pain of hardware security modules, take one!](https://guardianproject.info/2014/03/28/security-in-a-thumb-drive-the-promise-and-pain-of-hardware-security-modules-take-one/)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submitting to F-Droid Quick Start Guide"
msgstr "Panduan Mulai Cepat Mengajukan ke F-Droid"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "This is a step-by-step guide for packaging an app for F-Droid. It is apparently the best way to get an app into the repository, since you can provide a direct merge request for the metadata about your app, making it easy for the maintainers."
msgstr "Ini adalah panduan langkah demi langkah untuk memaketkan aplikasi untuk F-Droid. Tampaknya ini adalah cara terbaik untuk memasukkan aplikasi ke repository, karena Anda dapat mengirim merge request langsung untuk metadata tentang aplikasi Anda, sehingga memudahkan para maintainer."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare and compliance check"
msgstr "Persiapan dan pemeriksaan kepatuhan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Before proposing inclusion of an application, the compliance with the [Inclusion Policy](../Inclusion_Policy) should be checked carefully. Here is a short checklist."
msgstr "Sebelum mengusulkan inclusion sebuah aplikasi, kepatuhan terhadap [Inclusion Policy](../Inclusion_Policy) harus diperiksa dengan cermat. Berikut checklist singkatnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. The app should have a public source code repository and a FOSS license file. Please\n"
"  confirm that the repo has the real up-to-date source code in it instead of\n"
"  some dummy files as placeholder.\n"
"2. The app should only have FOSS dependencies. Firebase and GMS are some notable examples\n"
"  of non-FOSS libs that are not accepted. If the app can work (in some capacity) without these,\n"
"  please create a flavor/version without them.\n"
"  The build tools should also be FOSS. If a proprietary IDE is required then it can't be\n"
"  included. F-Droid builds from command line tools anyway, build instructions help contributors.\n"
"3. The author of the app has been notified (and does not oppose the inclusion). If you\n"
"  are not the author, please open an issue in the repo of the app, asking the author for\n"
"  the permission.\n"
"4. [The metadata files for descriptions](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots)\n"
"  are added to the repo. This is a simple structure with some text files and pictures and\n"
"  should always be added before inclusion. While the folder structure follows Fastlane/Triple-T,\n"
"  the actual tooling is not needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Aplikasi harus memiliki public source code repository dan file lisensi FOSS. Harap\n"
"  konfirmasi bahwa repo tersebut berisi source code yang benar dan terbaru, bukan\n"
"  file dummy sebagai placeholder.\n"
"2. Aplikasi hanya boleh memiliki dependensi FOSS. Firebase dan GMS adalah beberapa contoh penting\n"
"  dari libs non-FOSS yang tidak diterima. Jika aplikasi dapat berfungsi (dalam kapasitas apa pun) tanpa ini,\n"
"  harap buat flavor/version tanpa itu.\n"
"  Tool build juga harus FOSS. Jika diperlukan proprietary IDE, maka aplikasi tidak dapat\n"
"  disertakan. F-Droid membangun dari command line tools, jadi build instructions membantu contributor.\n"
"3. Penulis aplikasi telah diberi tahu (dan tidak menolak penyertaan). Jika Anda\n"
"  bukan penulisnya, harap buka issue di repo aplikasi, meminta izin dari penulis.\n"
"4. [File metadata untuk descriptions](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots)\n"
"  telah ditambahkan ke repo. Ini adalah struktur sederhana dengan beberapa file teks dan gambar dan\n"
"  seharusnya selalu ditambahkan sebelum inclusion. Walaupun struktur folder mengikuti Fastlane/Triple-T,\n"
"  tooling sebenarnya tidak diperlukan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "With all these requirements satisfied, this app should be ready for inclusion."
msgstr "Dengan semua persyaratan ini terpenuhi, aplikasi ini seharusnya siap untuk disertakan."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upstream metadata"
msgstr "Metadata upstream"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Each official release commit in the application's upstream Git repository should have a tag. For example, if its AndroidManifest contains `versionName: '1.0'`, the commit needs a `v1.0` tag. It is strongly encouraged to add metadata in the application's source repo, too:"
msgstr "Setiap release commit resmi di upstream Git repository aplikasi seharusnya memiliki tag. Misalnya, jika AndroidManifest berisi `versionName: '1.0'`, commit tersebut perlu tag `v1.0`. Sangat dianjurkan untuk menambahkan metadata di source repo aplikasi juga:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/short_description.txt_ (less than 80 characters, no trailing dot)"
msgstr "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/short_description.txt_ (kurang dari 80 karakter, tanpa titik di akhir)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/full_description.txt_"
msgstr "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/full_description.txt_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/icon.png_"
msgstr "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/icon.png_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/1.png_"
msgstr "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/1.png_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/2.png_"
msgstr "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/2.png_"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "If the AndroidManifest contains `versionCode: 123`, there should be a corresponding explanation of what's new in this version:"
msgstr "Jika AndroidManifest berisi `versionCode: 123`, maka harus ada penjelasan tentang perubahan pada versi tersebut:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/changelogs/123.txt_ (max 500 characters)"
msgstr "_fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/changelogs/123.txt_ (maks 500 karakter)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Browse the [F-Droid client metadata](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/-/tree/master/metadata/en-US)  directory to see a real-world example."
msgstr "Telusuri direktori [metadata klien F-Droid](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/-/tree/master/metadata/en-US) untuk melihat contoh dunia nyata."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Other formats and locations of the [description, graphics, and screenshots](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots/) are supported, too. For example, the _metadata/en-US_ directory can instead be _fastlane/metadata/android/en-US_."
msgstr "Format dan lokasi lain untuk [deskripsi, grafik, dan screenshot](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots/) juga didukung. Misalnya, direktori _metadata/en-US_ dapat diganti dengan _fastlane/metadata/android/en-US_."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Send the application's development team a merge request if the repository doesn't have those files, and open an issue if it has no version tags. Having this metadata in place lets it be under direct control of the developer, and their updates and future translations will be pulled automatically."
msgstr "Kirim merge request ke tim pengembangan aplikasi jika repository tidak memiliki file-file tersebut, dan buka issue jika tidak memiliki version tag. Dengan metadata ini tersedia, semuanya dapat berada di bawah kendali langsung pengembang, dan pembaruan serta terjemahan mendatang mereka akan ditarik secara otomatis."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the build metadata"
msgstr "Pahami build metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Let's take a look at the build metadata of the official F-Droid client as example. The file lives at <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/blob/master/metadata/org.fdroid.fdroid.yml>.  The fdroiddata repo contains the [Build Metadata](../Build_Metadata_Reference)  for all the apps of the F-Droid main repository in the `metadata` folder. The [fdroidserver](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver) is used to process these metadata and run the build. The file name of the metadata, i.e. `org.fdroid.fdroid`, corresponds to the Application ID of the app."
msgstr "Mari kita lihat build metadata dari klien F-Droid resmi sebagai contoh. File tersebut berada di <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/blob/master/metadata/org.fdroid.fdroid.yml>. Repo fdroiddata berisi [Build Metadata](../Build_Metadata_Reference) untuk semua aplikasi di repository utama F-Droid dalam folder `metadata`. [fdroidserver](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver) digunakan untuk memproses metadata ini dan menjalankan build. Nama file metadata, yaitu `org.fdroid.fdroid`, sesuai dengan Application ID aplikasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "The first part of the metadata is totally descriptive, including `AntiFeatures`, `Categories`, `AuthorName`, `AuthorEmail`, `AuthorWebSite`, `License`, `WebSite`, `SourceCode`, `IssueTracker`, `Translation`, `Changelog`, `Donate`, `Liberapay`, `OpenCollective`, `Bitcoin`, and `Litecoin`. These information is displayed in the client and website."
msgstr "Bagian pertama dari metadata sepenuhnya bersifat deskriptif, termasuk `AntiFeatures`, `Categories`, `AuthorName`, `AuthorEmail`, `AuthorWebSite`, `License`, `WebSite`, `SourceCode`, `IssueTracker`, `Translation`, `Changelog`, `Donate`, `Liberapay`, `OpenCollective`, `Bitcoin`, dan `Litecoin`. Informasi ini ditampilkan di klien dan situs web."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "The second part controls how to build the apk. It includes:"
msgstr "Bagian kedua mengatur cara membangun apk. Bagian ini mencakup:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "`RepoType` and `Repo`, the metadata of the VCS of the source code"
msgstr "`RepoType` dan `Repo`, yaitu metadata VCS dari source code"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "`Builds`, a list of build blocks each of which corresponds to an apk which has been built or will be built"
msgstr "`Builds`, daftar blok build yang masing-masing sesuai dengan sebuah apk yang telah dibangun atau akan dibangun"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "`Binaries` and `AllowedAPKSigningKeys`, the metadata of the reference binary for reproducible build"
msgstr "`Binaries` dan `AllowedAPKSigningKeys`, yaitu metadata binary referensi untuk reproducible build"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "When there is a new build block in `Builds`, _fdroidserver_ start a build according to it. For example, the following build block defines such a process:"
msgstr "Ketika ada blok build baru di `Builds`, _fdroidserver_ mulai melakukan build sesuai blok tersebut. Sebagai contoh, blok build berikut mendefinisikan proses seperti itu:"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "versionName: 1.23.2 versionCode: 1023052 commit: 0ea06b1c1d68765c4a434d0b676b3e0f23f04cb1 subdir: app gradle:"
msgstr "versionName: 1.23.2 versionCode: 1023052 commit: 0ea06b1c1d68765c4a434d0b676b3e0f23f04cb1 subdir: app gradle:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      - full\n"
"    scandelete:\n"
"      - app/src/androidTest/assets\n"
"      - app/src/test/resources\n"
"      - libs/sharedTest/src/main/assets\n"
"      - libs/index/src/commonTest/resources\n"
"    gradleprops:\n"
"      - strict.release\n"
msgstr ""
"      - full\n"
"    scandelete:\n"
"      - app/src/androidTest/assets\n"
"      - app/src/test/resources\n"
"      - libs/sharedTest/src/main/assets\n"
"      - libs/index/src/commonTest/resources\n"
"    gradleprops:\n"
"      - strict.release\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "First, the source code is cloned from the `Repo`. Then the `commit` is checkout. The work directory is set to `app`. Before build, the scanner runs on the source code and binary files in the paths defined in `scandelete` is removed. Then _fdroidserver_ runs Gradle command to build the app:"
msgstr "Pertama, source code di-clone dari `Repo`. Lalu `commit` di-checkout. Direktori kerja diatur ke `app`. Sebelum build, scanner dijalankan pada source code dan file binary di path yang didefinisikan dalam `scandelete` dihapus. Kemudian _fdroidserver_ menjalankan perintah Gradle untuk membangun aplikasi:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "  gradle assembleFullRelease -Pstrict.release\n"
msgstr "  gradle assembleFullRelease -Pstrict.release\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "The apk is found in the default path of a Gradle project and it's checked to ensure it has the correct `versionName` and `versionCode`. Finally, this apk will be signed and published along with other apks."
msgstr "apk ditemukan di path default project Gradle dan diperiksa untuk memastikan memiliki `versionName` dan `versionCode` yang benar. Terakhir, apk ini akan ditandatangani dan dipublikasikan bersama apk lainnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "The last part is about how we should update the app, including `AutoUpdateMode`, `UpdateCheckMode`, `UpdateCheckIgnore`, `VercodeOperation`, `UpdateCheckName`, `UpdateCheckData`, `CurrentVersion`, and `CurrentVersionCode`. The checkupdates runner runs everyday, checking the repo and finding new versions. If there is a new version, the metadata is updated and a merge request will be opened."
msgstr "Bagian terakhir membahas bagaimana aplikasi harus diperbarui, termasuk `AutoUpdateMode`, `UpdateCheckMode`, `UpdateCheckIgnore`, `VercodeOperation`, `UpdateCheckName`, `UpdateCheckData`, `CurrentVersion`, dan `CurrentVersionCode`. Runner checkupdates berjalan setiap hari, memeriksa repo dan mencari versi baru. Jika ada versi baru, metadata diperbarui dan merge request akan dibuka."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "More details are available about every field of the build metadata in the [Build Metadata Reference](../Build_Metadata_Reference) and [Repository Style Guide](../Repository_Style_Guide)."
msgstr "Rincian lebih lanjut tersedia untuk setiap field metadata build dalam [Build Metadata Reference](../Build_Metadata_Reference) dan [Repository Style Guide](../Repository_Style_Guide)."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write the build metadata for an Gradle app"
msgstr "Tulis build metadata untuk aplikasi Gradle"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "In the following steps, we assume that the Application ID of your app is `com.example`. Please use a unique id for you app, corresponding to your domain name. Fork `fdroiddata`, clone the repo and create a new branch from master, e.g., `com.example`. There are more details in <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md>.  It's also recommended to [have fdroidserver installed](../Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools) when you write the metadata. It can help you format and lint the metadata.  Create the metadata file at `metadata/com.example.yml`. Open it in your editor and let's start writing your metadata. You can also start from a template. Since there are thousands of build metadata files you generally can find similar build metadata which can be used as a base of your own metadata. E.g., if your app uses Flutter you can search Flutter apps `fdroiddata` repo. There are also examples in the [templates](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/tree/master/templates)  folder. You can also use `fdroid import` to generate a template with _fdroidserver_."
msgstr "Pada langkah-langkah berikut, kami mengasumsikan bahwa Application ID aplikasi Anda adalah `com.example`. Harap gunakan id unik untuk aplikasi Anda, yang sesuai dengan nama domain Anda. Fork `fdroiddata`, clone repo tersebut, dan buat branch baru dari master, misalnya `com.example`. Detail lebih lanjut ada di <https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md>. Disarankan juga untuk [memasang fdroidserver](../Installing_the_Server_and_Repo_Tools) saat Anda menulis metadata. Ini dapat membantu Anda memformat dan me-lint metadata. Buat file metadata di `metadata/com.example.yml`. Buka file tersebut di editor Anda dan mari mulai menulis metadata. Anda juga dapat memulai dari template. Karena ada ribuan file build metadata, biasanya Anda dapat menemukan build metadata serupa yang bisa dijadikan dasar metadata Anda sendiri. Misalnya, jika aplikasi Anda menggunakan Flutter, Anda dapat mencari aplikasi Flutter di repo `fdroiddata`. Ada juga contoh di folder [templates](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/tree/master/templates). Anda juga dapat menggunakan `fdroid import` untuk menghasilkan template dengan _fdroidserver_."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Now you have an empty metadata file or a simple template. Please provide as much as possible descriptive information so that the user can know the app and its author better."
msgstr "Sekarang Anda memiliki file metadata kosong atau template sederhana. Harap berikan sebanyak mungkin informasi deskriptif agar pengguna dapat mengenal aplikasi dan penulisnya dengan lebih baik."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Then add the `Repo` info and a build block in `Builds`. For Gradle apps this is simple. And popular toolchains, e.g., Flutter are also covered by our templates. If your app is built with other toolchains and you can't find example in _fdroiddata_, you can define all the build steps with `sudo`, `prebuild` and `build` manually. The `output` must be set so that _fdroidserver_ can find the apk."
msgstr "Lalu tambahkan info `Repo` dan blok build di `Builds`. Untuk aplikasi Gradle ini cukup sederhana. Toolchain populer, misalnya Flutter, juga sudah dicakup oleh template kami. Jika aplikasi Anda dibangun dengan toolchain lain dan Anda tidak dapat menemukan contoh di _fdroiddata_, Anda dapat mendefinisikan semua langkah build secara manual dengan `sudo`, `prebuild`, dan `build`. `output` harus diatur agar _fdroidserver_ dapat menemukan apk."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoupdate configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi autoupdate"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Unless you have a special reason to control the update manually, you should setup auto update. This reduces the maintenance cost for both F-Droid maintainers and you. With auto update enabled, you just need to bump the version and tag a new release. F-Droid will check your repo regularly and update the metadata when there is a new version found. For Gradle apps with the `versionName` and `versionCode` in the normal location, i.e., the `android` block or the `AndroidManifest.xml`, no special setup is needed.  But if you put the version info somewhere else, you need to extract them with `UpdateCheckData`. The version info can't be composed or calculated dynamically since F-Droid only uses regex to extract them and won't run the Gradle code."
msgstr "Kecuali Anda punya alasan khusus untuk mengontrol pembaruan secara manual, Anda sebaiknya menyiapkan auto update. Ini mengurangi biaya pemeliharaan bagi maintainer F-Droid maupun bagi Anda. Dengan auto update diaktifkan, Anda hanya perlu menaikkan versi dan memberi tag pada rilis baru. F-Droid akan memeriksa repo Anda secara berkala dan memperbarui metadata saat versi baru ditemukan. Untuk aplikasi Gradle dengan `versionName` dan `versionCode` di lokasi normal, yaitu blok `android` atau `AndroidManifest.xml`, tidak diperlukan pengaturan khusus. Namun jika Anda meletakkan info versi di tempat lain, Anda perlu mengekstraknya dengan `UpdateCheckData`. Info versi tidak boleh disusun atau dihitung secara dinamis karena F-Droid hanya menggunakan regex untuk mengekstraknya dan tidak akan menjalankan code Gradle."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup ABI split"
msgstr "Menyiapkan ABI split"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "It's not a hard requirement to setup ABI split but if the apk is large and ABI split can reduce the apk size effectively, this is highly encouraged."
msgstr "Menyiapkan ABI split bukan persyaratan keras, tetapi jika apk berukuran besar dan ABI split dapat mengurangi ukuran apk secara efektif, hal ini sangat dianjurkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Currently there is no special support for ABI split. So every apk should be added\n"
"as a build block, with different version code and build steps. You can use different\n"
"Gradle flavors or properties to build different native libs. You can also patch\n"
"the code in `prebuild` to control the ABI. These apks with different ABIs will be\n"
"built one by one. Please note that the version codes of different ABIs must be\n"
"set specially. F-Droid clients always updates the app to the apk with the highest\n"
"version code that can be installed on the device, so generally the version codes should\n"
"have such an order: armeabi-v7a < arm64-v8a < x86 < x86\\_64. Because _fdroidserver_\n"
"only keeps the apks with the highest version codes in the `repo` and others are moved\n"
"to `archive`, the version codes of a new version must be higher than the version codes\n"
"of an old version. In other words, the digits representing the ABI must be put at the lowest\n"
"position of the version codes. The `VercodeOperation` needs to be set to calculate the\n"
"version codes, e.g.\n"
msgstr "Saat ini belum ada dukungan khusus untuk ABI split. Jadi setiap apk harus ditambahkan sebagai blok build, dengan version code dan langkah build yang berbeda. Anda dapat menggunakan flavor atau properti Gradle yang berbeda untuk membangun native lib yang berbeda. Anda juga dapat mem-patch code di `prebuild` untuk mengontrol ABI. Apk-apk dengan ABI berbeda ini akan dibangun satu per satu. Harap diperhatikan bahwa version code untuk ABI yang berbeda harus diatur secara khusus. Klien F-Droid selalu memperbarui aplikasi ke apk dengan version code tertinggi yang dapat dipasang pada perangkat, jadi umumnya version code harus memiliki urutan seperti ini: armeabi-v7a < arm64-v8a < x86 < x86_64. Karena _fdroidserver_ hanya menyimpan apk dengan version code tertinggi di `repo` dan yang lain dipindahkan ke `archive`, version code versi baru harus lebih tinggi daripada version code versi lama. Dengan kata lain, digit yang merepresentasikan ABI harus ditempatkan pada posisi terendah dari version code. `VercodeOperation` perlu diatur untuk menghitung version code, misalnya:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"VercodeOperation:\n"
"  - 10 * %c + 1\n"
"  - 10 * %c + 2\n"
"  - 10 * %c + 3\n"
"  - 10 * %c + 4\n"
msgstr ""
"VercodeOperation:\n"
"  - 10 * %c + 1\n"
"  - 10 * %c + 2\n"
"  - 10 * %c + 3\n"
"  - 10 * %c + 4\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Reproducible Build"
msgstr "Setup Reproducible Build"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Reproducible builds are not a requirement for apps being on F-Droid. But we do consider their use best practice. And unfortunately, one can't easily switch to them later because Android doesn't allow updates with a different signing key, meaning users would have to reinstall. So we mainly encourage their use for new apps."
msgstr "Build yang dapat direproduksi tidak menjadi syarat mutlak agar aplikasi diterima di F-Droid, tetapi ini dianggap sebagai praktik terbaik. Sayangnya, sulit untuk beralih ke format build ini di kemudian hari karena Android tidak mengizinkan pembaruan dengan kunci tanda tangan yang berbeda — pengguna harus menginstal ulang aplikasi. Karena itu, metode ini terutama disarankan untuk aplikasi baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "The point of reproducible builds is that the developer's signature (from the APK they publish) guarantees that our build is identical to theirs (and thus doesn't contain anything it shouldn't) and at the same time our build server verifies that the developer's build matches the published source code (and thus doesn't contain anything it shouldn't either)."
msgstr "Tujuan dari build yang dapat direproduksi adalah memastikan bahwa tanda tangan pengembang (dari APK yang mereka terbitkan) menjamin bahwa build yang dihasilkan F-Droid identik dan tidak berisi hal yang tidak semestinya, sementara server build F-Droid juga memastikan bahwa hasil build pengembang cocok dengan kode sumber yang dipublikasikan. Dengan demikian, keduanya saling memverifikasi integritas satu sama lain."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "This increases trust and makes supply-chain attacks harder. It also makes it impossible for there to be a bug in the F-Droid version only (or vice versa).  Using the developer's key also means they have the option of providing updates to users themselves if we for some reason (temporarily) cannot."
msgstr "Ini meningkatkan kepercayaan dan membuat supply-chain attack lebih sulit. Ini juga membuat mustahil terjadi bug hanya di versi F-Droid (atau sebaliknya). Menggunakan key milik pengembang juga berarti mereka memiliki opsi untuk menyediakan pembaruan kepada pengguna sendiri jika kami karena suatu alasan (sementara) tidak bisa."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Some apps -- especially those without native code, using only Kotlin/Java -- are very easy to make reproducible. Others may require more work. Sadly, some apps cannot be made reproducible at all."
msgstr "Beberapa aplikasi — terutama yang tidak memiliki native code dan hanya menggunakan Kotlin/Java — sangat mudah dibuat reproducible. Yang lain mungkin memerlukan lebih banyak pekerjaan. Sayangnya, beberapa aplikasi tidak dapat dibuat reproducible sama sekali."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "We hope that developers agree with us that it's at least worth attempting to make their apps reproducible given the various benefits, but if they are unable or unwilling to spend time/resources on this, we of course respect their decision."
msgstr "Kami berharap para pengembang setuju bahwa membuat aplikasi mereka dapat direproduksi patut dicoba mengingat manfaatnya yang besar. Namun, jika mereka tidak dapat atau tidak ingin menginvestasikan waktu dan sumber daya untuk hal ini, keputusan tersebut akan tetap kami hormati."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "For more information, see:"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "[Towards a reproducible F-Droid](https://f-droid.org/2023/01/15/towards-a-reproducible-fdroid.html)"
msgstr "[Towards a reproducible F-Droid](https://f-droid.org/2023/01/15/towards-a-reproducible-fdroid.html)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "[F-Droid's Reproducible Builds documentation](../Reproducible_Builds)"
msgstr "[Dokumentasi Build F-Droid yang Dapat Direproduksi](../Reproducible_Builds)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "[Reproducible Builds project](https://reproducible-builds.org/)"
msgstr "[Proyek yang dapat direproduksi](https://reproducible-builds.org/)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "[HOWTO: diff & fix APKs for Reproducible Builds](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/wiki/-/wikis/HOWTO:-diff-&-fix-APKs-for-Reproducible-Builds)"
msgstr "[HOWTO: diff & fix APKs for Reproducible Builds](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/wiki/-/wikis/HOWTO:-diff-&-fix-APKs-for-Reproducible-Builds)"

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test the metadata"
msgstr "Uji metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The initial build metadata may not work as expect. We need to test it. If you have\n"
"_fdroidserver_ installed, run `fdroid lint <appid>` to get some hints about general\n"
"issues and `fdroid rewritemeta <appid>` to format the metadata file. Then we can\n"
"try building the apk with the metadata. If you want to go the hard way, please read\n"
"[the doc](../Build_Server_Setup) about how to run the build locally. Instead, you\n"
"can use our CI to test your metadata easily. Commit and push your changes to your\n"
"fork. The pipelines will be triggered automatically. If all the pipelines pass,\n"
"congratulations! You have a working build metadata now. If some pipelines fail,\n"
"please read the log and fix the metadata accordingly.\n"
msgstr "Metadata build awal mungkin tidak bekerja seperti yang diharapkan. Kita perlu mengujinya. Jika Anda sudah memasang _fdroidserver_, jalankan `fdroid lint <appid>` untuk mendapatkan petunjuk tentang masalah umum dan `fdroid rewritemeta <appid>` untuk memformat file metadata. Lalu kita bisa mencoba membangun apk dengan metadata tersebut. Jika Anda ingin menempuh cara yang lebih sulit, silakan baca [dokumentasi](../Build_Server_Setup) tentang cara menjalankan build secara lokal. Sebagai gantinya, Anda dapat menggunakan CI kami untuk menguji metadata Anda dengan mudah. Commit dan push perubahan Anda ke fork Anda. Pipeline akan dipicu secara otomatis. Jika semua pipeline lolos, selamat! Anda sekarang memiliki build metadata yang berfungsi. Jika beberapa pipeline gagal, silakan baca log dan perbaiki metadata sesuai kebutuhan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build environment"
msgstr "Build environment"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "On a laptop with Ubuntu 21.10 in February 2022, it took 2 GB of traffic and 5 GB of disk space to set up an F-Droid build environment."
msgstr "Pada sebuah laptop dengan Ubuntu 21.10 pada Februari 2022, diperlukan 2 GB trafik dan 5 GB ruang disk untuk menyiapkan environment build F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Network requirements:"
msgstr "Kebutuhan jaringan:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "60 MB: shallow-clone _fdroiddata_ and _fdroidserver_"
msgstr "60 MB: shallow-clone _fdroiddata_ and _fdroidserver_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "75 MB: install _docker.io_"
msgstr "75 MB: memasang _docker.io_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "1000 MB: load the container"
msgstr "1000 MB: memuat container"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "800 MB: build"
msgstr "800 MB: build"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Storage requirements:"
msgstr "Storage requirements:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "1000 MB: clone the repos and install _docker.io_"
msgstr "1000 MB: clone repo dan memasang _docker.io_"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "4000 MB: load the container and build"
msgstr "4000 MB: memuat container dan build"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Download and launch the latest version of the server tools container:"
msgstr "Unduh dan jalankan versi terbaru container server tools:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone --depth=1 https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver ~/fdroidserver\n"
"sudo sh -c 'apt-get update &&apt-get install -y docker.io'\n"
"sudo docker run --rm -itu vagrant --entrypoint /bin/bash \\\n"
"  -v ~/fdroiddata:/build:z \\\n"
"  -v ~/fdroidserver:/home/vagrant/fdroidserver:Z \\\n"
"  registry.gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver:buildserver\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone --depth=1 https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver ~/fdroidserver\n"
"sudo sh -c 'apt-get update &&apt-get install -y docker.io'\n"
"sudo docker run --rm -itu vagrant --entrypoint /bin/bash \\\n"
"  -v ~/fdroiddata:/build:z \\\n"
"  -v ~/fdroidserver:/home/vagrant/fdroidserver:Z \\\n"
"  registry.gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver:buildserver\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "In the container:"
msgstr "Dalam container:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
". /etc/profile\n"
"export PATH=\"$fdroidserver:$PATH\" PYTHONPATH=\"$fdroidserver\"\n"
"export JAVA_HOME=$(java -XshowSettings:properties -version 2>&1 > /dev/null | grep 'java.home' | awk -F'=' '{print $2}' | tr -d ' ')\n"
"cd /build\n"
"fdroid readmeta\n"
"fdroid rewritemeta com.example\n"
"fdroid checkupdates --allow-dirty com.example\n"
"fdroid lint com.example\n"
"fdroid build com.example\n"
msgstr ""
". /etc/profile\n"
"export PATH=\"$fdroidserver:$PATH\" PYTHONPATH=\"$fdroidserver\"\n"
"export JAVA_HOME=$(java -XshowSettings:properties -version 2>&1 > /dev/null | grep 'java.home' | awk -F'=' '{print $2}' | tr -d ' ')\n"
"cd /build\n"
"fdroid readmeta\n"
"fdroid rewritemeta com.example\n"
"fdroid checkupdates --allow-dirty com.example\n"
"fdroid lint com.example\n"
"fdroid build com.example\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "If any command, such as `fdroid readmeta`, returns an error, edit _~/fdroiddata/metadata/com.example.yml_ accordingly and try running the command again. After a successful build, exit the container, commit your metadata file with a `New App` label, and push it to your fork:"
msgstr "Jika ada perintah, seperti `fdroid readmeta`, yang mengembalikan error, edit _~/fdroiddata/metadata/com.example.yml_ sesuai kebutuhan lalu coba jalankan kembali perintah tersebut. Setelah build berhasil, keluar dari container, commit file metadata Anda dengan label `New App`, lalu push ke fork Anda:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exit\n"
"cd ~/fdroiddata\n"
"git add metadata/com.example.yml\n"
"git commit -m \"New App: com.example\"\n"
"git push origin com.example\n"
msgstr ""
"exit\n"
"cd ~/fdroiddata\n"
"git add metadata/com.example.yml\n"
"git commit -m \"New App: com.example\"\n"
"git push origin com.example\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Create a [merge request](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests)  at the _fdroiddata_ repository, selecting your _com.example_ source branch. Wait for the packagers to pick up your merge request. Please keep track if they asked any questions and reply to them as soon as possible."
msgstr "Buat [merge request](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests) di repository _fdroiddata_, dengan memilih source branch _com.example_ Anda. Tunggu para packager mengambil merge request Anda. Mohon pantau jika mereka mengajukan pertanyaan dan balas sesegera mungkin."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "You can [get help with F-Droid](../../about/#contact) via IRC, Matrix, XMPP, e-mail and some other channels."
msgstr "Anda dapat [mendapatkan bantuan tentang F-Droid](../../about/#contact) melalui IRC, Matrix, XMPP, surel, dan berbagai saluran komunikasi lainnya."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application Review Process"
msgstr "Proses Peninjauan Aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Once the inclusion proposal is filed, the application will enter a reviewing process where F-Droid staff look into the applications source code and determine whether it fits for inclusion (and when it's not, determine all necessary steps to make it so)."
msgstr "Setelah proposal aplikasi diajukan, aplikasi tersebut akan masuk ke tahap peninjauan, di mana tim F-Droid akan memeriksa kode sumber aplikasi untuk menentukan apakah aplikasi tersebut memenuhi syarat untuk dimasukkan. Jika tidak, tim akan memberikan masukan tentang langkah-langkah yang perlu dilakukan agar aplikasi dapat diterima."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "As F-Droid is a software repository which promises users free software, a review process is for ensuring that all applications distributed from the F-Droid main repository are Free Software."
msgstr "Karena F-Droid adalah repositori perangkat lunak bebas, proses peninjauan dilakukan untuk memastikan bahwa semua aplikasi yang didistribusikan melalui repositori utama F-Droid adalah Perangkat Lunak Bebas."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "This is a nonexhaustive list of what a reviewer would do:"
msgstr "Berikut adalah daftar (tidak lengkap) dari hal-hal yang dilakukan oleh peninjau:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will go to your source code repository, and look for copyright notices in license files, including _README_, to check that the proposed application is released under a [recognized Free Software and/or OSI license(s)](https://spdx.org/licenses/)."
msgstr "Meninjau repositori kode sumber Anda dan memeriksa catatan hak cipta dalam berkas lisensi atau _README_ untuk memastikan bahwa aplikasi diterbitkan di bawah [lisensi perangkat lunak bebas yang diakui atau lisensi OSI](https://spdx.org/licenses/)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will look at your build script to see which build system you use, and whether F-Droid build server can handle it (Ant and Gradle are the most common and easiest ones)."
msgstr "Meninjau skrip build Anda untuk mengetahui sistem build yang digunakan dan memverifikasi apakah server build F-Droid dapat menanganinya (sistem Ant dan Gradle adalah yang paling umum dan paling mudah didukung)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try to download a copy of your source code."
msgstr "Mereka akan mencoba mengunduh salinan source code Anda."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will look in all source code files to verify that their licenses are consistent with corresponding license/README files."
msgstr "Mereka akan memeriksa semua file source code untuk memverifikasi bahwa lisensinya konsisten dengan file license/README yang terkait."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will check if your application uses any pre-compiled libraries or binary blobs."
msgstr "Mereka akan memeriksa apakah aplikasi Anda menggunakan library pre-compiled atau binary blobs."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will look at your non-source code files to identify [Non-Free resources](https://monitor.f-droid.org/anti-feature/NonFreeAssets) used in your application."
msgstr "Meninjau berkas non-kode sumber untuk mengidentifikasi [sumber daya Non-Bebas (Non-Free Assets)](https://monitor.f-droid.org/anti-feature/NonFreeAssets) yang digunakan di aplikasi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will skim through the source code to see if your application uses Non-Free dependencies, shows advertisements, tracks users, promotes or depends on Non-Free or non-changeable services/applications, or does anything that is harmful or otherwise undesirable for users."
msgstr "Menelusuri kode sumber untuk memeriksa apakah aplikasi menggunakan dependensi Non-Bebas, menampilkan iklan, melacak pengguna, mempromosikan atau bergantung pada layanan Non-Bebas, atau melakukan hal-hal lain yang berpotensi merugikan pengguna."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will list a summary of any [_AntiFeatures_](https://monitor.f-droid.org/anti-features) in your application."
msgstr "Menyusun ringkasan [_AntiFeatures_](https://monitor.f-droid.org/anti-features) yang ditemukan dalam aplikasi Anda."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try patching your application to remove usage of third-party proprietary software (if there is any)."
msgstr "Mereka akan mencoba mem-patch aplikasi Anda untuk menghapus penggunaan perangkat lunak proprietary pihak ketiga, jika ada."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try to determine a suitable update process for your application (e.g. by looking at how your releases relate to VCS tags and/or version information in _AndroidManifest.xml_, build.gradle.kts, pubspec.yaml or elsewhere)."
msgstr "Mereka akan mencoba menentukan proses pembaruan yang sesuai untuk aplikasi Anda (misalnya dengan melihat bagaimana rilis Anda berkaitan dengan tag VCS dan/atau informasi versi di _AndroidManifest.xml_, build.gradle.kts, pubspec.yaml, atau tempat lain)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try writing a suitable metadata file for your application, and add it to local F-Droid build server instance.  (`fdroid rewritemeta`, `fdroid lint` are used to ensure that metadata is well-formed)"
msgstr "Mereka akan mencoba menulis file metadata yang sesuai untuk aplikasi Anda, dan menambahkannya ke local F-Droid build server instance. (`fdroid rewritemeta`, `fdroid lint` digunakan untuk memastikan metadata diformat dengan benar)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "They will try to build your application in an isolated environment to see if the process succeeds and yield a functional APK."
msgstr "Mencoba membangun aplikasi Anda dalam lingkungan terisolasi untuk memastikan proses build berhasil dan menghasilkan file APK yang berfungsi."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Usually the Gitlab CI will be used, but for apps that need more resources _(storage, memory, time)_ than what the runners can offer, they might use local machines to prepare and test the metadata."
msgstr "Biasanya GitLab CI akan digunakan, tetapi untuk aplikasi yang memerlukan lebih banyak resource _(storage, memory, time)_ daripada yang dapat disediakan runner, mereka mungkin menggunakan mesin lokal untuk menyiapkan dan menguji metadata."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "If all went smoothly, they will add a new metadata file to their local _fdroiddata_ git repository and synchronizes the change to GitLab."
msgstr "Jika semuanya berjalan lancar, mereka akan menambahkan file metadata baru ke repository git _fdroiddata_ lokal mereka dan menyinkronkan perubahan itu ke GitLab."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "In the case that the application failed some steps in the review, feedback will be given in the original submission queue thread where the proposal was posted."
msgstr "Jika aplikasi gagal pada beberapa langkah peninjauan, umpan balik akan diberikan di thread antrean pengajuan asli tempat usulan diposting."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Once the _fdroiddata_ repository is updated on GitLab, it's mostly just a matter of time before F-Droid's official build server will fetch, build, and publish your application on the main F-Droid repository."
msgstr "Setelah repository _fdroiddata_ diperbarui di GitLab, pada dasarnya tinggal menunggu waktu sebelum build server resmi F-Droid mengambil, membangun, dan menerbitkan aplikasi Anda di repository utama F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "You can confirm the inclusion of your application by looking at the [GitLab _fdroiddata_ revision history](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/commits/master)."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengonfirmasi inclusion aplikasi Anda dengan melihat [riwayat revisi GitLab _fdroiddata_](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/commits/master)."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build Process"
msgstr "Proses Build"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "After the application metadata is added to _fdroiddata_ GitLab repository, the next step is for the main F-Droid build server to fetch the applications source code and related components, build the application, and publish it on the main F-Droid repository."
msgstr "Setelah metadata aplikasi ditambahkan ke repository GitLab _fdroiddata_, langkah berikutnya adalah build server utama F-Droid mengambil source code aplikasi dan komponen terkait, membangun aplikasi, lalu menerbitkannya di repository utama F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "This build process is not running on a schedule, a cycle is started after the previous one has been published, applications are processed in batch _(you can infer the average frequency by looking at [past cycles](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/f-droid.org-transparency-log/-/commits/master))_.  As steps are done behind the scene and are mostly automatic; all the submitter needs to do is to wait for it to finish."
msgstr "Proses build ini tidak berjalan menurut jadwal; sebuah siklus dimulai setelah siklus sebelumnya dipublikasikan, dan aplikasi diproses secara batch _(Anda dapat menyimpulkan frekuensi rata-ratanya dengan melihat [siklus sebelumnya](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/f-droid.org-transparency-log/-/commits/master))_. Karena langkah-langkah dilakukan di belakang layar dan sebagian besar otomatis, yang perlu dilakukan pengirim hanyalah menunggu hingga selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "A record of a successful build process for one application is provided on the F-Droid's website page for that specific app (e.g. [see the Build Log for the F-Droid Client](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.fdroid.fdroid/#latest))."
msgstr "Catatan keberhasilan build untuk suatu aplikasi dapat dilihat di halaman website F-Droid untuk aplikasi tersebut (misalnya, [lihat Build Log untuk Klien F-Droid](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.fdroid.fdroid/#latest))."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Apps that fail will have the log available during the build cycle on the [F-Droid Monitor - Running](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds/running) page or, if in the previous cycle, on the [Build](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds/build) page.  This is useful to aid in diagnosing problems when the build unexpectedly failed."
msgstr "Aplikasi yang gagal dibangun akan memiliki log yang tersedia selama siklus build di halaman [F-Droid Monitor - Running](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds/running), atau jika pada siklus sebelumnya, di halaman [Build](https://monitor.f-droid.org/builds/build). Log ini sangat membantu untuk menganalisis penyebab kegagalan build yang tidak terduga."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What to Expect"
msgstr "Apa yang Dapat Diharapkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "When your application metadata is approved and accepted into the _fdroiddata_ git repository on GitLab, **it won't immediately appear** in the main F-Droid repository."
msgstr "Ketika metadata aplikasi Anda disetujui dan diterima ke repository git _fdroiddata_ di GitLab, **itu tidak akan langsung muncul** di repository utama F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "Provided that your application does not have any build problems, it would takes somewhere **around 24 to 48 hours** from _fdroiddata_ merge until the application to appears in the main repository.[1](https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/how-fast-the-main-f-droid-repository-updates/)  This timing limitation is due to the APK signing part of the build process, which requires human intervention on keystore access step.[2](https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/encouraging-f-droid-participation-by-developers/#post-17868)"
msgstr "Dengan asumsi aplikasi Anda tidak memiliki masalah build apa pun, biasanya dibutuhkan sekitar **24 hingga 48 jam** dari merge _fdroiddata_ hingga aplikasi muncul di repository utama. [f-droid](https://f-droid.org/en/docs/Security_Model/)(https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/how-fast-the-main-f-droid-repository-updates/) Batas waktu ini disebabkan oleh bagian signing APK dalam proses build, yang memerlukan intervensi manusia pada langkah akses keystore. [f-droid](https://f-droid.org/en/docs/Reproducible_Builds/)(https://f-droid.org/forums/topic/encouraging-f-droid-participation-by-developers/#post-17868)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "After publishing, the apps are immediately available in the repository and any client can now update or install. The f-droid.org website takes time to generate pages for updated apps and new apps, for all the languages, so there's a slight delay until it gets updated."
msgstr "Setelah dipublikasikan, aplikasi langsung tersedia di repository dan klien mana pun kini dapat memperbarui atau memasangnya. Situs web f-droid.org memerlukan waktu untuk menghasilkan halaman bagi aplikasi yang diperbarui dan aplikasi baru, untuk semua bahasa, jadi ada sedikit jeda sampai situs tersebut ikut diperbarui."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Links"
msgstr "Tautan Eksternal"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "[F-Droid application submission queue on GitLab](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues) (for new submissions)"
msgstr "[Daftar antrean pengajuan aplikasi F-Droid di GitLab](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues) (untuk pengajuan baru)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "[F-Droid application submission queue on forum](https://f-droid.org/forums/forum/submission-queue/) (for following-up old submissions)"
msgstr "[Antrean pengajuan aplikasi F-Droid di forum](https://f-droid.org/forums/forum/submission-queue/) (untuk menindaklanjuti pengajuan lama)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "[_fdroiddata_ GitLab repository](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/)"
msgstr "[_fdroiddata_ GitLab repository](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Submitting_to_F-Droid_Quick_Start_Guide.md
msgid "[_fdroiddata_ revision history](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/commits/master)"
msgstr "[Riwayat revisi _fdroiddata_](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/commits/master)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take-Down Requests"
msgstr "Take-Down Requests"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"  this is very loosely inspired by:\n"
"    * https://docs.github.com/en/github/site-policy/submitting-content-removal-requests\n"
"-->\n"
msgstr ""
"<!--\n"
"  this is very loosely inspired by:\n"
"    * https://docs.github.com/en/github/site-policy/submitting-content-removal-requests\n"
"-->\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "This document covers how you may send a request to remove content or apps from the official f-droid.org repository.  Our team checks all app submissions we receive for compliance with our [inclusion policy](../Inclusion_Policy) to the best of their abilities.  Please let us know if an app in the official f-droid.org repository infringes on your rights by submitting a take-down request."
msgstr "Dokumen ini menjelaskan bagaimana Anda dapat mengirim permintaan untuk menghapus konten atau aplikasi dari repository resmi f-droid.org. Tim kami memeriksa semua pengajuan aplikasi yang kami terima untuk memastikan kepatuhan terhadap [inclusion policy](../Inclusion_Policy) sejauh kemampuan terbaik kami. Mohon beri tahu kami jika sebuah aplikasi di repository resmi f-droid.org melanggar hak Anda dengan mengirimkan permintaan takedown."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "The official f-droid.org repository is a distribution service/platform for FOSS apps and will be called downstream in the remainder of this document.  F-Droid does not hold any rights to the apps in the official f-droid.org repository other than those granted by their respective license.  The authors/copyright holders of said apps will be called upstream in the remainder of this document."
msgstr "Repository resmi f-droid.org adalah layanan/platform distribusi untuk aplikasi FOSS dan selanjutnya akan disebut downstream dalam dokumen ini. F-Droid tidak memiliki hak atas aplikasi apa pun di repository resmi f-droid.org selain yang diberikan oleh lisensi masing-masing. Para penulis/pemegang hak cipta dari aplikasi tersebut selanjutnya akan disebut upstream dalam dokumen ini."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submitting Take-Down Requests"
msgstr "Mengajukan Permintaan Take-Down"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Please take some time to familiarize yourself with our policies and take-down procedure before submitting any take-down requests.  You have to make sure that requests you're submitting to us, contain all information required by our team to check the legitimacy of your claims.  If you submit an incomplete request, we will have to ask you for clarifications."
msgstr "Harap luangkan waktu untuk membiasakan diri dengan kebijakan dan prosedur take-down kami sebelum mengirimkan permintaan take-down apa pun. Anda harus memastikan bahwa permintaan yang Anda kirim kepada kami memuat semua informasi yang diperlukan oleh tim kami untuk memeriksa legitimasi klaim Anda. Jika Anda mengirim permintaan yang tidak lengkap, kami harus meminta klarifikasi dari Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Copyright based take-down requests must at least include:\n"
"- link to the infringing content on f-droid.org\n"
"- full copyright attribution (author/artists/copyright holder, copyright date, ...)\n"
"- publishing information (publisher, publishing medium, publishing date, web\n"
"  links to postings/store-listings/e-commerce-listings/etc., ...)\n"
"- license information\n"
"- written description of the copyrighted material\n"
"- short statement about the author/artist/copyright holder/etc. which\n"
"  explains their field of expertise/field of interest/business/etc.\n"
"or a concise explanation why this information is not available.\n"
msgstr ""
"Permintaan penghapusan berbasis hak cipta harus memuat setidaknya hal-hal berikut:  \n"
"- Tautan ke konten yang dianggap melanggar di situs f-droid.org.  \n"
"- Informasi lengkap tentang hak cipta (penulis/artis/pemegang hak cipta, tahun penerbitan, dll.).  \n"
"- Informasi publikasi (penerbit, media publikasi, tanggal terbit, serta tautan ke postingan, toko daring, atau daftar e-commerce terkait).  \n"
"- Informasi lisensi.  \n"
"- Deskripsi tertulis tentang materi berhak cipta yang dimaksud.  \n"
"- Pernyataan singkat tentang penulis, artis, atau pemegang hak cipta yang menjelaskan bidang keahliannya, minat, atau jenis usahanya.  \n"
"\n"
"Jika beberapa informasi tersebut tidak tersedia, sertakan penjelasan singkat alasannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "If your take-down request is not based on copyright, you will still need to supply ample information that allows us to check your request. (e.g. trademark registration information, inclusion policy violation information, etc.)"
msgstr "Jika permintaan take-down Anda tidak berdasarkan hak cipta, Anda tetap perlu memberikan informasi yang memadai agar kami dapat memeriksa permintaan tersebut, misalnya informasi pendaftaran merek dagang, informasi pelanggaran inclusion policy, dan sebagainya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Note that some apps distributed by downstream may connect to 3rd party services or rely on 3rd party software.  Downstream does not connect to these services or rely on this software, so their Terms of Service, Terms of Use or similar agreements usually do not provide an enforceable basis for take-down requests."
msgstr "Perhatikan bahwa beberapa aplikasi yang didistribusikan oleh downstream dapat terhubung ke layanan pihak ketiga atau bergantung pada perangkat lunak pihak ketiga. Downstream tidak terhubung ke layanan tersebut dan tidak bergantung pada perangkat lunak tersebut, jadi Terms of Service, Terms of Use, atau perjanjian serupa mereka biasanya tidak memberikan dasar yang dapat ditegakkan untuk permintaan take-down."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Also please note that f-droid.org is a volunteer-driven organization.  We prioritize take-down requests, but we can't guarantee instant responses."
msgstr "Harap juga diperhatikan bahwa f-droid.org adalah organisasi yang digerakkan oleh relawan. Kami memprioritaskan permintaan takedown, tetapi kami tidak dapat menjamin respons instan."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "We accept take-down requests on our team E-Mail account.  [team@f-droid.org](mailto:team@f-droid.org). Our team will open a public issue in our issue tracker and quote your request there."
msgstr "Kami menerima permintaan takedown melalui akun email tim kami: [team@f-droid.org](mailto:team@f-droid.org). Tim kami akan membuka issue publik di issue tracker kami dan mengutip permintaan Anda di sana."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Take-down requests cannot be confidential.  By submitting a take-down request you automatically grant us permission to publish your request on our web-sites and our issue trackers.  Privacy-relevant information will be redacted."
msgstr "Permintaan takedown tidak dapat bersifat rahasia. Dengan mengirimkan permintaan takedown, Anda secara otomatis memberi kami izin untuk memublikasikan permintaan Anda di situs web kami dan issue tracker kami. Informasi yang berkaitan dengan privasi akan disunting."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transparency reporting"
msgstr "Pelaporan transparansi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "All take-down requests we receive regarding apps on the official f-droid.org repository are transparently disclosed in our [issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/?sort=created_date&state=all&label_name%5B%5D=Takedown%20Request)  and [merge-request tracker](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/merge_requests?scope=all&state=all&label_name[]=Takedown%20Request)  under the `Takedown Request` label."
msgstr "Semua permintaan take-down yang kami terima terkait aplikasi di repository resmi f-droid.org diungkapkan secara transparan di [issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/?sort=created_date&state=all&label_name%5B%5D=Takedown%20Request) dan [merge-request tracker](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/merge_requests?scope=all&state=all&label_name[]=Takedown%20Request) dengan label `Takedown Request`."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "3rd party repositories"
msgstr "repository pihak ketiga"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Take-Down_Requests.md
msgid "Third party repositories are not under our control what so ever. If you think a 3rd party repository is violating your rights you will have to get in contact with their respective operators. Procedures described here apply exclusively to f-droid.org."
msgstr "Repository pihak ketiga sama sekali tidak berada di bawah kendali kami. Jika Anda merasa repository pihak ketiga melanggar hak Anda, Anda harus menghubungi operator masing-masing. Prosedur yang dijelaskan di sini berlaku khusus untuk f-droid.org."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translation and Localization"
msgstr "Penerjemahan dan Lokalisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "Every piece of F-Droid can be localized, including the Android app, the entire website, and the tools.  That means that all of the texts can be translated into any language supported by Android.  F-Droid will also use localized formats for numbers, currency, dates, etc. which happens automatically based on the language and country specified in the device's settings.  All of the F-Droid resources are available for translation on [Weblate \"components\"](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)  that are each managed separately, based on technical requirements."
msgstr "Setiap bagian dari F-Droid dapat dilokalkan, termasuk aplikasi Android, seluruh situs web, dan alat-alatnya. Artinya, semua teks dapat diterjemahkan ke bahasa apa pun yang didukung oleh Android. F-Droid juga akan menggunakan format lokal untuk angka, mata uang, tanggal, dan sebagainya, yang terjadi secara otomatis berdasarkan bahasa dan negara yang ditentukan dalam pengaturan perangkat. Semua resource F-Droid tersedia untuk diterjemahkan di [Weblate \"components\"](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/) yang masing-masing dikelola secara terpisah, berdasarkan kebutuhan teknis."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "If an app's source code repo includes app descriptions, then those will be automatically included as long as they use the [supported layouts](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots).  If there are any issues with missing translations or broken localized formats, please [file an issue](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/-/issues)  so it can be fixed."
msgstr "Jika repo source code sebuah aplikasi menyertakan deskripsi aplikasi, deskripsi tersebut akan otomatis disertakan selama menggunakan [layout yang didukung](../All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots). Jika ada masalah dengan terjemahan yang hilang atau format lokal yang rusak, silakan [buat issue](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/-/issues) agar dapat diperbaiki."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Berkontribusi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "Is F-Droid not in your language, or the translation is incorrect or incomplete? Get involved in the translations on [our Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)."
msgstr ""
"Apakah F-Droid belum tersedia dalam bahasa Anda, atau terjemahannya masih kurang tepat atau belum lengkap?  \n"
"Anda dapat berpartisipasi dalam proses penerjemahan melalui [platform Weblate kami](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "All translation work is done in Weblate to keep the workflow easy.  We recommend that translators use a [GitLab](https://gitlab.com) account for logging into Weblate since that same account can be used on all of the F-Droid projects on GitLab. you can find other translators on the [forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/c/translation)."
msgstr "Semua pekerjaan penerjemahan dilakukan di Weblate agar alurnya tetap mudah. Kami menyarankan penerjemah menggunakan akun [GitLab](https://gitlab.com) untuk login ke Weblate karena akun yang sama dapat digunakan di semua proyek F-Droid di GitLab. Anda dapat menemukan penerjemah lain di [forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/c/translation)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "_Donate_<a name=\"Donate\"></a>"
msgid "<a name=\"contact\"/>\n"
msgstr "<a name=\"contact\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "Translators also coordinate via the dedicated chat room, which is available on Matrix at [#fdroid-translators:f-droid.org](https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid-translators:f-droid.org), by clicking [this link](https://t.me/fdroid_translators) for Telegram, IRC at [#fdroid-translators](https://webchat.oftc.net/?randomnick=1&channels=fdroid-translators&prompt=1) on OFTC, or these bridges `#fdroid-translators%irc.oftc.net@irc.jabberfr.org` / `#fdroid-translators%irc.oftc.net@irc.hmm.st` for XMPP."
msgstr "Para penerjemah juga berkoordinasi melalui ruang chat khusus, yang tersedia di Matrix di [#fdroid-translators:f-droid.org](https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid-translators:f-droid.org), dengan mengeklik [tautan ini](https://t.me/fdroid_translators) untuk Telegram, IRC di [#fdroid-translators](https://webchat.oftc.net/?randomnick=1&channels=fdroid-translators&prompt=1) pada OFTC, atau bridge XMPP berikut `#fdroid-translators%irc.oftc.net@irc.jabberfr.org` / `#fdroid-translators%irc.oftc.net@irc.hmm.st`."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding a new language"
msgstr "Menambahkan bahasa baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "First and foremost, Android must [already support](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/master/core/res/res/values/locale_config.xml)  the specific language and locale you want to add.  We cannot work with languages that Android and the SDK do not support, the tools simply break down.  Next, if you are considering adding a country-specific variant of a language (e.g. _de-AT_), first make sure that the main language is well maintained (e.g. _de_). Your contribution might be useful to more people if you contribute to the existing version of your language rather than the country-specific variant."
msgstr ""
"Pertama-tama, Android harus [sudah mendukung](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/master/core/res/res/values/locale_config.xml) bahasa dan lokal tertentu yang ingin Anda tambahkan.  \n"
"Kami tidak dapat bekerja dengan bahasa yang tidak didukung oleh Android dan SDK karena alatnya tidak akan berfungsi.  \n"
"\n"
"Selanjutnya, jika Anda berencana menambahkan varian bahasa yang spesifik untuk negara (misalnya _de-AT_), pastikan terlebih dahulu bahwa bahasa utamanya (_de_) sudah terpelihara dengan baik.  \n"
"Kontribusi Anda mungkin akan lebih bermanfaat bagi lebih banyak orang jika diarahkan untuk memperbaiki versi utama bahasa tersebut, bukan variannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "For [_fdroidclient_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/f-droid/), [_fdroidserver_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroidserver/)  and [_Repomaker_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/repomaker), anyone can create a new language via Weblate.  For the rest of the translation \"components\" on Weblate, please [file an admin issue](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin/issues) to request a new language."
msgstr "Untuk [_fdroidclient_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/f-droid/), [_fdroidserver_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroidserver/), dan [_Repomaker_](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/repomaker), siapa pun dapat membuat bahasa baru melalui Weblate. Untuk \"komponen\" terjemahan lainnya di Weblate, silakan [buat admin issue](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/admin/issues) untuk meminta bahasa baru."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When translations are included"
msgstr "Saat terjemahan disertakan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "The translation files are included from Weblate before each release.  There are varying conditions for when the translations are included, based on the limitations of each platform."
msgstr ""
"Berkas terjemahan diambil dari Weblate sebelum setiap rilis.  \n"
"Kondisi pencantuman terjemahan berbeda-beda tergantung pada batasan masing-masing platform."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Android app"
msgstr "Aplikasi Android"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "As a general rule, a translation must be at least 70% complete for it to be included in a final release.  For alpha releases, we try to include all translations, no matter how incomplete."
msgstr "Sebagai aturan umum, sebuah terjemahan harus setidaknya selesai 70% agar dapat disertakan dalam rilis final. Untuk rilis alpha, kami berusaha menyertakan semua terjemahan, tidak peduli seberapa tidak lengkapnya."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App summaries"
msgstr "Ringkasan aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "_f-droid.org_ makes the one line summaries for many apps [available for translation](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroiddata/).  The goal is to make it possible to have sections where only a single language is show, like the Latest Tab or the website sidebar.  These are imported on a rolling basis, at least once a month."
msgstr "_f-droid.org_ menyediakan one line summary untuk banyak aplikasi [agar dapat diterjemahkan](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroiddata/). Tujuannya adalah untuk memungkinkan adanya bagian yang hanya menampilkan satu bahasa, seperti tab Latest atau sidebar website. Terjemahan ini diimpor secara bertahap, setidaknya sebulan sekali."

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "f-droid.org website"
msgstr "Situs web f-droid.org"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "For the f-droid.org website, it is a much more complicated system.  Each time the website is updated, thousands of pages must be regenerated per-locale.  Since this setup [cannot](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/milestones/6)  support lots of languages, we have to put stricter requirements on it.  The core strings must be fully translated to be included.  They also must be maintained in order to stay included.  The documentation and tutorials are very useful to have translated.  The blog posts are the least important.  Each page must be fully translated before the translated version will be shown, otherwise, the site will show the original English."
msgstr "Untuk website f-droid.org, sistemnya jauh lebih kompleks. Setiap kali website diperbarui, ribuan halaman harus digenerasi ulang per locale. Karena setup ini [tidak dapat](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/milestones/6) mendukung banyak bahasa, kami harus menetapkan persyaratan yang lebih ketat. Core strings harus sepenuhnya diterjemahkan agar dapat disertakan. Core strings juga harus dipelihara agar tetap disertakan. Dokumentasi dan tutorial sangat berguna untuk diterjemahkan. Blog post adalah yang paling tidak penting. Setiap halaman harus diterjemahkan sepenuhnya sebelum versi terjemahannya akan ditampilkan; jika tidak, situs akan menampilkan bahasa Inggris asli."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "In order for a new language to be added to f-droid.org, it must have:"
msgstr "Agar bahasa baru dapat ditambahkan ke f-droid.org, harus memiliki:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "[Website](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/website) component: 100% translated"
msgstr "Komponen [Website](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/website) : 100% diterjemahkan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "[Website Pages](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/website-pages/) component: 100% translated"
msgstr "Komponen [Website Pages](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/website-pages/) : 100% diterjemahkan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "[Data](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroiddata) component: at least 10% translated"
msgstr "Komponen [Data](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/fdroiddata) : sekurang-kurangnya 10% diterjemahkan"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "A blog post announcing support for the new language with an explanation the translation team."
msgstr "Sebuah posting blog yang mengumumkan dukungan untuk bahasa baru dengan penjelasan dari tim penerjemah."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "There is a [nightly build of the website](https://staging.f-droid.org)  that includes all translations on Weblate, no matter how complete they are. This lets everyone see the progress, and means we can get new languages working well before launching them."
msgstr "Ada [nightly build situs web](https://staging.f-droid.org) yang menyertakan semua terjemahan di Weblate, tidak peduli seberapa lengkapnya. Ini memungkinkan semua orang melihat progresnya, dan berarti kami dapat membuat bahasa baru berfungsi dengan baik sebelum meluncurkannya."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The old \"Languages\" preference"
msgstr "Preferensi \"Languages\" yang lama"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Translation_and_Localization.md
msgid "There are cases where having English as the fallback language is not helpful.  For example, much of the world would prefer to fall back to Chinese, Spanish, or Russian instead of English.  On Android 6.0 and older, F-Droid provides a \"Languages\" setting inside the app so that users can switch F-Droid to a different language.  Note that this might not handle localized format properly, just the language. Android 7.0 fixed this by allowing users to specify a list of language+country \"locales\", ordered by importance to the user."
msgstr "Ada kasus ketika bahasa Inggris sebagai bahasa fallback tidak membantu. Misalnya, sebagian besar dunia mungkin lebih memilih fallback ke bahasa Mandarin, Spanyol, atau Rusia daripada bahasa Inggris. Pada Android 6.0 dan yang lebih lama, F-Droid menyediakan pengaturan \"Languages\" di dalam aplikasi agar pengguna dapat mengganti bahasa F-Droid ke bahasa lain. Perlu dicatat bahwa ini mungkin tidak menangani format lokal dengan benar, hanya bahasanya. Android 7.0 memperbaiki hal ini dengan memungkinkan pengguna menentukan daftar \"locale\" bahasa+negara, yang diurutkan berdasarkan prioritas bagi pengguna."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update Processing"
msgstr "Proses Pembaruan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "The F-Droid tools can automatically detect and build updates to apps and packages."
msgstr "Perangkat F-Droid dapat secara otomatis mendeteksi dan membangun pembaruan untuk aplikasi maupun paket."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Detecting<a name=\"Detecting\"></a>"
msgstr "Mendeteksi<a name=\"Detecting\"></a>"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "There are various mechanisms in place for automatically detecting that updates are available for applications, with the _UpdateCheckMode_ field in the metadata determining which method is used for a particular application."
msgstr "Berbagai mekanisme tersedia untuk mendeteksi pembaruan aplikasi secara otomatis, dengan kolom _UpdateCheckMode_ dalam metadata menentukan metode yang digunakan untuk masing-masing aplikasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "Running the `fdroid checkupdates` command will apply this method to each application in the repository and update the _CurrentVersion_ and _CurrentVersionCode_ fields in the metadata accordingly."
msgstr "Menjalankan perintah `fdroid checkupdates` akan menerapkan metode tersebut ke setiap aplikasi dalam repositori dan memperbarui kolom _CurrentVersion_ serta _CurrentVersionCode_ pada metadata sesuai hasilnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "As usual, the `-p` option can be used with this, to restrict processing to a particular application."
msgstr "Seperti biasa, opsi `-p` dapat digunakan bersama ini, untuk membatasi pemrosesan pada aplikasi tertentu."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "Note that this only updates the metadata such that we know what the current published/recommended version is. It doesn't make that version available in the repository - for that, see the next section."
msgstr "Perhatikan bahwa ini hanya memperbarui metadata sehingga kami mengetahui versi yang saat ini dipublikasikan atau direkomendasikan. Ini tidak membuat versi tersebut tersedia di repository — untuk itu, lihat bagian berikutnya."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding<a name=\"Adding\"></a>"
msgstr "Menambahkan<a name=\"Adding\"></a>"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "Adding updates (i.e. new versions of applications already included in the repository) happens in two ways. The simple case is applications where the APK files are binaries, retrieved from a developer's published build. In this case, all that's required is to place the new binary in the _Repo_ directory, and the next run of `fdroid update` will pick it up."
msgstr "Menambahkan pembaruan (yaitu versi baru dari aplikasi yang sudah termasuk dalam repository) terjadi dengan dua cara. Kasus yang sederhana adalah aplikasi yang file APK-nya berupa binary, diambil dari build yang dipublikasikan pengembang. Dalam kasus ini, yang diperlukan hanya menempatkan binary baru di direktori _Repo_, dan eksekusi `fdroid update` berikutnya akan mengambilnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "For applications built from source, it is necessary to add a new `Build Version` line to the metadata file. At the very least, the version name, version code and commit will be different. It is also possible that the additional build flags will change between versions."
msgstr "Untuk aplikasi yang dibangun dari source, perlu menambahkan baris `Build Version` baru ke file metadata. Setidaknya, version name, version code, dan commit akan berbeda. Bisa juga flag build tambahan akan berubah antarversi."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Update_Processing.md
msgid "For processing multiple updates in the metadata at once, it can be useful to run `fdroid update --interactive`. This will check all the applications in the repository, and where updates are required you will be prompted to \\[E\\]dit the metadata, \\[I\\]gnore the update, or \\[Q\\]uit altogether."
msgstr "Untuk memproses beberapa pembaruan sekaligus di metadata, dapat berguna menjalankan `fdroid update --interactive`. Ini akan memeriksa semua aplikasi di repository, dan ketika pembaruan diperlukan Anda akan diminta untuk [E]dit metadata, [I]gnore pembaruan, atau [Q]uit seluruhnya."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verification Server"
msgstr "Verification Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The idea of a [verification server](https://verification.f-droid.org)  is to automatically reproduce official releases published by f-droid.org (or any other server).  Another name for this is a [rebuilder](https://reproducible-builds.org/tools/#rebuilder-backends).  This process ensures that everything in the release APK came from the source code, and nothing was inserted or included during the build process.  This is also useful for verifying that the build process is not including proprietary libraries."
msgstr "Gagasan [verification server](https://verification.f-droid.org) adalah mereproduksi secara otomatis rilis resmi yang dipublikasikan oleh f-droid.org (atau server lain mana pun). Nama lain untuk ini adalah [rebuilder](https://reproducible-builds.org/tools/#rebuilder-backends). Proses ini memastikan bahwa semua yang ada di APK rilis berasal dari source code, dan tidak ada yang disisipkan atau ikut dimasukkan selama proses build. Ini juga berguna untuk memverifikasi bahwa proses build tidak menyertakan library proprietari."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The ultimate goal is a simple installation that any third party can make, that will continuously check for new published packages, make its own builds, and confirm that the binaries match exactly. There are many issues to resolve to get to this final destination, but the basic concept is already tested and working. (see the 'fdroid verify' command)."
msgstr "Tujuan akhirnya adalah instalasi sederhana yang dapat dilakukan oleh pihak ketiga mana pun, yang akan terus memeriksa paket yang baru dipublikasikan, membuat build sendiri, dan memastikan bahwa binary cocok secara persis. Masih ada banyak isu yang harus diselesaikan untuk mencapai tujuan akhir ini, tetapi konsep dasarnya sudah diuji dan berfungsi. (lihat perintah 'fdroid verify')."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The output of multiple verification servers would then be available to the F-Droid client. The idea would be to configure the client such that it does not trust a binary until multiple verification servers are in agreement that it correct."
msgstr "Output dari beberapa verification server kemudian akan tersedia bagi klien F-Droid. Idenya adalah mengonfigurasi klien sehingga klien tidak mempercayai binary sampai beberapa verification server sepakat bahwa binary tersebut benar."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verification based on APK signature"
msgstr "Verifikasi berdasarkan signature APK"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The verification process [currently works](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/buildbot/-/blob/988fc009/master/master.cfg#L155)  by building a new unsigned APK, then [copying](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/2.4.0/fdroidserver/common.py#L3773)  the APK signature from the existing APK into the newly built unsigned APK.  If the APK signature verifies, then the APK has been reproduced, and is marked as verified.  If not, a [diffoscope](https://diffoscope.org) log is generated to show what the differences are between the two builds. The verification server needs no signing capability, just building."
msgstr "Proses verifikasi [saat ini bekerja](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/buildbot/-/blob/988fc009/master/master.cfg#L155) dengan membangun APK baru tanpa signature, lalu [menyalin](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/-/blob/2.4.0/fdroidserver/common.py#L3773) signature APK dari APK yang sudah ada ke APK unsigned yang baru dibangun. Jika signature APK terverifikasi, maka APK tersebut telah direproduksi, dan ditandai sebagai verified. Jika tidak, log [diffoscope](https://diffoscope.org) dihasilkan untuk menunjukkan perbedaan antara dua build tersebut. Verification server tidak memerlukan kemampuan penandatanganan, hanya kemampuan build."

#. type: Title ##
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting one up"
msgstr "Menyiapkannya"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verification_Server.md
msgid "The verification server is managed via an [Ansible Playbook](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-verification-server) which is installed on a server running Debian/stable that is configured to run containers with rootless Podman. This is what runs <https://verification.f-droid.org>, but it is still pretty raw, so expect some tinkering.  We welcome contributions.  It is a goal that this setup become generic enough that the maintainer of any F-Droid compatible repository can use this setup as a rebuilder."
msgstr "Verification server dikelola melalui [Ansible Playbook](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-verification-server) yang dipasang pada server yang menjalankan Debian/stable dan dikonfigurasi untuk menjalankan container dengan rootless Podman. Inilah yang menjalankan <https://verification.f-droid.org>, tetapi setup ini masih cukup mentah, jadi bersiaplah untuk sedikit tinkering. Kami menyambut kontribusi. Tujuannya adalah agar setup ini menjadi cukup generik sehingga maintainer repo apa pun yang kompatibel dengan F-Droid dapat menggunakannya sebagai rebuilder."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verifying downloaded F-Droid.apk"
msgstr "Memverifikasi F-Droid.apk yang diunduh"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "Some details on this can be found in our documentation at [Release Channels and Signing Keys](../Release_Channels_and_Signing_Keys). To make it easier to understand for non-devs, here are the steps in short:"
msgstr ""
"Detailnya dapat ditemukan di dokumentasi kami, [Saluran Rilis dan Kunci Tanda Tangan](../Release_Channels_and_Signing_Keys).  \n"
"Untuk memudahkan bagi pengguna non-developer, berikut langkah singkatnya:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "download [https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc](https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc) and [https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk](https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk)"
msgstr "unduh [https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc](https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc) dan [https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk](https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "load the public key for `admin@f-droid.org`"
msgstr "muat public key untuk `admin@f-droid.org`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "compare the fingerprint with what the documentation mentioned above states"
msgstr "bandingkan fingerprint dengan apa yang dinyatakan oleh dokumentasi di atas"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "verify the file"
msgstr "Lakukan proses verifikasi file."

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
msgid "On Linux, this is what it would look like:"
msgstr "Di Linux, tampilannya seperti ini:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: _docs/Verifying_Downloaded_APK.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# download the files\n"
"wget -q https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc\n"
"wget -q https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk\n"
"# load the public key\n"
"gpg --keyserver keyserver.ubuntu.com --recv-key 37D2C98789D8311948394E3E41E7044E1DBA2E89\n"
"# verify the file\n"
"gpg --verify F-Droid.apk.asc F-Droid.apk\n"
msgstr ""
"# download the files\n"
"wget -q https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk.asc\n"
"wget -q https://f-droid.org/F-Droid.apk\n"
"# load the public key\n"
"gpg --keyserver keyserver.ubuntu.com --recv-key 37D2C98789D8311948394E3E41E7044E1DBA2E89\n"
"# verify the file\n"
"gpg --verify F-Droid.apk.asc F-Droid.apk\n"

