#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add pre-installed repositories to your custom Android distribution"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "If you are publishing an Android distribution, you can add some extra pre-installed repositories to the F-Droid app which otherwise only includes the official F-Droid repository."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "If you wanted to add the repository of the Guardian Project for example, you could add the following JSON file to one of the following locations of your choice:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "`/system_ext/etc/fdroid/additional_repos.json`"
msgstr "`/system_ext/etc/fdroid/additional_repos.json`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "`/product/etc/fdroid/additional_repos.json`"
msgstr "`/product/etc/fdroid/additional_repos.json`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "`/vendor/etc/fdroid/additional_repos.json`"
msgstr "`/vendor/etc/fdroid/additional_repos.json`"

#. type: Title ####
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Important warning"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "The old method of adding repositories using an XML file will not work in F-Droid 2.0. We suggest to ship both, the JSON and the XML file as soon as possible until F-Droid 2.0 has stabilized."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basic vs Full Product Flavors"
msgstr "Basic vs Full Product Flavors"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "F-Droid itself already has two flavors built-in: _basic_ and _full_.  _full_ is the app known as _F-Droid_, while _basic_ is the most minimal possible version of the app that still provides the core app store functionality.  Since those are in a separate _flavorDimension_, the added customizations will apply to both.  Choosing which one to build is done by specifying the \"Build Variant\" in Android Studio, and the _gradle_ target, .e.g `./gradlew assembleMycompanyFullDebug`."
msgstr "F-Droid sendiri sudah memiliki dua flavor bawaan: _basic_ dan _full_. _full_ adalah aplikasi yang dikenal sebagai _F-Droid_, sedangkan _basic_ adalah versi aplikasi yang paling minimal yang masih menyediakan fungsi inti app store. Karena keduanya berada dalam _flavorDimension_ terpisah, kustomisasi yang ditambahkan akan berlaku untuk keduanya. Pemilihan mana yang akan dibangun dilakukan dengan menentukan \"Build Variant\" di Android Studio, dan target _gradle_, misalnya `./gradlew assembleMycompanyFullDebug`."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customizations"
msgstr "Kustomisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
msgid "When using gradle build flavors, it is very easy to customize any of the XML files. So this is the recommended way to start with customizing your build of F-Droid. Any XML file in _app/src/main/res_ can be overridden by placing an XML with the same name in _app/src/mycompany/res_."
msgstr "Saat menggunakan gradle build flavor, sangat mudah untuk menyesuaikan file XML apa pun. Jadi ini adalah cara yang direkomendasikan untuk mulai menyesuaikan build F-Droid Anda. File XML apa pun di _app/src/main/res_ dapat dioverride dengan menempatkan XML dengan nama yang sama di _app/src/mycompany/res_."

#. type: Title ###
#: _docs/Whitelabel_Builds.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
